[{"_1":2},"routes/llms-full",{"_3":4},"data","# 算术 (/docs/cleo/gta3/arith)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 整数加 [#整数加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8E\" name=\"INT_ADD\">\n  整数加。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8E INT_ADD\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intAdd(1, 2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_ADD\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数减 [#整数减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8F\" name=\"INT_SUB\">\n  整数减。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8F INT_SUB\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intSub(5, 3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_SUB\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数乘 [#整数乘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A90\" name=\"INT_MUL\">\n  整数乘。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A90 INT_MUL\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intMul(3, 4)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_MUL\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数除 [#整数除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A91\" name=\"INT_DIV\">\n  整数除。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A91 INT_DIV\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intDiv(10, 2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_DIV\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按位与 [#按位与]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F9\" name=\"BIT_AND\">\n  按位与。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F9 BIT_AND\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitAnd(0xFF, 0x0F)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_AND\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按位或 [#按位或]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FA\" name=\"BIT_OR\">\n  按位或。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FA BIT_OR\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitOr(1, 2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_OR\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按位异或 [#按位异或]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FB\" name=\"BIT_XOR\">\n  按位异或。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FB BIT_XOR\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitXor(1, 3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_XOR\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按位取反 [#按位取反]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FC\" name=\"BIT_NOT\">\n  按位取反。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FC BIT_NOT\n      in: a\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitNot(0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_NOT\", a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取模 [#取模]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FD\" name=\"BIT_MOD\">\n  取模。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FD BIT_MOD\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitMod(10, 3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_MOD\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 右移 [#右移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FE\" name=\"BIT_SHR\">\n  右移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FE BIT_SHR\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitShr(8, 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_SHR\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 左移 [#左移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FF\" name=\"BIT_SHL\">\n  左移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FF BIT_SHL\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = bitShl(1, 3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"BIT_SHL\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 动态库 DynamicLibrary (/docs/cleo/gta3/dll)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 加载动态库 [#加载动态库]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA2\" name=\"LOAD_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY\" member=\"DynamicLibrary.Load\">\n  加载 DLL。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA2 LOAD_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY\n      in: fileName\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local mod = loadDynamicLibrary(\"kernel32.dll\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DynamicLibrary.load(fileName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 卸载动态库 [#卸载动态库]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA3\" name=\"FREE_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY\" member=\"DynamicLibrary.Free\">\n  卸载。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA3 FREE_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freeDynamicLibrary(mod)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DynamicLibrary.free(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取导出过程地址 [#取导出过程地址]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA4\" name=\"GET_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY_PROCEDURE\" member=\"DynamicLibrary.GetProcedure\">\n  取导出地址。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA4 GET_DYNAMIC_LIBRARY_PROCEDURE\n      in: procName, self\n      out: address\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local addr = getDynamicLibraryProcedure(\"GetTickCount\", mod)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = DynamicLibrary.getProcedure(procName, self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 实体 Entity (/docs/cleo/gta3/entity)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 玩家是否在船 [#玩家是否在船]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A8\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_BOAT\" member=\"Player.IsInAnyBoat\">\n  玩家是否在船上。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A8 IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_BOAT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isPlayerInAnyBoat(player) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Player.isInAnyBoat(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否在直升机 [#玩家是否在直升机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AA\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_HELI\" member=\"Player.IsInAnyHeli\">\n  玩家是否在直升机。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AA IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_HELI\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isPlayerInAnyHeli(player) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Player.isInAnyHeli(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体偏移世界坐标 [#物体偏移世界坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C2\" name=\"GET_OFFSET_FROM_OBJECT_IN_WORLD_COORDS\" member=\"Object.GetOffsetInWorldCoords\">\n  物体局部偏移 → 世界坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C2 GET_OFFSET_FROM_OBJECT_IN_WORLD_COORDS\n      in: self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getOffsetFromObjectInWorldCoords(obj, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [x, y, z] = Object.getOffsetInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 载具偏移世界坐标 [#载具偏移世界坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C3\" name=\"GET_OFFSET_FROM_CAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\" member=\"Car.GetOffsetInWorldCoords\">\n  载具局部偏移 → 世界坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C3 GET_OFFSET_FROM_CAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\n      in: self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getOffsetFromCarInWorldCoords(car, 0.0, 2.0, 0.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [x, y, z] = Car.getOffsetInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 角色偏移世界坐标 [#角色偏移世界坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C4\" name=\"GET_OFFSET_FROM_CHAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\" member=\"Char.GetOffsetInWorldCoords\">\n  角色局部偏移 → 世界坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C4 GET_OFFSET_FROM_CHAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\n      in: self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getOffsetFromCharInWorldCoords(ped, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [x, y, z] = Char.getOffsetInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 载具档位数 [#载具档位数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB7\" name=\"GET_CAR_NUMBER_OF_GEARS\" member=\"Car.GetNumberOfGears\">\n  取档位数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB7 GET_CAR_NUMBER_OF_GEARS\n      in: self\n      out: numGear\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local n = getCarNumberOfGears(car)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const numGear = Car.getNumberOfGears(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前档位 [#当前档位]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB8\" name=\"GET_CAR_CURRENT_GEAR\" member=\"Car.GetCurrentGear\">\n  取当前档。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB8 GET_CAR_CURRENT_GEAR\n      in: self\n      out: gear\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local g = getCarCurrentGear(car)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const gear = Car.getCurrentGear(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车灯是否开 [#车灯是否开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ABD\" name=\"IS_CAR_LIGHTS_ON\" member=\"Car.IsLightsOn\">\n  车灯是否开。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ABD IS_CAR_LIGHTS_ON\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isCarLightsOn(car) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Car.isLightsOn(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 引擎是否开 [#引擎是否开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ABE\" name=\"IS_CAR_ENGINE_ON\" member=\"Car.IsEngineOn\">\n  引擎是否开。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ABE IS_CAR_ENGINE_ON\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isCarEngineOn(car) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Car.isEngineOn(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开/关引擎 [#开关引擎]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ABF\" name=\"SET_CAR_ENGINE_ON\" member=\"Car.SetEngineOn\">\n  开/关引擎。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ABF SET_CAR_ENGINE_ON\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEngineOn(car, true)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEngineOn(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 作弊刷车 [#作弊刷车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADD\" name=\"SPAWN_VEHICLE_BY_CHEATING\" member=\"World.SpawnVehicleByCheating\">\n  在玩家前刷车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADD SPAWN_VEHICLE_BY_CHEATING\n      in: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      spawnVehicleByCheating(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      World.spawnVehicleByCheating(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 球内随机角色 [#球内随机角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE1\" name=\"GET_RANDOM_CHAR_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\" member=\"World.GetRandomCharInSphereNoSaveRecursive\">\n  球内取角色。经典别名 `05EF`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE1 GET_RANDOM_CHAR_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\n      in: x, y, z, radius, findNext, skipDead\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05EF\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ped = getRandomCharInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, 20.0, false, true)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = World.getRandomCharInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, radius, findNext, skipDead)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 球内随机载具 [#球内随机载具]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE2\" name=\"GET_RANDOM_CAR_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\" member=\"World.GetRandomCarInSphereNoSaveRecursive\">\n  球内取载具。经典别名 `05F0`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE2 GET_RANDOM_CAR_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\n      in: x, y, z, radius, findNext, skipWrecked\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05F0\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local car = getRandomCarInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, 30.0, false, true)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = World.getRandomCarInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, radius, findNext, skipWrecked)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 球内随机物体 [#球内随机物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE3\" name=\"GET_RANDOM_OBJECT_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\" member=\"World.GetRandomObjectInSphereNoSaveRecursive\">\n  球内取物体。经典别名 `05F1`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE3 GET_RANDOM_OBJECT_IN_SPHERE_NO_SAVE_RECURSIVE\n      in: x, y, z, radius, findNext\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05F1\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local obj = getRandomObjectInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, 10.0, false)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = World.getRandomObjectInSphereNoSaveRecursive(x, y, z, radius, findNext)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 载具模型名 [#载具模型名]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADB\" name=\"GET_NAME_OF_VEHICLE_MODEL\" member=\"Streaming.GetNameOfVehicleModel\">\n  取载具模型名。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADB GET_NAME_OF_VEHICLE_MODEL\n      in: modelId\n      out: carName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local name = getNameOfVehicleModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const carName = Streaming.getNameOfVehicleModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否在飞行载具 [#玩家是否在飞行载具]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C9\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_IN_FLYING_VEHICLE\" member=\"Player.IsInFlyingVehicle\">\n  玩家是否在飞机/直升机上。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C9 IS_PLAYER_IN_FLYING_VEHICLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isPlayerInFlyingVehicle(player) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Player.isInFlyingVehicle(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取角色护甲 [#取角色护甲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04DD\" name=\"GET_CHAR_ARMOUR\" member=\"Char.GetArmour\">\n  取角色护甲值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04DD GET_CHAR_ARMOUR\n      in: self\n      out: armour\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local armour = getCharArmour(ped)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const armour = Char.getArmour(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 武器类型转模型 [#武器类型转模型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0604\" name=\"GET_WEAPONTYPE_MODEL\" member=\"Weapon.GetModel\">\n  武器类型 → 模型 id。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0604 GET_WEAPONTYPE_MODEL\n      in: weaponType\n      out: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local model = getWeapontypeModel(weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const modelId = Weapon.getModel(weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 模型转武器类型 [#模型转武器类型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0605\" name=\"GET_WEAPONTYPE_FOR_MODEL\" member=\"Weapon.GetTypeForModel\">\n  武器模型 id → 武器类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0605 GET_WEAPONTYPE_FOR_MODEL\n      in: modelId\n      out: weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local w = getWeapontypeForModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const weaponType = Weapon.getTypeForModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相机宽屏模式 [#相机宽屏模式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0603\" name=\"IS_CAMERA_IN_WIDESCREEN_MODE\" member=\"Camera.IsInWidescreenMode\">\n  相机是否宽屏模式。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0603 IS_CAMERA_IN_WIDESCREEN_MODE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isCameraInWidescreenMode() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Camera.isInWidescreenMode()) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 播放动画 [#播放动画]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0673\" name=\"PLAY_ANIMATION\" member=\"Char.PlayAnimation\">\n  让角色播动画组里的动作；`blend` 控制过渡。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0673 PLAY_ANIMATION\n      in: self, groupId, animId, blend\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playAnimation(ped, groupId, animId, 4.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.playAnimation(self, groupId, animId, blend)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 文件 File / Fs (/docs/cleo/gta3/file)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 设工作目录 [#设工作目录]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A99\" name=\"SET_CURRENT_DIRECTORY\" member=\"Fs.SetCurrentDirectory\">\n  设工作目录。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A99 SET_CURRENT_DIRECTORY\n      in: path\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCurrentDirectory(0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fs.setCurrentDirectory(path)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 打开文件 [#打开文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9A\" name=\"OPEN_FILE\" member=\"File.Open\">\n  打开文件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9A OPEN_FILE\n      in: filePathName, mode\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local f = openFile(\"cleo/data.txt\", \"rb\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = File.open(filePathName, mode)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关闭文件 [#关闭文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9B\" name=\"CLOSE_FILE\" member=\"File.Close\">\n  关闭文件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9B CLOSE_FILE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      closeFile(f)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.close(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 文件大小 [#文件大小]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9C\" name=\"GET_FILE_SIZE\" member=\"File.GetSize\">\n  文件大小。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9C GET_FILE_SIZE\n      in: self\n      out: size\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local size = getFileSize(f)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const size = File.getSize(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 读文件 [#读文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9D\" name=\"READ_FROM_FILE\" member=\"File.Read\">\n  读字节。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9D READ_FROM_FILE\n      in: self, size\n      out: destination\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local data = readFromFile(f, 4)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const destination = File.read(self, size)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 写文件 [#写文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9E\" name=\"WRITE_TO_FILE\" member=\"File.Write\">\n  写字节。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9E WRITE_TO_FILE\n      in: self, size, source\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      writeToFile(f, 4, data)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.write(self, size, source)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 文件是否存在 [#文件是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AAB\" name=\"DOES_FILE_EXIST\" member=\"Fs.DoesFileExist\">\n  文件是否存在。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AAB DOES_FILE_EXIST\n      in: path\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if doesFileExist(\"cleo/a.ini\") then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Fs.doesFileExist(path)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 文件指针移动 [#文件指针移动]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD5\" name=\"FILE_SEEK\" member=\"File.Seek\">\n  移动文件指针。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD5 FILE_SEEK\n      in: self, offset, origin\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fileSeek(f, 0, 0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.seek(self, offset, origin)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否到文件尾 [#是否到文件尾]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD6\" name=\"IS_END_OF_FILE_REACHED\" member=\"File.IsEndReached\">\n  是否 EOF。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD6 IS_END_OF_FILE_REACHED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isEndOfFileReached(f) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (File.isEndReached(self)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 读字符串 [#读字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD7\" name=\"READ_STRING_FROM_FILE\" member=\"File.ReadString\">\n  读一行字符串。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD7 READ_STRING_FROM_FILE\n      in: self, storeTo, maxLength\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      readStringFromFile(f, buf, 128)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.readString(self, storeTo, maxLength)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 写字符串 [#写字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD8\" name=\"WRITE_STRING_TO_FILE\" member=\"File.WriteString\">\n  写字符串。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD8 WRITE_STRING_TO_FILE\n      in: self, source\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      writeStringToFile(f, \"line\\n\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.writeString(self, source)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化写文件 [#格式化写文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD9\" name=\"WRITE_FORMATTED_STRING_TO_FILE\" member=\"File.WriteFormattedString\">\n  格式化写文件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD9 WRITE_FORMATTED_STRING_TO_FILE\n      in: self, format, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      writeFormattedStringToFile(f, \"%d\", 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      File.writeFormattedString(self, format, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 扫描文件 [#扫描文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADA\" name=\"SCAN_FILE\" member=\"File.Scan\">\n  fscanf。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADA SCAN_FILE\n      in: self, format\n      out: nValues, values...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local n, a = scanFile(f, \"%d\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [nValues, ...values] = File.scan(self, format)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 目录是否存在 [#目录是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE4\" name=\"DOES_DIRECTORY_EXIST\" member=\"Fs.DoesDirectoryExist\">\n  目录是否存在。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE4 DOES_DIRECTORY_EXIST\n      in: path\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if doesDirectoryExist(\"cleo\") then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Fs.doesDirectoryExist(path)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 创建目录 [#创建目录]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE5\" name=\"CREATE_DIRECTORY\" member=\"Fs.CreateDirectory\">\n  创建目录。条件表示是否成功。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE5 CREATE_DIRECTORY\n      in: path\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      createDirectory(\"cleo/out\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fs.createDirectory(path)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 查找首个文件 [#查找首个文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE6\" name=\"FIND_FIRST_FILE\" member=\"FindFile.First\">\n  通配找第一个匹配项，返回查找句柄和名字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE6 FIND_FIRST_FILE\n      in: searchMask\n      out: handle, fileName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local h, name = findFirstFile(\"cleo/*.cs\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [handle, fileName] = FindFile.first(searchMask)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 查找下一个文件 [#查找下一个文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE7\" name=\"FIND_NEXT_FILE\" member=\"FindFile.Next\">\n  继续 `FIND_FIRST_FILE`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE7 FIND_NEXT_FILE\n      in: self\n      out: fileName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local name = findNextFile(h)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const fileName = FindFile.next(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关闭查找 [#关闭查找]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE8\" name=\"FIND_CLOSE\" member=\"FindFile.Close\">\n  关闭查找句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE8 FIND_CLOSE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      findClose(h)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      FindFile.close(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 游戏 Game / Pad (/docs/cleo/gta3/game)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 是否 PC 版 [#是否-pc-版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0485\" name=\"IS_PC_VERSION\" member=\"Game.IsPcVersion\">\n  是否 PC 版。用在 `if` 里（扩展表收录）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0485 IS_PC_VERSION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isPcVersion() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Game.isPcVersion()) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否澳大利亚版 [#是否澳大利亚版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"059A\" name=\"IS_AUSTRALIAN_GAME\" member=\"Game.IsAustralian\">\n  是否澳大利亚发行版。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      059A IS_AUSTRALIAN_GAME\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isAustralianGame() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Game.isAustralian()) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取游戏版本 [#取游戏版本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05E5\" name=\"GET_GAME_VERSION\" member=\"Game.GetVersion\">\n  取版本 id。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05E5 GET_GAME_VERSION\n      out: versionId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ver = getGameVersion()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const versionId = Game.getVersion()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否原版 [#是否原版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA9\" name=\"IS_GAME_VERSION_ORIGINAL\" member=\"Game.IsVersionOriginal\">\n  是否原版 1.0。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA9 IS_GAME_VERSION_ORIGINAL\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isGameVersionOriginal() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Game.isVersionOriginal()) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 键是否按下 [#键是否按下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB0\" name=\"IS_KEY_PRESSED\" member=\"Pad.IsKeyPressed\">\n  键是否按下。经典别名 `05EE`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB0 IS_KEY_PRESSED\n      in: keyCode\n      // 经典别名 05EE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isKeyPressed(0x20) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Pad.isKeyPressed(keyCode)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 测试作弊串 [#测试作弊串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADC\" name=\"TEST_CHEAT\" member=\"Pad.TestCheat\">\n  是否输入了指定作弊串。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADC TEST_CHEAT\n      in: input\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if testCheat(\"GUNSGUNS\") then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Pad.testCheat(input)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 手柄键灵敏度 [#手柄键灵敏度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0601\" name=\"IS_BUTTON_PRESSED_WITH_SENSITIVITY\" member=\"Pad.IsButtonPressedWithSensitivity\">\n  手柄键是否按到指定灵敏度。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0601 IS_BUTTON_PRESSED_WITH_SENSITIVITY\n      in: buttonId, sensitivity\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isButtonPressedWithSensitivity(button, 200) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Pad.isButtonPressedWithSensitivity(buttonId, sensitivity)) {}\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 模拟手柄键 [#模拟手柄键]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0602\" name=\"EMULATE_BUTTON_PRESS_WITH_SENSITIVITY\" member=\"Pad.EmulateButtonPressWithSensitivity\">\n  模拟按下手柄键到指定灵敏度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0602 EMULATE_BUTTON_PRESS_WITH_SENSITIVITY\n      in: buttonId, sensitivity\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      emulateButtonPressWithSensitivity(button, 255)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Pad.emulateButtonPressWithSensitivity(buttonId, sensitivity)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前天气 [#当前天气]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0607\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_WEATHER\" member=\"Weather.GetCurrent\">\n  取当前天气 id。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0607 GET_CURRENT_WEATHER\n      out: weatherType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local w = getCurrentWeather()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const weatherType = Weather.getCurrent()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# GTA III (/docs/cleo/gta3)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\nIII 的 CLEO 表含：\n\n* 一批补进扩展的原生命令（Player/Object 偏移等）\n* 与 VC/SA 对齐的 `05xx` 经典号 + `0Axx` 现代号\n\n页内优先现代 id；地址以 III 为准。\n\n源：`sanny-builder-library/gta3/gta3.json`\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n| 类型             | 页                                |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Memory         | [memory](/docs/cleo/gta3/memory) |\n| 算术             | [arith](/docs/cleo/gta3/arith)   |\n| 自定义脚本          | [script](/docs/cleo/gta3/script) |\n| File / Fs      | [file](/docs/cleo/gta3/file)     |\n| DynamicLibrary | [dll](/docs/cleo/gta3/dll)       |\n| Game / Pad     | [game](/docs/cleo/gta3/game)     |\n| Entity         | [entity](/docs/cleo/gta3/entity) |\n| Text           | [text](/docs/cleo/gta3/text)     |\n| Math           | [math](/docs/cleo/gta3/math)     |\n| 杂项             | [misc](/docs/cleo/gta3/misc)     |\n\n\n# 数学 Math (/docs/cleo/gta3/math)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 幂 [#幂]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AEE\" name=\"POW\" member=\"Math.Pow\">\n  幂。经典别名 `05F3`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AEE POW\n      in: number, power\n      out: result\n      // 经典别名 05F3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = pow(2.0, 8.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = Math.pow(number, power)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 对数 [#对数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AEF\" name=\"LOG\" member=\"Math.Log\">\n  对数。经典别名 `05F4`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AEF LOG\n      in: number, base\n      out: result\n      // 经典别名 05F4\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = log(100.0, 10.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = Math.log(number, base)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 内存 Memory (/docs/cleo/gta3/memory)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n与 VC/SA 同名；经典 `05DF`–`05EC` 等为别名。示例地址用 III。\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 写内存 [#写内存]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8C\" name=\"WRITE_MEMORY\" member=\"Memory.Write\">\n  按 1/2/4 字节往地址写；`vp` 要改内存保护时再开。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8C WRITE_MEMORY\n      in: address, size, value, vp\n      // 经典别名 05DF\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      writeMemory(0x8F2C68, 4, 1, true)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Memory.write(address, size, value, vp)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 读内存 [#读内存]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8D\" name=\"READ_MEMORY\" member=\"Memory.Read\">\n  从地址按宽度读。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8D READ_MEMORY\n      in: address, size, vp\n      out: result\n      // 经典别名 05E0\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local v = readMemory(0x8F2C68, 4, false)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = Memory.read(address, size, vp)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调函数 [#调函数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA5\" name=\"CALL_FUNCTION\" member=\"Memory.CallFunction\">\n  调原生函数。`pop=0` stdcall；`pop=numArgs` cdecl。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA5 CALL_FUNCTION\n      in: address, numArgs, pop, args...\n      // 经典别名 05E1\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      callFunction(fn, 1, 1, arg0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Memory.callFunction(address, numArgs, pop, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调方法 [#调方法]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA6\" name=\"CALL_METHOD\" member=\"Memory.CallMethod\">\n  thiscall。`pop` 固定 0。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA6 CALL_METHOD\n      in: address, struct, numArgs, pop, args...\n      // 经典别名 05E3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      callMethod(fn, thisPtr, 0, 0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Memory.callMethod(address, struct, numArgs, pop, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调函数取返回值 [#调函数取返回值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA7\" name=\"CALL_FUNCTION_RETURN\" member=\"Memory.CallFunctionReturn\">\n  同 `0AA5` 并取返回值。经典别名 `05E2`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA7 CALL_FUNCTION_RETURN\n      in: address, numArgs, pop, args...\n      out: funcRet\n      // 经典别名 05E2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ret = callFunctionReturn(fn, 0, 0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const funcRet = Memory.callFunctionReturn(address, numArgs, pop, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调方法取返回值 [#调方法取返回值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA8\" name=\"CALL_METHOD_RETURN\" member=\"Memory.CallMethodReturn\">\n  同 `0AA6` 并取返回值。经典别名 `05E4`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA8 CALL_METHOD_RETURN\n      in: address, struct, numArgs, pop, args...\n      out: funcRet\n      // 经典别名 05E4\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ret = callMethodReturn(fn, thisPtr, 0, 0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const funcRet = Memory.callMethodReturn(address, struct, numArgs, pop, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## ped 句柄转指针 [#ped-句柄转指针]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A96\" name=\"GET_PED_POINTER\" member=\"Memory.GetPedPointer\">\n  角色句柄 → 地址。经典别名 `05E6`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A96 GET_PED_POINTER\n      in: char\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05E6\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local pedPtr = getPedPointer(playerActor)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getPedPointer(char)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 载具句柄转指针 [#载具句柄转指针]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A97\" name=\"GET_VEHICLE_POINTER\" member=\"Memory.GetVehiclePointer\">\n  载具句柄 → 地址。经典别名 `05E7`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A97 GET_VEHICLE_POINTER\n      in: handle\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05E7\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local carPtr = getVehiclePointer(car)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getVehiclePointer(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体句柄转指针 [#物体句柄转指针]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A98\" name=\"GET_OBJECT_POINTER\" member=\"Memory.GetObjectPointer\">\n  物体句柄 → 地址。经典别名 `05E8`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A98 GET_OBJECT_POINTER\n      in: object\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05E8\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local objPtr = getObjectPointer(obj)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getObjectPointer(object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前脚本结构体 [#当前脚本结构体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A9F\" name=\"GET_THIS_SCRIPT_STRUCT\" member=\"Memory.GetThisScriptStruct\">\n  当前脚本结构体。经典别名 `05EC`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A9F GET_THIS_SCRIPT_STRUCT\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05EC\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local script = getThisScriptStruct()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getThisScriptStruct()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按名取脚本结构体 [#按名取脚本结构体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AAA\" name=\"GET_SCRIPT_STRUCT_NAMED\" member=\"Memory.GetScriptStructNamed\">\n  按名找脚本结构体。经典别名 `05ED`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AAA GET_SCRIPT_STRUCT_NAMED\n      in: scriptName\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05ED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local main = getScriptStructNamed(\"MAIN\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getScriptStructNamed(scriptName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 标签指针 [#标签指针]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AC6\" name=\"GET_LABEL_POINTER\" member=\"Memory.GetLabelPointer\">\n  标签绝对地址。经典别名 `05F7`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AC6 GET_LABEL_POINTER\n      in: label\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05F7\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local addr = getLabelPointer(myFunc)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getLabelPointer(label)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 变量指针 [#变量指针]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AC7\" name=\"GET_VAR_POINTER\" member=\"Memory.GetVarPointer\">\n  变量指针。经典别名 `05F8`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AC7 GET_VAR_POINTER\n      in: var\n      out: address\n      // 经典别名 05F8\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local p = getVarPointer(someVar)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.getVarPointer(var)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 分配内存 [#分配内存]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AC8\" name=\"ALLOCATE_MEMORY\" member=\"Memory.Allocate\">\n  分配内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AC8 ALLOCATE_MEMORY\n      in: size\n      out: address\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local buf = allocateMemory(256)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const address = Memory.allocate(size)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 释放内存 [#释放内存]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AC9\" name=\"FREE_MEMORY\" member=\"Memory.Free\">\n  释放 `0AC8` 内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AC9 FREE_MEMORY\n      in: address\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freeMemory(buf)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Memory.free(address)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 弹出浮点返回值 [#弹出浮点返回值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE9\" name=\"POP_FLOAT\" member=\"Memory.PopFloat\">\n  取浮点返回值。经典别名 `05F2`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE9 POP_FLOAT\n      out: number\n      // 经典别名 05F2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local f = popFloat()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const number = Memory.popFloat()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## ped 指针转句柄 [#ped-指针转句柄]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AEA\" name=\"GET_PED_REF\" member=\"Memory.GetPedRef\">\n  ped 地址 → 句柄。经典别名 `05E9`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AEA GET_PED_REF\n      in: address\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05E9\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local h = getPedRef(pedPtr)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Memory.getPedRef(address)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 载具指针转句柄 [#载具指针转句柄]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AEB\" name=\"GET_VEHICLE_REF\" member=\"Memory.GetVehicleRef\">\n  载具地址 → 句柄。经典别名 `05EA`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AEB GET_VEHICLE_REF\n      in: address\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05EA\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local h = getVehicleRef(carPtr)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Memory.getVehicleRef(address)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体指针转句柄 [#物体指针转句柄]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AEC\" name=\"GET_OBJECT_REF\" member=\"Memory.GetObjectRef\">\n  物体地址 → 句柄。经典别名 `05EB`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AEC GET_OBJECT_REF\n      in: address\n      out: handle\n      // 经典别名 05EB\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local h = getObjectRef(objPtr)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Memory.getObjectRef(address)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设内存偏移 [#设内存偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0606\" name=\"SET_MEMORY_OFFSET\" member=\"Memory.SetOffset\">\n  算 `address1` 相对 `address2` 的偏移，写回 `address1`。`vp` 要改保护时再开。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0606 SET_MEMORY_OFFSET\n      in: address1, address2, vp\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMemoryOffset(dst, base, true)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Memory.setOffset(address1, address2, vp)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 杂项 (/docs/cleo/gta3/misc)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n* 有 class 的已分到类型页（含 file find、III 原生 Player/Char/Game）\n* classic / modern 双 id 只文档 modern\n* 完整表：`gta3.json` → `CLEO`\n\n\n# 自定义脚本 (/docs/cleo/gta3/script)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 流式加载自定义脚本 [#流式加载自定义脚本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A92\" name=\"STREAM_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\">\n  加载 SCM 并启动自定义脚本。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A92 STREAM_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\n      in: scriptFileName, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      streamCustomScript(\"./helper.s\", 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"STREAM_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\", scriptFileName, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束当前自定义脚本 [#结束当前自定义脚本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A93\" name=\"TERMINATE_THIS_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\">\n  结束当前自定义脚本。经典别名 `05DC`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A93 TERMINATE_THIS_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\n      // 经典别名 05DC\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      terminateThisCustomScript()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"TERMINATE_THIS_CUSTOM_SCRIPT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按名结束自定义脚本 [#按名结束自定义脚本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ABA\" name=\"TERMINATE_ALL_CUSTOM_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\">\n  结束指定名脚本。经典别名 `05DD`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ABA TERMINATE_ALL_CUSTOM_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\n      in: name\n      // 经典别名 05DD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      terminateAllCustomScriptsWithThisName(\"helper\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"TERMINATE_ALL_CUSTOM_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\", name)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## CLEO 调用 [#cleo-调用]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB1\" name=\"CLEO_CALL\">\n  调 SCM 子程序。经典别名 `05F5`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB1 CLEO_CALL\n      in: label, numArgs, args...\n      // 经典别名 05F5\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cleoCall(myLabel, 1, a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"CLEO_CALL\", label, numArgs, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## CLEO 返回 [#cleo-返回]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB2\" name=\"CLEO_RETURN\">\n  从 CALL 返回。经典别名 `05F6`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB2 CLEO_RETURN\n      in: numRet, retParams...\n      // 经典别名 05F6\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cleoReturn(0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"CLEO_RETURN\", numRet, ...retParams)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 写共享变量 [#写共享变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB3\" name=\"SET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\">\n  写共享变量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB3 SET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\n      in: index, value\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCleoSharedVar(0, 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\", index, value)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 读共享变量 [#读共享变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AB4\" name=\"GET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\">\n  读共享变量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AB4 GET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\n      in: index\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local v = getCleoSharedVar(0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"GET_CLEO_SHARED_VAR\", index)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 假则 gosub [#假则-gosub]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA0\" name=\"GOSUB_IF_FALSE\">\n  条件假时 gosub。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA0 GOSUB_IF_FALSE\n      in: label\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      -- Lua 侧用 if\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GOSUB_IF_FALSE\", label)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 假则 return [#假则-return]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AA1\" name=\"RETURN_IF_FALSE\">\n  条件假时 return。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AA1 RETURN_IF_FALSE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      -- Lua 侧用 if\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"RETURN_IF_FALSE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 文本 Text (/docs/cleo/gta3/text)\n\n\n\n`gta3` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 显示字符串 [#显示字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0608\" name=\"DISPLAY_TEXT_STRING\" member=\"Text.DisplayString\">\n  在屏幕坐标画字符串（本帧绘制类）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0608 DISPLAY_TEXT_STRING\n      in: screenX, screenY, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayTextString(100.0, 50.0, \"hi\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.displayString(screenX, screenY, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化显示字 [#格式化显示字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0609\" name=\"DISPLAY_TEXT_FORMATTED\" member=\"Text.DisplayFormatted\">\n  屏幕坐标 + 格式化参数画字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0609 DISPLAY_TEXT_FORMATTED\n      in: screenX, screenY, text, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayTextFormatted(100.0, 50.0, \"hp %d\", 100)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.displayFormatted(screenX, screenY, text, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 帮助字符串 [#帮助字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACA\" name=\"PRINT_HELP_STRING\" member=\"Text.PrintHelpString\">\n  黑框帮助字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACA PRINT_HELP_STRING\n      in: text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printHelpString(\"hello\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printHelpString(text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 大字字符串 [#大字字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACB\" name=\"PRINT_BIG_STRING\" member=\"Text.PrintBigString\">\n  大字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACB PRINT_BIG_STRING\n      in: text, time, style\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printBigString(\"OK\", 5000, 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printBigString(text, time, style)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 字幕字符串 [#字幕字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACC\" name=\"PRINT_STRING\" member=\"Text.PrintString\">\n  字幕队列。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACC PRINT_STRING\n      in: text, time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printString(\"msg\", 2000)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printString(text, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 立刻显示字 [#立刻显示字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACD\" name=\"PRINT_STRING_NOW\" member=\"Text.PrintStringNow\">\n  立刻显示。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACD PRINT_STRING_NOW\n      in: text, time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printStringNow(\"now\", 1000)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printStringNow(text, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化帮助 [#格式化帮助]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACE\" name=\"PRINT_HELP_FORMATTED\" member=\"Text.PrintHelpFormatted\">\n  帮助 + printf。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACE PRINT_HELP_FORMATTED\n      in: text, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printHelpFormatted(\"%d\", 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printHelpFormatted(text, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化大字 [#格式化大字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ACF\" name=\"PRINT_BIG_FORMATTED\" member=\"Text.PrintBigFormatted\">\n  大字 + 格式化。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ACF PRINT_BIG_FORMATTED\n      in: format, time, style, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printBigFormatted(\"%d\", 3000, 1, 9)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printBigFormatted(format, time, style, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化字幕 [#格式化字幕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD0\" name=\"PRINT_FORMATTED\" member=\"Text.PrintFormatted\">\n  格式化进队列。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD0 PRINT_FORMATTED\n      in: format, time, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printFormatted(\"%d\", 1500, 1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printFormatted(format, time, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 立刻格式化字 [#立刻格式化字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD1\" name=\"PRINT_FORMATTED_NOW\" member=\"Text.PrintFormattedNow\">\n  格式化立刻显示。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD1 PRINT_FORMATTED_NOW\n      in: format, time, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      printFormattedNow(\"%d\", 1000, 2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.printFormattedNow(format, time, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格式化到缓冲 [#格式化到缓冲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD3\" name=\"STRING_FORMAT\" member=\"Text.StringFormat\">\n  写格式化串到缓冲。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD3 STRING_FORMAT\n      in: result, format, args...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      stringFormat(buf, \"%d\", 7)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.stringFormat(result, format, ...args)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 扫描字符串 [#扫描字符串]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AD4\" name=\"SCAN_STRING\" member=\"Text.ScanString\">\n  sscanf。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AD4 SCAN_STRING\n      in: string, format\n      out: nValues, values...\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local n, a = scanString(\"1\", \"%d\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const [nValues, ...values] = Text.scanString(string, format)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## GXT 键取文本 [#gxt-键取文本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADE\" name=\"GET_TEXT_LABEL_STRING\" member=\"Text.GetLabelString\">\n  GXT 键 → 文本。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADE GET_TEXT_LABEL_STRING\n      in: key\n      out: text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local t = getTextLabelString(\"DUMMY\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const text = Text.getLabelString(key)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 添加动态 GXT [#添加动态-gxt]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0ADF\" name=\"ADD_TEXT_LABEL\" member=\"Text.AddLabel\">\n  动态 GXT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0ADF ADD_TEXT_LABEL\n      in: dynamicKey, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addTextLabel(\"MYKEY\", \"hi\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.addLabel(dynamicKey, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除文本键 [#删除文本键]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0AE0\" name=\"REMOVE_TEXT_LABEL\" member=\"Text.RemoveLabel\">\n  删 GXT 键。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0AE0 REMOVE_TEXT_LABEL\n      in: key\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeTextLabel(\"MYKEY\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Text.removeLabel(key)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 综述 (/docs/cleo)\n\n\n\n脚本侧 **opcode 调用** 文档。\n\n源数据：[sanny-builder-library](https://github.com/sannybuilder/library)（`sa.json` / docs / snippets）。\n\nOP · CLEO Lua · CLEO Redux **同源** SBL Script 表，不是外站另一套 API。\n\n<Callout type=\"warn\" title=\"与插件的边界\">\n  这里是 **opcode**（Lua / Redux / OP 文本）。C++ 的 `plugin::Command` 见 [插件 · Command](/docs/plugins/commands)。\n</Callout>\n\n## 本站覆盖 [#本站覆盖]\n\n| 状态                | 内容                                                                                                             |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **语法**            | [OP / Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) · [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)                                               |\n| **已齐 · SA**       | CLEO 类型页 · [default](/docs/cleo/sa/default)（含 misc 879）· [CLEO+](/docs/cleo/sa/plus) · [扩展](/docs/cleo/sa/ext) |\n| **已齐 · VC / III** | [VC](/docs/cleo/vc) · [GTA III](/docs/cleo/gta3)                                                               |\n| **未收录**           | `native.json` Code 全文                                                                                          |\n| **别混**            | C++ ASI 在 [插件](/docs/plugins)                                                                                  |\n\n完整表仍以 [library.sannybuilder.com](https://library.sannybuilder.com/#/sa) 为准。\n\n## 怎么读 [#怎么读]\n\n```\n装 CLEO（+ 需要时 CLEO+ / 扩展）\n  → 写 .lua 或 Redux 脚本\n  → 调本站按表列出的 op\n```\n\n| 页                                     | 内容                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| [语法 · OP / Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax)    | 三种形态、Lua 约定                     |\n| [语法 · Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux) | JS 调用、`enums.js`、native 边界      |\n| [SA · Memory](/docs/cleo/sa/memory)   | 读写内存、指针、调用原生                    |\n| [SA · default](/docs/cleo/sa/default) | SCM 原生按 class                   |\n| [SA · CLEO+](/docs/cleo/sa/plus)      | CLEO+ 扩展                        |\n| [SA · 其它扩展](/docs/cleo/sa/ext)        | NewOpcodes / SAMPFUNCS / imgui… |\n| [VC](/docs/cleo/vc)                   | Vice City CLEO 类型页              |\n| [GTA III](/docs/cleo/gta3)            | III CLEO 类型页                    |\n\n## 分工 [#分工]\n\n```\nplugins/  → ASI + plugin-sdk\ncleo/     → opcode（OP + Lua + Redux 调用形态）\n```\n\n## 导航 [#导航]\n\n<Cards>\n  <Card title=\"OP / Lua 语法\" href=\"/docs/cleo/syntax\" description=\"三种形态与 Lua 约定\" />\n\n  <Card title=\"Redux 语法\" href=\"/docs/cleo/syntax-redux\" description=\"Class.member / native\" />\n\n  <Card title=\"Memory\" href=\"/docs/cleo/sa/memory\" description=\"读写内存与原生调用\" />\n\n  <Card title=\"插件\" href=\"/docs/plugins\" description=\"C++ ASI 侧\" />\n</Cards>\n\n\n# 算术 (/docs/cleo/sa/arith)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `CLEO` · 需 CLEO\n\n整数 / 浮点基本运算。Lua 里多数可直接用 `+ - * /`；下列为对应 opcode。\n\n写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 整数加 [#整数加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8E\" name=\"INT_ADD\">\n  两整数相加。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8E INT_ADD\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intAdd(1, 2)\n      -- 或 r = 1 + 2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_ADD\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数减 [#整数减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A8F\" name=\"INT_SUB\">\n  整数减法。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A8F INT_SUB\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intSub(5, 3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_SUB\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数乘 [#整数乘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A90\" name=\"INT_MUL\">\n  整数乘法。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A90 INT_MUL\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intMul(3, 4)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_MUL\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整数除 [#整数除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A91\" name=\"INT_DIV\">\n  整数除法。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A91 INT_DIV\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = intDiv(10, 2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"INT_DIV\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 浮点乘 [#浮点乘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"290B\" name=\"FLOAT_MUL\">\n  两浮点相乘。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      290B FLOAT_MUL\n      in: a, b\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local r = floatMul(1.5, 2.0)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const result = native(\"FLOAT_MUL\", a, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 吸引点 Attractor (/docs/cleo/sa/default/attractor)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 3 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 添加 [#添加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"061D\" name=\"ADD_ATTRACTOR\" member=\"Attractor.Add\">\n  添加行人吸引点（位置、朝向、关联序列）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      061D ADD_ATTRACTOR\n      in: x, y, z, angle, _p5, sequence\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addAttractor(x, y, z, angle, _p5, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Attractor.add(x, y, z, angle, _p5, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除 [#清除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"061E\" name=\"CLEAR_ATTRACTOR\" member=\"Attractor.Clear\">\n  清除吸引点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      061E CLEAR_ATTRACTOR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearAttractor(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Attractor.clear(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 允许 ped 类型 [#允许-ped-类型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0680\" name=\"ADD_PEDTYPE_AS_ATTRACTOR_USER\" member=\"Attractor.AddPedTypeAsUser\">\n  指定哪种 ped 类型可使用该吸引点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0680 ADD_PEDTYPE_AS_ATTRACTOR_USER\n      in: self, pedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addPedtypeAsAttractorUser(self, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Attractor.addPedTypeAsUser(self, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 音频 Audio (/docs/cleo/sa/default/audio)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 24 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 通关曲 [#通关曲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0394\" name=\"PLAY_MISSION_PASSED_TUNE\" member=\"Audio.PlayMissionPassedTune\">\n  播放 Audio 目录下指定 ID 通关曲。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0394 PLAY_MISSION_PASSED_TUNE\n      in: soundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playMissionPassedTune(soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.playMissionPassedTune(soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加载任务语音 [#加载任务语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03CF\" name=\"LOAD_MISSION_AUDIO\" member=\"Audio.LoadMissionAudio\">\n  加载任务语音槽。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03CF LOAD_MISSION_AUDIO\n      in: slotId, audioId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      loadMissionAudio(slotId, audioId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.loadMissionAudio(slotId, audioId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音是否加载完 [#语音是否加载完]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D0\" name=\"HAS_MISSION_AUDIO_LOADED\" member=\"Audio.HasMissionAudioLoaded\">\n  `03CF` 是否加载完。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D0 HAS_MISSION_AUDIO_LOADED\n      in: slotId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if hasMissionAudioLoaded(slotId) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Audio.hasMissionAudioLoaded(slotId)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 播放任务语音 [#播放任务语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D1\" name=\"PLAY_MISSION_AUDIO\" member=\"Audio.PlayMissionAudio\">\n  播放已加载任务语音。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D1 PLAY_MISSION_AUDIO\n      in: slotId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playMissionAudio(slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.playMissionAudio(slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音是否播完 [#语音是否播完]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D2\" name=\"HAS_MISSION_AUDIO_FINISHED\" member=\"Audio.HasMissionAudioFinished\">\n  该槽语音是否播完。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D2 HAS_MISSION_AUDIO_FINISHED\n      in: slotId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if hasMissionAudioFinished(slotId) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Audio.hasMissionAudioFinished(slotId)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音位置 [#语音位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D7\" name=\"SET_MISSION_AUDIO_POSITION\" member=\"Audio.SetMissionAudioPosition\">\n  设任务语音听感位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D7 SET_MISSION_AUDIO_POSITION\n      in: slotId, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMissionAudioPosition(slotId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.setMissionAudioPosition(slotId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清语音槽 [#清语音槽]\n\n<Opcode id=\"040D\" name=\"CLEAR_MISSION_AUDIO\" member=\"Audio.ClearMissionAudio\">\n  卸载槽语音，腾内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      040D CLEAR_MISSION_AUDIO\n      in: slotId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearMissionAudio(slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.clearMissionAudio(slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设电台 [#设电台]\n\n<Opcode id=\"041E\" name=\"SET_RADIO_CHANNEL\" member=\"Audio.SetRadioChannel\">\n  在车内时设电台。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      041E SET_RADIO_CHANNEL\n      in: channel\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setRadioChannel(channel)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.setRadioChannel(channel)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 音乐淡入淡出 [#音乐淡入淡出]\n\n<Opcode id=\"043C\" name=\"SET_MUSIC_DOES_FADE\" member=\"Audio.SetMusicDoesFade\">\n  音乐是否随画面淡入淡出。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      043C SET_MUSIC_DOES_FADE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMusicDoesFade(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.setMusicDoesFade(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取电台 [#取电台]\n\n<Opcode id=\"051E\" name=\"GET_RADIO_CHANNEL\" member=\"Audio.GetRadioChannel\">\n  当前电台。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      051E GET_RADIO_CHANNEL\n      out: channel\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local channel = getRadioChannel()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const channel = Audio.getRadioChannel()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 节拍邻近 [#节拍邻近]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07B1\" name=\"GET_BEAT_PROXIMITY\" member=\"Audio.GetBeatProximity\">\n  相对当前节拍轨（`0954`）的拍点信息。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07B1 GET_BEAT_PROXIMITY\n      in: offset\n      out: beatTime, beatType, beatIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local beatTime, beatType, beatIndex = getBeatProximity(offset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { beatTime, beatType, beatIndex } = Audio.getBeatProximity(offset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音绑角色 [#语音绑角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0949\" name=\"ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Audio.AttachMissionAudioToChar\">\n  任务语音绑在角色位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0949 ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_CHAR\n      in: slotId, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachMissionAudioToChar(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.attachMissionAudioToChar(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 预载节拍轨 [#预载节拍轨]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0952\" name=\"PRELOAD_BEAT_TRACK\" member=\"Audio.PreloadBeatTrack\">\n  预载 streams/BEATS 里的曲目。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0952 PRELOAD_BEAT_TRACK\n      in: trackId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      preloadBeatTrack(trackId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.preloadBeatTrack(trackId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 节拍轨状态 [#节拍轨状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0953\" name=\"GET_BEAT_TRACK_STATUS\" member=\"Audio.GetBeatTrackStatus\">\n  当前节拍轨状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0953 GET_BEAT_TRACK_STATUS\n      out: status\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local status = getBeatTrackStatus()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const status = Audio.getBeatTrackStatus()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 播放节拍轨 [#播放节拍轨]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0954\" name=\"PLAY_BEAT_TRACK\" member=\"Audio.PlayBeatTrack\">\n  播放 `0952` 预载的曲。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0954 PLAY_BEAT_TRACK\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playBeatTrack()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.playBeatTrack()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停节拍轨 [#停节拍轨]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0955\" name=\"STOP_BEAT_TRACK\" member=\"Audio.StopBeatTrack\">\n  停当前节拍轨。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0955 STOP_BEAT_TRACK\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      stopBeatTrack()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.stopBeatTrack()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坐标音频事件 [#坐标音频事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"097A\" name=\"REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_POSITION\" member=\"Audio.ReportMissionAudioEventAtPosition\">\n  在坐标触发任务音频事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      097A REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_POSITION\n      in: x, y, z, soundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      reportMissionAudioEventAtPosition(x, y, z, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.reportMissionAudioEventAtPosition(x, y, z, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体音频事件 [#物体音频事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"097B\" name=\"REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_OBJECT\" member=\"Audio.ReportMissionAudioEventAtObject\">\n  在物体处触发任务音频事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      097B REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_OBJECT\n      in: handle, soundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      reportMissionAudioEventAtObject(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.reportMissionAudioEventAtObject(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音绑物体 [#语音绑物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"097C\" name=\"ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_OBJECT\" member=\"Audio.AttachMissionAudioToObject\">\n  任务语音绑在物体上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      097C ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_OBJECT\n      in: slotId, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachMissionAudioToObject(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.attachMissionAudioToObject(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 暂停节拍轨 [#暂停节拍轨]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0991\" name=\"PAUSE_CURRENT_BEAT_TRACK\" member=\"Audio.PauseCurrentBeatTrack\">\n  暂停 / 恢复节拍轨。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0991 PAUSE_CURRENT_BEAT_TRACK\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      pauseCurrentBeatTrack(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.pauseCurrentBeatTrack(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 角色音频事件 [#角色音频事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F1\" name=\"REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_CHAR\" member=\"Audio.ReportMissionAudioEventAtChar\">\n  在角色处触发任务音频事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F1 REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_CHAR\n      in: handle, soundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      reportMissionAudioEventAtChar(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.reportMissionAudioEventAtChar(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车音频事件 [#车音频事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F7\" name=\"REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_CAR\" member=\"Audio.ReportMissionAudioEventAtCar\">\n  在车处触发任务音频事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F7 REPORT_MISSION_AUDIO_EVENT_AT_CAR\n      in: handle, soundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      reportMissionAudioEventAtCar(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.reportMissionAudioEventAtCar(handle, soundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语音绑车 [#语音绑车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A16\" name=\"ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_CAR\" member=\"Audio.AttachMissionAudioToCar\">\n  任务语音绑在车上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A16 ATTACH_MISSION_AUDIO_TO_CAR\n      in: slotId, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachMissionAudioToCar(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.attachMissionAudioToCar(slotId, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最爱电台 [#最爱电台]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A26\" name=\"SET_RADIO_TO_PLAYERS_FAVOURITE_STATION\" member=\"Audio.SetRadioToPlayersFavouriteStation\">\n  当前车电台切到玩家最爱台（统计 326）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A26 SET_RADIO_TO_PLAYERS_FAVOURITE_STATION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setRadioToPlayersFavouriteStation()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Audio.setRadioToPlayersFavouriteStation()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 标记 Blip (/docs/cleo/sa/default/blip)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 22 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 车旧式标记 [#车旧式标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0161\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_CAR_OLD\" member=\"Blip.AddForCarOld\">\n  给车加带颜色 / 显示模式的旧式标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0161 ADD_BLIP_FOR_CAR_OLD\n      in: vehicle, color, display\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForCarOld(vehicle, color, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForCarOld(vehicle, color, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除 [#删除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0164\" name=\"REMOVE_BLIP\" member=\"Blip.Remove\">\n  删除标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0164 REMOVE_BLIP\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeBlip(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.remove(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改颜色 [#改颜色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0165\" name=\"CHANGE_BLIP_COLOUR\" member=\"Blip.ChangeColor\">\n  改标记颜色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0165 CHANGE_BLIP_COLOUR\n      in: self, color\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeBlipColour(self, color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.changeColor(self, color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坐标旧式 [#坐标旧式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0167\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_COORD_OLD\" member=\"Blip.AddForCoordOld\">\n  坐标上旧式标记（颜色 / 显示）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0167 ADD_BLIP_FOR_COORD_OLD\n      in: x, y, z, colour, display\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForCoordOld(x, y, z, colour, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForCoordOld(x, y, z, colour, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改大小 [#改大小]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0168\" name=\"CHANGE_BLIP_SCALE\" member=\"Blip.ChangeScale\">\n  改标记大小。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0168 CHANGE_BLIP_SCALE\n      in: self, size\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeBlipScale(self, size)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.changeScale(self, size)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车标记 [#车标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0186\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_CAR\" member=\"Blip.AddForCar\">\n  给车加雷达点与 3D 标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0186 ADD_BLIP_FOR_CAR\n      in: vehicle\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForCar(vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForCar(vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 角色标记 [#角色标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0187\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_CHAR\" member=\"Blip.AddForChar\">\n  给角色加雷达点与 3D 标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0187 ADD_BLIP_FOR_CHAR\n      in: char\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForChar(char)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForChar(char)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体标记 [#物体标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0188\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_OBJECT\" member=\"Blip.AddForObject\">\n  给物体加雷达点与 3D 标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0188 ADD_BLIP_FOR_OBJECT\n      in: object\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForObject(object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForObject(object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坐标标记 [#坐标标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"018A\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_COORD\" member=\"Blip.AddForCoord\">\n  坐标雷达点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      018A ADD_BLIP_FOR_COORD\n      in: x, y, z\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForCoord(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForCoord(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 显示模式 [#显示模式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"018B\" name=\"CHANGE_BLIP_DISPLAY\" member=\"Blip.ChangeDisplay\">\n  改显示模式（仅雷达 / 仅 3D 等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      018B CHANGE_BLIP_DISPLAY\n      in: self, display\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeBlipDisplay(self, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.changeDisplay(self, display)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 联系点精灵 [#联系点精灵]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02A7\" name=\"ADD_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_CONTACT_POINT\" member=\"Blip.AddSpriteForContactPoint\">\n  联系点长距离精灵标记（任务中不显示）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02A7 ADD_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_CONTACT_POINT\n      in: x, y, z, sprite\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addSpriteBlipForContactPoint(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addSpriteForContactPoint(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坐标精灵 [#坐标精灵]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02A8\" name=\"ADD_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_COORD\" member=\"Blip.AddSpriteForCoord\">\n  坐标精灵标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02A8 ADD_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_COORD\n      in: x, y, z, sprite\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addSpriteBlipForCoord(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addSpriteForCoord(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 拾取物标记 [#拾取物标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03DC\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_PICKUP\" member=\"Blip.AddForPickup\">\n  给拾取物加标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03DC ADD_BLIP_FOR_PICKUP\n      in: pickup\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForPickup(pickup)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForPickup(pickup)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 短距坐标精灵 [#短距坐标精灵]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04CE\" name=\"ADD_SHORT_RANGE_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_COORD\" member=\"Blip.AddShortRangeSpriteForCoord\">\n  坐标短距离精灵标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04CE ADD_SHORT_RANGE_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_COORD\n      in: x, y, z, sprite\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addShortRangeSpriteBlipForCoord(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addShortRangeSpriteForCoord(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 短距联系点 [#短距联系点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0570\" name=\"ADD_SHORT_RANGE_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_CONTACT_POINT\" member=\"Blip.AddShortRangeSpriteForContactPoint\">\n  联系点短距离精灵标记（任务中不显示）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0570 ADD_SHORT_RANGE_SPRITE_BLIP_FOR_CONTACT_POINT\n      in: x, y, z, sprite\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addShortRangeSpriteBlipForContactPoint(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addShortRangeSpriteForContactPoint(x, y, z, sprite)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 探照灯标记 [#探照灯标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06C4\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_SEARCHLIGHT\" member=\"Blip.AddForSearchlight\">\n  探照灯雷达位置标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06C4 ADD_BLIP_FOR_SEARCHLIGHT\n      in: searchlight\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForSearchlight(searchlight)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForSearchlight(searchlight)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否存在 [#是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"075C\" name=\"DOES_BLIP_EXIST\" member=\"Blip.DoesExist\">\n  handle 是否有效标记。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      075C DOES_BLIP_EXIST\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if doesBlipExist(handle) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Blip.doesExist(handle)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 缩放雷达始终显示 [#缩放雷达始终显示]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07BF\" name=\"SET_BLIP_ALWAYS_DISPLAY_ON_ZOOMED_RADAR\" member=\"Blip.SetAlwaysDisplayOnZoomedRadar\">\n  缩放雷达上是否始终显示追踪标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07BF SET_BLIP_ALWAYS_DISPLAY_ON_ZOOMED_RADAR\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setBlipAlwaysDisplayOnZoomedRadar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.setAlwaysDisplayOnZoomedRadar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 友方样式 [#友方样式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07E0\" name=\"SET_BLIP_AS_FRIENDLY\" member=\"Blip.SetAsFriendly\">\n  标记为友方样式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07E0 SET_BLIP_AS_FRIENDLY\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setBlipAsFriendly(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.setAsFriendly(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死亡角色 [#死亡角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0888\" name=\"ADD_BLIP_FOR_DEAD_CHAR\" member=\"Blip.AddForDeadChar\">\n  给死亡角色加标记（同 `0187`）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0888 ADD_BLIP_FOR_DEAD_CHAR\n      in: char\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addBlipForDeadChar(char)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Blip.addForDeadChar(char)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 出入口 [#出入口]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08DC\" name=\"SET_BLIP_ENTRY_EXIT\" member=\"Blip.SetEntryExit\">\n  绑到入口 / 出口标记区域。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08DC SET_BLIP_ENTRY_EXIT\n      in: self, x, y, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setBlipEntryExit(self, x, y, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.setEntryExit(self, x, y, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坐标外观色 [#坐标外观色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08FB\" name=\"SET_COORD_BLIP_APPEARANCE\" member=\"Blip.SetCoordAppearance\">\n  改坐标标记外观色（非追踪标记；不同于 `0165` 色表）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08FB SET_COORD_BLIP_APPEARANCE\n      in: self, color\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCoordBlipAppearance(self, color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Blip.setCoordAppearance(self, color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 船只 Boat (/docs/cleo/sa/default/boat)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 4 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 驶向坐标 [#驶向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02D3\" name=\"BOAT_GOTO_COORDS\" member=\"Boat.Goto\">\n  让船驶向坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02D3 BOAT_GOTO_COORDS\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      boatGotoCoords(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Boat.goto(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停船 [#停船]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02D4\" name=\"BOAT_STOP\" member=\"Boat.Stop\">\n  停船（关动力）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02D4 BOAT_STOP\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      boatStop(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Boat.stop(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 巡航速度 [#巡航速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02DB\" name=\"SET_BOAT_CRUISE_SPEED\" member=\"Boat.SetCruiseSpeed\">\n  设船巡航 / 最大速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02DB SET_BOAT_CRUISE_SPEED\n      in: self, maxSpeed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setBoatCruiseSpeed(self, maxSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Boat.setCruiseSpeed(self, maxSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锚泊 [#锚泊]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0323\" name=\"ANCHOR_BOAT\" member=\"Boat.Anchor\">\n  锚泊：船在水上基本不动。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0323 ANCHOR_BOAT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      anchorBoat(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Boat.anchor(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 镜头 Camera (/docs/cleo/sa/default/camera)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 51 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 抖镜头 [#抖镜头]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0003\" name=\"SHAKE_CAM\" member=\"Camera.Shake\">\n  按强度抖动镜头。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0003 SHAKE_CAM\n      in: intensity\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      shakeCam(intensity)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.shake(intensity)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 点是否在屏上 [#点是否在屏上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00C2\" name=\"IS_POINT_ON_SCREEN\" member=\"Camera.IsPointOnScreen\">\n  用在 if：点周围半径是否有任何部分在屏上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00C2 IS_POINT_ON_SCREEN\n      in: x, y, z, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPointOnScreen(x, y, z, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.isPointOnScreen(x, y, z, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 对准车辆 [#对准车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0158\" name=\"POINT_CAMERA_AT_CAR\" member=\"Camera.PointAtCar\">\n  镜头对准/附着指定车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0158 POINT_CAMERA_AT_CAR\n      in: vehicle, mode, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      pointCameraAtCar(vehicle, mode, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.pointAtCar(vehicle, mode, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 对准角色 [#对准角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0159\" name=\"POINT_CAMERA_AT_CHAR\" member=\"Camera.PointAtChar\">\n  镜头对准/附着指定角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0159 POINT_CAMERA_AT_CHAR\n      in: char, mode, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      pointCameraAtChar(char, mode, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.pointAtChar(char, mode, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 恢复镜头 [#恢复镜头]\n\n<Opcode id=\"015A\" name=\"RESTORE_CAMERA\" member=\"Camera.Restore\">\n  恢复常规镜头。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      015A RESTORE_CAMERA\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      restoreCamera()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.restore()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 固定机位 [#固定机位]\n\n<Opcode id=\"015F\" name=\"SET_FIXED_CAMERA_POSITION\" member=\"Camera.SetFixedPosition\">\n  固定机位与 up 向量偏移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      015F SET_FIXED_CAMERA_POSITION\n      in: x, y, z, upVecOffsetX, upVecOffsetY, upVecOffsetZ\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFixedCameraPosition(x, y, z, upVecOffsetX, upVecOffsetY, upVecOffsetZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setFixedPosition(x, y, z, upVecOffsetX, upVecOffsetY, upVecOffsetZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 看向坐标 [#看向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0160\" name=\"POINT_CAMERA_AT_POINT\" member=\"Camera.PointAtPoint\">\n  镜头看向坐标（配合固定机位等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0160 POINT_CAMERA_AT_POINT\n      in: x, y, z, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      pointCameraAtPoint(x, y, z, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.pointAtPoint(x, y, z, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 淡入淡出颜色 [#淡入淡出颜色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0169\" name=\"SET_FADING_COLOUR\" member=\"Camera.SetFadingColor\">\n  淡入淡出颜色 RGB（`016A`）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0169 SET_FADING_COLOUR\n      in: r, g, b\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFadingColour(r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setFadingColor(r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 淡入淡出 [#淡入淡出]\n\n<Opcode id=\"016A\" name=\"DO_FADE\" member=\"Camera.DoFade\">\n  屏幕淡入/淡出指定时长。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      016A DO_FADE\n      in: time, direction\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doFade(time, direction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.doFade(time, direction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在淡入淡出 [#是否在淡入淡出]\n\n<Opcode id=\"016B\" name=\"GET_FADING_STATUS\" member=\"Camera.GetFadingStatus\">\n  用在 if：是否正在淡入淡出。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      016B GET_FADING_STATUS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getFadingStatus()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getFadingStatus()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 硬切恢复 [#硬切恢复]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02EB\" name=\"RESTORE_CAMERA_JUMPCUT\" member=\"Camera.RestoreJumpcut\">\n  硬切恢复镜头到玩家身后。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02EB RESTORE_CAMERA_JUMPCUT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      restoreCameraJumpcut()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.restoreJumpcut()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 镜头远近 [#镜头远近]\n\n<Opcode id=\"032A\" name=\"SET_CAMERA_ZOOM\" member=\"Camera.SetZoom\">\n  镜头相对玩家的远近。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      032A SET_CAMERA_ZOOM\n      in: zoom\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCameraZoom(zoom)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setZoom(zoom)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 镜头到玩家后 [#镜头到玩家后]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0373\" name=\"SET_CAMERA_BEHIND_PLAYER\" member=\"Camera.SetBehindPlayer\">\n  镜头放到玩家身后。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0373 SET_CAMERA_BEHIND_PLAYER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCameraBehindPlayer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setBehindPlayer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 镜头到玩家前 [#镜头到玩家前]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C8\" name=\"SET_CAMERA_IN_FRONT_OF_PLAYER\" member=\"Camera.SetInFrontOfPlayer\">\n  镜头放到玩家前方并朝向玩家。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C8 SET_CAMERA_IN_FRONT_OF_PLAYER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCameraInFrontOfPlayer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setInFrontOfPlayer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 近裁剪面 [#近裁剪面]\n\n<Opcode id=\"041D\" name=\"SET_NEAR_CLIP\" member=\"Camera.SetNearClip\">\n  近裁剪面距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      041D SET_NEAR_CLIP\n      in: distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setNearClip(distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setNearClip(distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调试镜头坐标 [#调试镜头坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0454\" name=\"GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_COORDINATES\" member=\"Camera.GetDebugCoordinates\">\n  调试镜头位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0454 GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_COORDINATES\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getDebugCameraCoordinates()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getDebugCoordinates()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 插值参数 [#插值参数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0460\" name=\"SET_INTERPOLATION_PARAMETERS\" member=\"Camera.SetInterpolationParameters\">\n  镜头过渡时长/插值参数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0460 SET_INTERPOLATION_PARAMETERS\n      in: interpolationToStopMoving, time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setInterpolationParameters(interpolationToStopMoving, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setInterpolationParameters(interpolationToStopMoving, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调试注视点 [#调试注视点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0463\" name=\"GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_POINT_AT\" member=\"Camera.GetDebugPointAt\">\n  调试镜头注视点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0463 GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_POINT_AT\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getDebugCameraPointAt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getDebugPointAt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到车 [#附着到车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0679\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE\" member=\"Camera.AttachToVehicle\">\n  镜头相对车辆偏移附着。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0679 ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE\n      in: handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToVehicle(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToVehicle(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着车上并看车 [#附着车上并看车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067A\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE_LOOK_AT_VEHICLE\" member=\"Camera.AttachToVehicleLookAtVehicle\">\n  附着在车上并看另一辆车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067A ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE_LOOK_AT_VEHICLE\n      in: handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToVehicleLookAtVehicle(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToVehicleLookAtVehicle(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着车上并看人 [#附着车上并看人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067B\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE_LOOK_AT_CHAR\" member=\"Camera.AttachToVehicleLookAtChar\">\n  附着在车上并看角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067B ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_VEHICLE_LOOK_AT_CHAR\n      in: car, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToVehicleLookAtChar(car, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToVehicleLookAtChar(car, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到人 [#附着到人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067C\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Camera.AttachToChar\">\n  镜头相对角色偏移附着。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067C ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR\n      in: handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToChar(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToChar(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着人上并看车 [#附着人上并看车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067D\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR_LOOK_AT_VEHICLE\" member=\"Camera.AttachToCharLookAtVehicle\">\n  附着在角色上并看车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067D ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR_LOOK_AT_VEHICLE\n      in: char, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToCharLookAtVehicle(char, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToCharLookAtVehicle(char, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, vehicle, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着人上并看人 [#附着人上并看人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067E\" name=\"ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR_LOOK_AT_CHAR\" member=\"Camera.AttachToCharLookAtChar\">\n  附着在角色上并看另一角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067E ATTACH_CAMERA_TO_CHAR_LOOK_AT_CHAR\n      in: handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCameraToCharLookAtChar(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.attachToCharLookAtChar(handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, char, tilt, switchStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 活动镜头坐标 [#活动镜头坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"068D\" name=\"GET_ACTIVE_CAMERA_COORDINATES\" member=\"Camera.GetActiveCoordinates\">\n  当前活动镜头坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      068D GET_ACTIVE_CAMERA_COORDINATES\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getActiveCameraCoordinates()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getActiveCoordinates()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 活动注视点 [#活动注视点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"068E\" name=\"GET_ACTIVE_CAMERA_POINT_AT\" member=\"Camera.GetActivePointAt\">\n  当前镜头注视点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      068E GET_ACTIVE_CAMERA_POINT_AT\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getActiveCameraPointAt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getActivePointAt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 双人镜头 [#双人镜头]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06E0\" name=\"SET_TWO_PLAYER_CAMERA_MODE\" member=\"Camera.SetTwoPlayerMode\">\n  双人合作镜头模式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06E0 SET_TWO_PLAYER_CAMERA_MODE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTwoPlayerCameraMode(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setTwoPlayerMode(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取 FOV [#取-fov]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0801\" name=\"GET_CAMERA_FOV\" member=\"Camera.GetFov\">\n  视场角 FOV。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0801 GET_CAMERA_FOV\n      out: fov\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local fov = getCameraFov()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getFov()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内第一人称 [#车内第一人称]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0822\" name=\"SET_FIRST_PERSON_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\" member=\"Camera.SetFirstPersonInCarMode\">\n  车内第一人称/保险杠视角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0822 SET_FIRST_PERSON_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFirstPersonInCarCameraMode(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setFirstPersonInCarMode(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 镜头撞击 [#镜头撞击]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0834\" name=\"DO_CAMERA_BUMP\" member=\"Camera.DoBump\">\n  模拟碰撞般的镜头撞击偏移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0834 DO_CAMERA_BUMP\n      in: xOffset, yOffset\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doCameraBump(xOffset, yOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.doBump(xOffset, yOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 注视点插值 [#注视点插值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0920\" name=\"CAMERA_SET_VECTOR_TRACK\" member=\"Camera.SetVectorTrack\">\n  注视点从 A 转到 B（可缓动）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0920 CAMERA_SET_VECTOR_TRACK\n      in: fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraSetVectorTrack(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setVectorTrack(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## FOV 插值 [#fov-插值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0922\" name=\"CAMERA_SET_LERP_FOV\" member=\"Camera.SetLerpFov\">\n  FOV 在时长内插值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0922 CAMERA_SET_LERP_FOV\n      in: from, to, time, ease\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraSetLerpFov(from, to, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setLerpFov(from, to, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 压暗画面 [#压暗画面]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0924\" name=\"SET_DARKNESS_EFFECT\" member=\"Camera.SetDarknessEffect\">\n  压暗画面（可全黑）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0924 SET_DARKNESS_EFFECT\n      in: enable, pitchBlack\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setDarknessEffect(enable, pitchBlack)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setDarknessEffect(enable, pitchBlack)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 重置脚本镜头 [#重置脚本镜头]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0925\" name=\"CAMERA_RESET_NEW_SCRIPTABLES\" member=\"Camera.ResetNewScriptables\">\n  停掉脚本镜头的推进/插值/抖/缩放等。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0925 CAMERA_RESET_NEW_SCRIPTABLES\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraResetNewScriptables()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.resetNewScriptables()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锁定注视点 [#锁定注视点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"092F\" name=\"CAMERA_PERSIST_TRACK\" member=\"Camera.PersistTrack\">\n  推进结束后锁定注视点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      092F CAMERA_PERSIST_TRACK\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraPersistTrack(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.persistTrack(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锁定机位 [#锁定机位]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0930\" name=\"CAMERA_PERSIST_POS\" member=\"Camera.PersistPos\">\n  锁定机位。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0930 CAMERA_PERSIST_POS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraPersistPos(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.persistPos(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锁定 FOV [#锁定-fov]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0931\" name=\"CAMERA_PERSIST_FOV\" member=\"Camera.PersistFov\">\n  缩放结束后锁定 FOV。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0931 CAMERA_PERSIST_FOV\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraPersistFov(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.persistFov(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 机位是否在动 [#机位是否在动]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0933\" name=\"CAMERA_IS_VECTOR_MOVE_RUNNING\" member=\"Camera.IsVectorMoveRunning\">\n  用在 if：机位是否在移动插值中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0933 CAMERA_IS_VECTOR_MOVE_RUNNING\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraIsVectorMoveRunning()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.isVectorMoveRunning()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 注视是否在转 [#注视是否在转]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0934\" name=\"CAMERA_IS_VECTOR_TRACK_RUNNING\" member=\"Camera.IsVectorTrackRunning\">\n  用在 if：注视点是否在转动插值中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0934 CAMERA_IS_VECTOR_TRACK_RUNNING\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraIsVectorTrackRunning()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.isVectorTrackRunning()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 机位插值 [#机位插值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0936\" name=\"CAMERA_SET_VECTOR_MOVE\" member=\"Camera.SetVectorMove\">\n  机位从 A 移到 B。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0936 CAMERA_SET_VECTOR_MOVE\n      in: fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraSetVectorMove(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setVectorMove(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ, time, ease)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 电影镜头 [#电影镜头]\n\n<Opcode id=\"093D\" name=\"SET_CINEMA_CAMERA\" member=\"Camera.SetCinema\">\n  锁定车辆电影镜头模式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      093D SET_CINEMA_CAMERA\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCinemaCamera(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setCinema(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 镜头到角色前 [#镜头到角色前]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0944\" name=\"SET_CAMERA_IN_FRONT_OF_CHAR\" member=\"Camera.SetInFrontOfChar\">\n  镜头放到指定角色前方。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0944 SET_CAMERA_IN_FRONT_OF_CHAR\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCameraInFrontOfChar(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setInFrontOfChar(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 简单抖动 [#简单抖动]\n\n<Opcode id=\"099C\" name=\"CAMERA_SET_SHAKE_SIMULATION_SIMPLE\" member=\"Camera.SetShakeSimulationSimple\">\n  多种简单抖动模拟。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      099C CAMERA_SET_SHAKE_SIMULATION_SIMPLE\n      in: type, timeInMs, intensity\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      cameraSetShakeSimulationSimple(type, timeInMs, intensity)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setShakeSimulationSimple(type, timeInMs, intensity)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内视角模式 [#车内视角模式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09AD\" name=\"SET_PLAYER_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\" member=\"Camera.SetPlayerInCarMode\">\n  切换当前车内视角（等同改视角键）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09AD SET_PLAYER_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\n      in: mode\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlayerInCarCameraMode(mode)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setPlayerInCarMode(mode)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 固定镜头碰撞 [#固定镜头碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09EC\" name=\"ALLOW_FIXED_CAMERA_COLLISION\" member=\"Camera.AllowFixedCollision\">\n  车库等处是否允许固定镜头碰撞处理。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09EC ALLOW_FIXED_CAMERA_COLLISION\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      allowFixedCameraCollision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.allowFixedCollision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车型镜头微调 [#车型镜头微调]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09EF\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_CAMERA_TWEAK\" member=\"Camera.SetVehicleTweak\">\n  指定车型默认镜头距离/高度/角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09EF SET_VEHICLE_CAMERA_TWEAK\n      in: modelId, distance, altitude, angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleCameraTweak(modelId, distance, altitude, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setVehicleTweak(modelId, distance, altitude, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清车型镜头微调 [#清车型镜头微调]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F0\" name=\"RESET_VEHICLE_CAMERA_TWEAK\" member=\"Camera.ResetVehicleTweak\">\n  清除 `09EF` 的车型镜头微调。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F0 RESET_VEHICLE_CAMERA_TWEAK\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      resetVehicleCameraTweak()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.resetVehicleTweak()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 截图 [#截图]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A1E\" name=\"TAKE_PHOTO\" member=\"Camera.TakePhoto\">\n  无 HUD 截图到 User Files/Gallery。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A1E TAKE_PHOTO\n      in: _p1\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      takePhoto(_p1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.takePhoto(_p1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 非固定偏移 [#非固定偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A25\" name=\"SET_CAMERA_POSITION_UNFIXED\" member=\"Camera.SetPositionUnfixed\">\n  相对目标实体的镜头偏移（非固定机位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A25 SET_CAMERA_POSITION_UNFIXED\n      in: xOffset, yOffset\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCameraPositionUnfixed(xOffset, yOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setPositionUnfixed(xOffset, yOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相机射击视角 [#相机射击视角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A2F\" name=\"SET_PHOTO_CAMERA_EFFECT\" member=\"Camera.SetPhotoEffect\">\n  持狙击/相机等时强制第一人称射击视角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A2F SET_PHOTO_CAMERA_EFFECT\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPhotoCameraEffect(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.setPhotoEffect(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取车内视角 [#取车内视角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A39\" name=\"GET_PLAYER_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\" member=\"Camera.GetPlayerInCarMode\">\n  当前车辆玩家所选镜头模式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A39 GET_PLAYER_IN_CAR_CAMERA_MODE\n      out: mode\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local mode = getPlayerInCarCameraMode()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Camera.getPlayerInCarMode()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 载具 Car (/docs/cleo/sa/default/car)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 196 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建车辆 [#创建车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A5\" name=\"CREATE_CAR\" member=\"Car.Create\">\n  在坐标用指定模型创建车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A5 CREATE_CAR\n      in: modelId, x, y, z\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCar(modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.create(modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除车辆 [#删除车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A6\" name=\"DELETE_CAR\" member=\"Car.Delete\">\n  从游戏中移除车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A6 DELETE_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      deleteCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.delete(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 驶向坐标 [#驶向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A7\" name=\"CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES\" member=\"Car.GotoCoordinates\">\n  AI 任意方式驶向坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A7 CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      carGotoCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.gotoCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 漫无驾驶 [#漫无驾驶]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A8\" name=\"CAR_WANDER_RANDOMLY\" member=\"Car.WanderRandomly\">\n  清任务并漫游驾驶。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A8 CAR_WANDER_RANDOMLY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      carWanderRandomly(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.wanderRandomly(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设空闲 [#设空闲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A9\" name=\"CAR_SET_IDLE\" member=\"Car.SetIdle\">\n  设为空闲任务，停止驾驶。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A9 CAR_SET_IDLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      carSetIdle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setIdle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取坐标 [#取坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00AA\" name=\"GET_CAR_COORDINATES\" member=\"Car.GetCoordinates\">\n  取车辆坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00AA GET_CAR_COORDINATES\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getCarCoordinates(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getCoordinates(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设坐标 [#设坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00AB\" name=\"SET_CAR_COORDINATES\" member=\"Car.SetCoordinates\">\n  放到指定坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00AB SET_CAR_COORDINATES\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 巡航速度 [#巡航速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00AD\" name=\"SET_CAR_CRUISE_SPEED\" member=\"Car.SetCruiseSpeed\">\n  设最高速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00AD SET_CAR_CRUISE_SPEED\n      in: self, maxSpeed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCruiseSpeed(self, maxSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCruiseSpeed(self, maxSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 驾驶风格 [#驾驶风格]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00AE\" name=\"SET_CAR_DRIVING_STYLE\" member=\"Car.SetDrivingStyle\">\n  设 AI 驾驶行为。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00AE SET_CAR_DRIVING_STYLE\n      in: self, drivingStyle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarDrivingStyle(self, drivingStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setDrivingStyle(self, drivingStyle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 驾驶任务类型 [#驾驶任务类型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00AF\" name=\"SET_CAR_MISSION\" member=\"Car.SetMission\">\n  设 AI 驾驶任务类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00AF SET_CAR_MISSION\n      in: self, carMission\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarMission(self, carMission)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setMission(self, carMission)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在 2D 区 [#是否在-2d-区]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00B0\" name=\"IS_CAR_IN_AREA_2D\" member=\"Car.IsInArea2D\">\n  用在 if：是否在 2D 区内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00B0 IS_CAR_IN_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在 3D 区 [#是否在-3d-区]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00B1\" name=\"IS_CAR_IN_AREA_3D\" member=\"Car.IsInArea3D\">\n  用在 if：是否在 3D 区内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00B1 IS_CAR_IN_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否已毁 [#是否已毁]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0119\" name=\"IS_CAR_DEAD\" member=\"Car.IsDead\">\n  用在 if：句柄无效或车已毁。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0119 IS_CAR_DEAD\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarDead(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isDead(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否指定模型 [#是否指定模型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0137\" name=\"IS_CAR_MODEL\" member=\"Car.IsModel\">\n  用在 if：是否为指定模型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0137 IS_CAR_MODEL\n      in: self, modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取朝向 [#取朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0174\" name=\"GET_CAR_HEADING\" member=\"Car.GetHeading\">\n  取朝向（Z 角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0174 GET_CAR_HEADING\n      in: self\n      out: heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local heading = getCarHeading(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getHeading(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设朝向 [#设朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0175\" name=\"SET_CAR_HEADING\" member=\"Car.SetHeading\">\n  设朝向（Z 角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0175 SET_CAR_HEADING\n      in: self, heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 生命是否更高 [#生命是否更高]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0185\" name=\"IS_CAR_HEALTH_GREATER\" member=\"Car.IsHealthGreater\">\n  用在 if：生命是否高于指定值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0185 IS_CAR_HEALTH_GREATER\n      in: self, health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarHealthGreater(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isHealthGreater(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否卡在车顶 [#是否卡在车顶]\n\n<Opcode id=\"018F\" name=\"IS_CAR_STUCK_ON_ROOF\" member=\"Car.IsStuckOnRoof\">\n  用在 if：翻车超过约 2 秒（需 0190）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      018F IS_CAR_STUCK_ON_ROOF\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarStuckOnRoof(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isStuckOnRoof(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 启用翻车检测 [#启用翻车检测]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0190\" name=\"ADD_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_CHECK\" member=\"Car.AddUpsidedownCheck\">\n  启用翻车检测。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0190 ADD_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_CHECK\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addUpsidedownCarCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.addUpsidedownCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关闭翻车检测 [#关闭翻车检测]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0191\" name=\"REMOVE_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_CHECK\" member=\"Car.RemoveUpsidedownCheck\">\n  关闭翻车检测（0190）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0191 REMOVE_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_CHECK\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeUpsidedownCarCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.removeUpsidedownCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 2D 区停下 [#2d-区停下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AB\" name=\"IS_CAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_2D\" member=\"Car.IsStoppedInArea2D\">\n  用在 if：是否在 2D 区内停下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AB IS_CAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarStoppedInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isStoppedInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 3D 区停下 [#3d-区停下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AC\" name=\"IS_CAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_3D\" member=\"Car.IsStoppedInArea3D\">\n  用在 if：是否在 3D 区内停下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AC IS_CAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarStoppedInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isStoppedInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 靠近 2D [#靠近-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AD\" name=\"LOCATE_CAR_2D\" member=\"Car.Locate2D\">\n  用在 if：是否在点的 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AD LOCATE_CAR_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.locate2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下靠近 2D [#停下靠近-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AE\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CAR_2D\" member=\"Car.LocateStopped2D\">\n  用在 if：是否在点的 2D 半径内停下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AE LOCATE_STOPPED_CAR_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.locateStopped2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 靠近 3D [#靠近-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AF\" name=\"LOCATE_CAR_3D\" member=\"Car.Locate3D\">\n  用在 if：是否在点的 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AF LOCATE_CAR_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.locate3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下靠近 3D [#停下靠近-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01B0\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CAR_3D\" member=\"Car.LocateStopped3D\">\n  用在 if：是否在点半径内停下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01B0 LOCATE_STOPPED_CAR_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.locateStopped3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否静止 [#是否静止]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C1\" name=\"IS_CAR_STOPPED\" member=\"Car.IsStopped\">\n  用在 if：是否静止。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C1 IS_CAR_STOPPED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarStopped(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isStopped(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可卸载 [#可卸载]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C3\" name=\"MARK_CAR_AS_NO_LONGER_NEEDED\" member=\"Car.MarkAsNoLongerNeeded\">\n  允许按需删除，并从任务清理列表移除。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C3 MARK_CAR_AS_NO_LONGER_NEEDED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      markCarAsNoLongerNeeded(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.markAsNoLongerNeeded(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 乘客人数 [#乘客人数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01E9\" name=\"GET_NUMBER_OF_PASSENGERS\" member=\"Car.GetNumberOfPassengers\">\n  当前乘客人数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01E9 GET_NUMBER_OF_PASSENGERS\n      in: self\n      out: count\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local count = getNumberOfPassengers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getNumberOfPassengers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最大载客 [#最大载客]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01EA\" name=\"GET_MAXIMUM_NUMBER_OF_PASSENGERS\" member=\"Car.GetMaximumNumberOfPassengers\">\n  最大载客数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01EA GET_MAXIMUM_NUMBER_OF_PASSENGERS\n      in: self\n      out: count\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local count = getMaximumNumberOfPassengers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getMaximumNumberOfPassengers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设加重 [#设加重]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01EC\" name=\"SET_CAR_HEAVY\" member=\"Car.SetHeavy\">\n  是否加重。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01EC SET_CAR_HEAVY\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHeavy(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setHeavy(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否腾空 [#是否腾空]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01F3\" name=\"IS_CAR_IN_AIR_PROPER\" member=\"Car.IsInAirProper\">\n  用在 if：是否腾空。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01F3 IS_CAR_IN_AIR_PROPER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarInAirProper(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isInAirProper(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否翻车 [#是否翻车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01F4\" name=\"IS_CAR_UPSIDEDOWN\" member=\"Car.IsUpsidedown\">\n  用在 if：是否翻车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01F4 IS_CAR_UPSIDEDOWN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarUpsidedown(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isUpsidedown(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车门锁 [#车门锁]\n\n<Opcode id=\"020A\" name=\"LOCK_CAR_DOORS\" member=\"Car.LockDoors\">\n  车门锁状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      020A LOCK_CAR_DOORS\n      in: self, lockStatus\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      lockCarDoors(self, lockStatus)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.lockDoors(self, lockStatus)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 引爆 [#引爆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"020B\" name=\"EXPLODE_CAR\" member=\"Car.Explode\">\n  引爆车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      020B EXPLODE_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      explodeCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.explode(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否正立 [#是否正立]\n\n<Opcode id=\"020D\" name=\"IS_CAR_UPRIGHT\" member=\"Car.IsUpright\">\n  用在 if：是否正立。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      020D IS_CAR_UPRIGHT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarUpright(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isUpright(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 出租顶灯 [#出租顶灯]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0216\" name=\"SET_TAXI_LIGHTS\" member=\"Car.SetTaxiLights\">\n  出租车顶灯。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0216 SET_TAXI_LIGHTS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTaxiLights(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setTaxiLights(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设生命 [#设生命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0224\" name=\"SET_CAR_HEALTH\" member=\"Car.SetHealth\">\n  设生命。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0224 SET_CAR_HEALTH\n      in: self, health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHealth(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setHealth(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取生命 [#取生命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0227\" name=\"GET_CAR_HEALTH\" member=\"Car.GetHealth\">\n  取生命。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0227 GET_CAR_HEALTH\n      in: self\n      out: health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local health = getCarHealth(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getHealth(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改颜色 [#改颜色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0229\" name=\"CHANGE_CAR_COLOUR\" member=\"Car.ChangeColor\">\n  设主副色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0229 CHANGE_CAR_COLOUR\n      in: self, color1, color2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeCarColour(self, color1, color2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.changeColor(self, color1, color2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 喷漆是否改色 [#喷漆是否改色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0294\" name=\"SET_CAN_RESPRAY_CAR\" member=\"Car.SetCanRespray\">\n  喷漆店不改色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0294 SET_CAN_RESPRAY_CAR\n      in: self, changeColors\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCanResprayCar(self, changeColors)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanRespray(self, changeColors)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 仅玩家可伤 [#仅玩家可伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02AA\" name=\"SET_CAR_ONLY_DAMAGED_BY_PLAYER\" member=\"Car.SetOnlyDamagedByPlayer\">\n  除玩家外几乎全免疫。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02AA SET_CAR_ONLY_DAMAGED_BY_PLAYER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarOnlyDamagedByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setOnlyDamagedByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 伤害免疫 [#伤害免疫]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02AC\" name=\"SET_CAR_PROOFS\" member=\"Car.SetProofs\">\n  设各类免疫。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02AC SET_CAR_PROOFS\n      in: self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarProofs(self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setProofs(self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在水中 [#是否在水中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02BF\" name=\"IS_CAR_IN_WATER\" member=\"Car.IsInWater\">\n  用在 if：是否没入水中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02BF IS_CAR_IN_WATER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarInWater(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isInWater(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 精确驶向坐标 [#精确驶向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02C2\" name=\"CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES_ACCURATE\" member=\"Car.GotoCoordinatesAccurate\">\n  AI 遵守交规驶向坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02C2 CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES_ACCURATE\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      carGotoCoordinatesAccurate(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.gotoCoordinatesAccurate(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在屏上 [#是否在屏上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02CA\" name=\"IS_CAR_ON_SCREEN\" member=\"Car.IsOnScreen\">\n  用在 if：是否可见。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02CA IS_CAR_ON_SCREEN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarOnScreen(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isOnScreen(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取速度 [#取速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E3\" name=\"GET_CAR_SPEED\" member=\"Car.GetSpeed\">\n  取速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E3 GET_CAR_SPEED\n      in: self\n      out: speed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local speed = getCarSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 朝向 X [#朝向-x]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02F8\" name=\"GET_CAR_FORWARD_X\" member=\"Car.GetForwardX\">\n  朝向的 X 分量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02F8 GET_CAR_FORWARD_X\n      in: self\n      out: x\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x = getCarForwardX(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getForwardX(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 朝向 Y [#朝向-y]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02F9\" name=\"GET_CAR_FORWARD_Y\" member=\"Car.GetForwardY\">\n  朝向的 Y 分量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02F9 GET_CAR_FORWARD_Y\n      in: self\n      out: y\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local y = getCarForwardY(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getForwardY(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否被武器打中 [#是否被武器打中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"031E\" name=\"HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_WEAPON\" member=\"Car.HasBeenDamagedByWeapon\">\n  用在 if：是否被指定武器打中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      031E HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCarBeenDamagedByWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.hasBeenDamagedByWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 显隐 [#显隐]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0338\" name=\"SET_CAR_VISIBLE\" member=\"Car.SetVisible\">\n  显隐车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0338 SET_CAR_VISIBLE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarVisible(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setVisible(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 警报器 [#警报器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0397\" name=\"SWITCH_CAR_SIREN\" member=\"Car.SwitchSiren\">\n  是否可触发警报。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0397 SWITCH_CAR_SIREN\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchCarSiren(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.switchSiren(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 水密 [#水密]\n\n<Opcode id=\"039C\" name=\"SET_CAR_WATERTIGHT\" member=\"Car.SetWatertight\">\n  水密：沉水时车内人不伤。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      039C SET_CAR_WATERTIGHT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarWatertight(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setWatertight(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 转向面对坐标 [#转向面对坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"039F\" name=\"TURN_CAR_TO_FACE_COORD\" member=\"Car.TurnToFaceCoord\">\n  朝向正对 2D 坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      039F TURN_CAR_TO_FACE_COORD\n      in: self, x, y\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      turnCarToFaceCoord(self, x, y)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.turnToFaceCoord(self, x, y)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设状态 [#设状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03A2\" name=\"SET_CAR_STATUS\" member=\"Car.SetStatus\">\n  设车辆状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03A2 SET_CAR_STATUS\n      in: self, status\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarStatus(self, status)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setStatus(self, status)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 更耐碰撞 [#更耐碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03AB\" name=\"SET_CAR_STRONG\" member=\"Car.SetStrong\">\n  是否更耐碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03AB SET_CAR_STRONG\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarStrong(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setStrong(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否明显损坏 [#是否明显损坏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C9\" name=\"IS_CAR_VISIBLY_DAMAGED\" member=\"Car.IsVisiblyDamaged\">\n  用在 if：部件是否明显损坏/脱落。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C9 IS_CAR_VISIBLY_DAMAGED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarVisiblyDamaged(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isVisiblyDamaged(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 翻车不炸 [#翻车不炸]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03ED\" name=\"SET_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_NOT_DAMAGED\" member=\"Car.SetUpsidedownNotDamaged\">\n  玩家不在车内时翻车不炸。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03ED SET_UPSIDEDOWN_CAR_NOT_DAMAGED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setUpsidedownCarNotDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setUpsidedownNotDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取颜色 [#取颜色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03F3\" name=\"GET_CAR_COLOURS\" member=\"Car.GetColors\">\n  取主副色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03F3 GET_CAR_COLOURS\n      in: self\n      out: color1, color2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local color1, color2 = getCarColours(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getColors(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否可受伤 [#是否可受伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03F5\" name=\"SET_CAR_CAN_BE_DAMAGED\" member=\"Car.SetCanBeDamaged\">\n  是否可受伤。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03F5 SET_CAR_CAN_BE_DAMAGED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCanBeDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanBeDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 偏移世界坐标 [#偏移世界坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0407\" name=\"GET_OFFSET_FROM_CAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\" member=\"Car.GetOffsetInWorldCoords\">\n  按车身旋转取偏移世界坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0407 GET_OFFSET_FROM_CAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\n      in: self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getOffsetFromCarInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getOffsetInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 抓地力 [#抓地力]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0423\" name=\"SET_CAR_TRACTION\" member=\"Car.SetTraction\">\n  覆盖 AI 车默认抓地 1.0。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0423 SET_CAR_TRACTION\n      in: self, traction\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarTraction(self, traction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setTraction(self, traction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 避开跨层 [#避开跨层]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0428\" name=\"SET_CAR_AVOID_LEVEL_TRANSITIONS\" member=\"Car.SetAvoidLevelTransitions\">\n  是否避开跨层路径（0426）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0428 SET_CAR_AVOID_LEVEL_TRANSITIONS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarAvoidLevelTransitions(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setAvoidLevelTransitions(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 座位是否空 [#座位是否空]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0431\" name=\"IS_CAR_PASSENGER_SEAT_FREE\" member=\"Car.IsPassengerSeatFree\">\n  用在 if：指定座位是否空。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0431 IS_CAR_PASSENGER_SEAT_FREE\n      in: self, seat\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarPassengerSeatFree(self, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isPassengerSeatFree(self, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 座位上的人 [#座位上的人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0432\" name=\"GET_CHAR_IN_CAR_PASSENGER_SEAT\" member=\"Car.GetCharInPassengerSeat\">\n  取座位上的角色句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0432 GET_CHAR_IN_CAR_PASSENGER_SEAT\n      in: self, seat\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = getCharInCarPassengerSeat(self, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getCharInPassengerSeat(self, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取车型 [#取车型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0441\" name=\"GET_CAR_MODEL\" member=\"Car.GetModel\">\n  取车型 ID。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0441 GET_CAR_MODEL\n      in: self\n      out: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local modelId = getCarModel(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getModel(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 快车道 [#快车道]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0466\" name=\"SET_CAR_STAY_IN_FAST_LANE\" member=\"Car.SetStayInFastLane\">\n  是否尽量待在快车道。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0466 SET_CAR_STAY_IN_FAST_LANE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarStayInFastLane(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setStayInFastLane(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清武器伤害记录 [#清武器伤害记录]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0468\" name=\"CLEAR_CAR_LAST_WEAPON_DAMAGE\" member=\"Car.ClearLastWeaponDamage\">\n  清上次武器伤害记录（031E）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0468 CLEAR_CAR_LAST_WEAPON_DAMAGE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCarLastWeaponDamage(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.clearLastWeaponDamage(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取驾驶员 [#取驾驶员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"046C\" name=\"GET_DRIVER_OF_CAR\" member=\"Car.GetDriver\">\n  取驾驶员句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      046C GET_DRIVER_OF_CAR\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = getDriverOfCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getDriver(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 临时动作 [#临时动作]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0477\" name=\"SET_CAR_TEMP_ACTION\" member=\"Car.SetTempAction\">\n  AI 驾驶在车内做动作一段时间。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0477 SET_CAR_TEMP_ACTION\n      in: self, actionId, time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarTempAction(self, actionId, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setTempAction(self, actionId, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机路线种子 [#随机路线种子]\n\n<Opcode id=\"048B\" name=\"SET_CAR_RANDOM_ROUTE_SEED\" member=\"Car.SetRandomRouteSeed\">\n  把车放到指定路线。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      048B SET_CAR_RANDOM_ROUTE_SEED\n      in: self, routeSeed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarRandomRouteSeed(self, routeSeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setRandomRouteSeed(self, routeSeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否着火 [#是否着火]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0495\" name=\"IS_CAR_ON_FIRE\" member=\"Car.IsOnFire\">\n  用在 if：是否着火。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0495 IS_CAR_ON_FIRE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarOnFire(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isOnFire(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 轮胎是否瘪 [#轮胎是否瘪]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0496\" name=\"IS_CAR_TYRE_BURST\" member=\"Car.IsTireBurst\">\n  用在 if：指定轮胎是否瘪。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0496 IS_CAR_TYRE_BURST\n      in: self, tireId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarTyreBurst(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isTireBurst(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设前进速度 [#设前进速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04BA\" name=\"SET_CAR_FORWARD_SPEED\" member=\"Car.SetForwardSpeed\">\n  设车速。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04BA SET_CAR_FORWARD_SPEED\n      in: self, forwardSpeed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarForwardSpeed(self, forwardSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setForwardSpeed(self, forwardSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 标记车队 [#标记车队]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04BD\" name=\"MARK_CAR_AS_CONVOY_CAR\" member=\"Car.MarkAsConvoyCar\">\n  标记为车队成员（跟 0994 路径）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04BD MARK_CAR_AS_CONVOY_CAR\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      markCarAsConvoyCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.markAsConvoyCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 直线冲刺距离 [#直线冲刺距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04E0\" name=\"SET_CAR_STRAIGHT_LINE_DISTANCE\" member=\"Car.SetStraightLineDistance\">\n  AI 近目标时忽略路径直线冲。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04E0 SET_CAR_STRAIGHT_LINE_DISTANCE\n      in: self, distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarStraightLineDistance(self, distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setStraightLineDistance(self, distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 打开后备箱 [#打开后备箱]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04E1\" name=\"POP_CAR_BOOT\" member=\"Car.PopBoot\">\n  打开并保持后备箱开。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04E1 POP_CAR_BOOT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      popCarBoot(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.popBoot(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 等世界碰撞 [#等世界碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04F1\" name=\"IS_CAR_WAITING_FOR_WORLD_COLLISION\" member=\"Car.IsWaitingForWorldCollision\">\n  用在 if：是否在等世界碰撞加载。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04F1 IS_CAR_WAITING_FOR_WORLD_COLLISION\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarWaitingForWorldCollision(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isWaitingForWorldCollision(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 扎胎 [#扎胎]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04FE\" name=\"BURST_CAR_TYRE\" member=\"Car.BurstTire\">\n  扎瘪轮胎。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04FE BURST_CAR_TYRE\n      in: self, tireId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      burstCarTyre(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.burstTire(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 模型变体 [#模型变体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0506\" name=\"SET_CAR_MODEL_COMPONENTS\" member=\"Car.SetModelComponents\">\n  下一辆创建车的变体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0506 SET_CAR_MODEL_COMPONENTS\n      in: _unused, component1, component2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarModelComponents(_unused, component1, component2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setModelComponents(_unused, component1, component2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关全部门 [#关全部门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0508\" name=\"CLOSE_ALL_CAR_DOORS\" member=\"Car.CloseAllDoors\">\n  关全部车门/机盖/后备箱。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0508 CLOSE_ALL_CAR_DOORS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      closeAllCarDoors(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.closeAllDoors(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锁定位置 [#锁定位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0519\" name=\"FREEZE_CAR_POSITION\" member=\"Car.FreezePosition\">\n  锁定车辆位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0519 FREEZE_CAR_POSITION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freezeCarPosition(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.freezePosition(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被角色损坏 [#被角色损坏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"051C\" name=\"HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CHAR\" member=\"Car.HasBeenDamagedByChar\">\n  用在 if：是否被指定角色损坏。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      051C HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CHAR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCarBeenDamagedByChar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.hasBeenDamagedByChar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被车损坏 [#被车损坏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"051D\" name=\"HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CAR\" member=\"Car.HasBeenDamagedByCar\">\n  用在 if：是否被指定车损坏。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      051D HAS_CAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CAR\n      in: self, other\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCarBeenDamagedByCar(self, other)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.hasBeenDamagedByCar(self, other)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 轮胎可扎 [#轮胎可扎]\n\n<Opcode id=\"053F\" name=\"SET_CAN_BURST_CAR_TYRES\" member=\"Car.SetCanBurstTires\">\n  轮胎是否可被扎。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      053F SET_CAN_BURST_CAR_TYRES\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCanBurstCarTyres(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanBurstTires(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清伤害来源 [#清伤害来源]\n\n<Opcode id=\"054F\" name=\"CLEAR_CAR_LAST_DAMAGE_ENTITY\" member=\"Car.ClearLastDamageEntity\">\n  清上次伤害来源实体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      054F CLEAR_CAR_LAST_DAMAGE_ENTITY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCarLastDamageEntity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.clearLastDamageEntity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车辆是否存在 [#车辆是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"056E\" name=\"DOES_VEHICLE_EXIST\" member=\"Car.DoesExist\">\n  用在 if：句柄是否有效车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      056E DOES_VEHICLE_EXIST\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doesVehicleExist(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.doesExist(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 冻结且不加载碰撞 [#冻结且不加载碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0574\" name=\"FREEZE_CAR_POSITION_AND_DONT_LOAD_COLLISION\" member=\"Car.FreezePositionAndDontLoadCollision\">\n  保持当前位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0574 FREEZE_CAR_POSITION_AND_DONT_LOAD_COLLISION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freezeCarPositionAndDontLoadCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.freezePositionAndDontLoadCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰撞加载标志 [#碰撞加载标志]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0587\" name=\"SET_LOAD_COLLISION_FOR_CAR_FLAG\" member=\"Car.SetLoadCollisionFlag\">\n  是否为该车加载碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0587 SET_LOAD_COLLISION_FOR_CAR_FLAG\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLoadCollisionForCarFlag(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setLoadCollisionFlag(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 淡入透明度 [#淡入透明度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0594\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_TO_FADE_IN\" member=\"Car.SetToFadeIn\">\n  远处车辆半透明 alpha。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0594 SET_VEHICLE_TO_FADE_IN\n      in: self, alpha\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleToFadeIn(self, alpha)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setToFadeIn(self, alpha)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开始录像回放 [#开始录像回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05EB\" name=\"START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.StartPlayback\">\n  分配到路径。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05EB START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self, path\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startPlaybackRecordedCar(self, path)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.startPlayback(self, path)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停止回放 [#停止回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05EC\" name=\"STOP_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.StopPlayback\">\n  停止沿路径行驶。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05EC STOP_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      stopPlaybackRecordedCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.stopPlayback(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 暂停回放 [#暂停回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05ED\" name=\"PAUSE_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.PausePlayback\">\n  冻结在路径上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05ED PAUSE_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      pausePlaybackRecordedCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.pausePlayback(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 继续回放 [#继续回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05EE\" name=\"UNPAUSE_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.UnpausePlayback\">\n  解冻路径上的车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05EE UNPAUSE_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      unpausePlaybackRecordedCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.unpausePlayback(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 贴左侧护送 [#贴左侧护送]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F1\" name=\"SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_LEFT\" member=\"Car.SetEscortCarLeft\">\n  平行贴在另一车左侧。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F1 SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_LEFT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEscortCarLeft(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEscortCarLeft(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 贴右侧护送 [#贴右侧护送]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F2\" name=\"SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_RIGHT\" member=\"Car.SetEscortCarRight\">\n  平行贴在另一车右侧。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F2 SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_RIGHT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEscortCarRight(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEscortCarRight(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟车后护送 [#跟车后护送]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F3\" name=\"SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_REAR\" member=\"Car.SetEscortCarRear\">\n  平行跟在另一车后。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F3 SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_REAR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEscortCarRear(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEscortCarRear(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 堵车前护送 [#堵车前护送]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F4\" name=\"SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_FRONT\" member=\"Car.SetEscortCarFront\">\n  平行堵在另一车前。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F4 SET_CAR_ESCORT_CAR_FRONT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEscortCarFront(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEscortCarFront(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在回放 [#是否在回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"060E\" name=\"IS_PLAYBACK_GOING_ON_FOR_CAR\" member=\"Car.IsPlaybackGoingOn\">\n  用在 if：是否已分配路径。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      060E IS_PLAYBACK_GOING_ON_FOR_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlaybackGoingOnForCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isPlaybackGoingOn(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开车门 [#开车门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0657\" name=\"OPEN_CAR_DOOR\" member=\"Car.OpenDoor\">\n  打开指定车门。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0657 OPEN_CAR_DOOR\n      in: self, door\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      openCarDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.openDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 下一辆车牌 [#下一辆车牌]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0674\" name=\"CUSTOM_PLATE_FOR_NEXT_CAR\" member=\"Car.CustomPlateForNextCar\">\n  下一辆该模型车的车牌。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0674 CUSTOM_PLATE_FOR_NEXT_CAR\n      in: modelId, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      customPlateForNextCar(modelId, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.customPlateForNextCar(modelId, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 强制车灯 [#强制车灯]\n\n<Opcode id=\"067F\" name=\"FORCE_CAR_LIGHTS\" member=\"Car.ForceLights\">\n  覆盖车灯状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      067F FORCE_CAR_LIGHTS\n      in: self, lightMode\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      forceCarLights(self, lightMode)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.forceLights(self, lightMode)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到车 [#附着到车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0683\" name=\"ATTACH_CAR_TO_CAR\" member=\"Car.AttachToCar\">\n  附着到另一车上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0683 ATTACH_CAR_TO_CAR\n      in: self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCarToCar(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.attachToCar(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 分离车辆 [#分离车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0684\" name=\"DETACH_CAR\" member=\"Car.Detach\">\n  分离车辆（可选旋转与力）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0684 DETACH_CAR\n      in: self, pitch, heading, strength, applyTurnForce\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      detachCar(self, pitch, heading, strength, applyTurnForce)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.detach(self, pitch, heading, strength, applyTurnForce)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否附着中 [#是否附着中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0686\" name=\"IS_VEHICLE_ATTACHED\" member=\"Car.IsAttached\">\n  用在 if：是否附着中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0686 IS_VEHICLE_ATTACHED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isVehicleAttached(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isAttached(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 拆车门 [#拆车门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0689\" name=\"POP_CAR_DOOR\" member=\"Car.PopDoor\">\n  拆掉指定车门部件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0689 POP_CAR_DOOR\n      in: self, door, visibility\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      popCarDoor(self, door, visibility)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.popDoor(self, door, visibility)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 修车门 [#修车门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"068A\" name=\"FIX_CAR_DOOR\" member=\"Car.FixDoor\">\n  修复车门。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      068A FIX_CAR_DOOR\n      in: self, door\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fixCarDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.fixDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 全员下车 [#全员下车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"068B\" name=\"TASK_EVERYONE_LEAVE_CAR\" member=\"Car.TaskEveryoneLeave\">\n  全体乘客下车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      068B TASK_EVERYONE_LEAVE_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      taskEveryoneLeaveCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.taskEveryoneLeave(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 拆面板 [#拆面板]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0697\" name=\"POP_CAR_PANEL\" member=\"Car.PopPanel\">\n  拆掉或删除车身部件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0697 POP_CAR_PANEL\n      in: self, panelId, drop\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      popCarPanel(self, panelId, drop)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.popPanel(self, panelId, drop)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 修面板 [#修面板]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0698\" name=\"FIX_CAR_PANEL\" member=\"Car.FixPanel\">\n  修复或重装车身部件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0698 FIX_CAR_PANEL\n      in: self, panelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fixCarPanel(self, panelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.fixPanel(self, panelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 修轮胎 [#修轮胎]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0699\" name=\"FIX_CAR_TYRE\" member=\"Car.FixTire\">\n  修好轮胎。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0699 FIX_CAR_TYRE\n      in: self, tireId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fixCarTyre(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.fixTire(self, tireId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取速度向量 [#取速度向量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06A2\" name=\"GET_CAR_SPEED_VECTOR\" member=\"Car.GetSpeedVector\">\n  取速度向量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06A2 GET_CAR_SPEED_VECTOR\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getCarSpeedVector(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getSpeedVector(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取质量 [#取质量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06A3\" name=\"GET_CAR_MASS\" member=\"Car.GetMass\">\n  取质量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06A3 GET_CAR_MASS\n      in: self\n      out: mass\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local mass = getCarMass(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getMass(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取俯仰角 [#取俯仰角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06BE\" name=\"GET_CAR_ROLL\" member=\"Car.GetRoll\">\n  取俯仰角 Y。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06BE GET_CAR_ROLL\n      in: self\n      out: angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local angle = getCarRoll(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getRoll(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跳到录像末尾 [#跳到录像末尾]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06C5\" name=\"SKIP_TO_END_AND_STOP_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.SkipToEndAndStopPlayback\">\n  跳到录像末尾并停。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06C5 SKIP_TO_END_AND_STOP_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      skipToEndAndStopPlaybackRecordedCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.skipToEndAndStopPlayback(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改装槽可用模型 [#改装槽可用模型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06E5\" name=\"GET_AVAILABLE_VEHICLE_MOD\" member=\"Car.GetAvailableMod\">\n  改装槽可用模型，无则 -1。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06E5 GET_AVAILABLE_VEHICLE_MOD\n      in: self, slotId\n      out: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local modelId = getAvailableVehicleMod(self, slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getAvailableMod(self, slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 安装改装 [#安装改装]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06E7\" name=\"ADD_VEHICLE_MOD\" member=\"Car.AddMod\">\n  安装改装件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06E7 ADD_VEHICLE_MOD\n      in: self, modelId\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = addVehicleMod(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.addMod(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 卸下改装 [#卸下改装]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06E8\" name=\"REMOVE_VEHICLE_MOD\" member=\"Car.RemoveMod\">\n  卸下指定模型改装。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06E8 REMOVE_VEHICLE_MOD\n      in: self, modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeVehicleMod(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.removeMod(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 喷漆方案数量 [#喷漆方案数量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06EC\" name=\"GET_NUM_AVAILABLE_PAINTJOBS\" member=\"Car.GetNumAvailablePaintjobs\">\n  可选喷漆方案数量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06EC GET_NUM_AVAILABLE_PAINTJOBS\n      in: self\n      out: numPaintjobs\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local numPaintjobs = getNumAvailablePaintjobs(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getNumAvailablePaintjobs(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设喷漆方案 [#设喷漆方案]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06ED\" name=\"GIVE_VEHICLE_PAINTJOB\" member=\"Car.GivePaintjob\">\n  设喷漆方案。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06ED GIVE_VEHICLE_PAINTJOB\n      in: self, paintjobId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      giveVehiclePaintjob(self, paintjobId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.givePaintjob(self, paintjobId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否有卡住检测 [#是否有卡住检测]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06FC\" name=\"DOES_CAR_HAVE_STUCK_CAR_CHECK\" member=\"Car.DoesHaveStuckCarCheck\">\n  用在 if：是否启用卡住检测。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06FC DOES_CAR_HAVE_STUCK_CAR_CHECK\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doesCarHaveStuckCarCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.doesHaveStuckCarCheck(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 回放速度 [#回放速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06FD\" name=\"SET_PLAYBACK_SPEED\" member=\"Car.SetPlaybackSpeed\">\n  录像回放速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06FD SET_PLAYBACK_SPEED\n      in: self, speed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlaybackSpeed(self, speed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setPlaybackSpeed(self, speed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 狂奔驶向坐标 [#狂奔驶向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0704\" name=\"CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES_RACING\" member=\"Car.GotoCoordinatesRacing\">\n  AI 尽量超车狂奔到目的地。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0704 CAR_GOTO_COORDINATES_RACING\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      carGotoCoordinatesRacing(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.gotoCoordinatesRacing(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## AI 录像回放 [#ai-录像回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0705\" name=\"START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR_USING_AI\" member=\"Car.StartPlaybackUsingAi\">\n  开始录像回放并启用司机 AI。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0705 START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR_USING_AI\n      in: self, pathId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startPlaybackRecordedCarUsingAi(self, pathId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.startPlaybackUsingAi(self, pathId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 录像快进 [#录像快进]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0706\" name=\"SKIP_IN_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\" member=\"Car.SkipInPlayback\">\n  录像进度快进。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0706 SKIP_IN_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR\n      in: self, amount\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      skipInPlaybackRecordedCar(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.skipInPlayback(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 过场爆炸 [#过场爆炸]\n\n<Opcode id=\"070C\" name=\"EXPLODE_CAR_IN_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Car.ExplodeInCutscene\">\n  爆炸但不波及周围。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      070C EXPLODE_CAR_IN_CUTSCENE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      explodeCarInCutscene(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.explodeInCutscene(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 慢车道 [#慢车道]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0714\" name=\"SET_CAR_STAY_IN_SLOW_LANE\" member=\"Car.SetStayInSlowLane\">\n  尽量待在慢车道。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0714 SET_CAR_STAY_IN_SLOW_LANE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarStayInSlowLane(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setStayInSlowLane(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 损坏面板 [#损坏面板]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0730\" name=\"DAMAGE_CAR_PANEL\" member=\"Car.DamagePanel\">\n  损坏车身面板。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0730 DAMAGE_CAR_PANEL\n      in: self, panelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      damageCarPanel(self, panelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.damagePanel(self, panelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设俯仰角 [#设俯仰角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0731\" name=\"SET_CAR_ROLL\" member=\"Car.SetRoll\">\n  设俯仰角 Y。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0731 SET_CAR_ROLL\n      in: self, yAngle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarRoll(self, yAngle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setRoll(self, yAngle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 允许逆行 [#允许逆行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"073B\" name=\"SET_CAR_CAN_GO_AGAINST_TRAFFIC\" member=\"Car.SetCanGoAgainstTraffic\">\n  是否允许逆行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      073B SET_CAR_CAN_GO_AGAINST_TRAFFIC\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCanGoAgainstTraffic(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanGoAgainstTraffic(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 损坏车门 [#损坏车门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"073C\" name=\"DAMAGE_CAR_DOOR\" member=\"Car.DamageDoor\">\n  损坏部件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      073C DAMAGE_CAR_DOOR\n      in: self, door\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      damageCarDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.damageDoor(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 标记任务车 [#标记任务车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0763\" name=\"SET_CAR_AS_MISSION_CAR\" member=\"Car.SetAsMissionCar\">\n  标记脚本拥有并进任务清理列表。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0763 SET_CAR_AS_MISSION_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarAsMissionCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setAsMissionCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取横滚角 [#取横滚角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"077D\" name=\"GET_CAR_PITCH\" member=\"Car.GetPitch\">\n  取横滚角 X。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      077D GET_CAR_PITCH\n      in: self\n      out: angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local angle = getCarPitch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getPitch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取四元数 [#取四元数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07C5\" name=\"GET_VEHICLE_QUATERNION\" member=\"Car.GetQuaternion\">\n  取四元数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07C5 GET_VEHICLE_QUATERNION\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z, w\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z, w = getVehicleQuaternion(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getQuaternion(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设四元数 [#设四元数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07C6\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_QUATERNION\" member=\"Car.SetQuaternion\">\n  用四元数设旋转。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07C6 SET_VEHICLE_QUATERNION\n      in: self, x, y, z, w\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleQuaternion(self, x, y, z, w)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setQuaternion(self, x, y, z, w)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 施加力 [#施加力]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07D5\" name=\"APPLY_FORCE_TO_CAR\" member=\"Car.ApplyForce\">\n  相对质心施加力。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07D5 APPLY_FORCE_TO_CAR\n      in: self, xDir, yDir, zDir, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      applyForceToCar(self, xDir, yDir, zDir, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.applyForce(self, xDir, yDir, zDir, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 叠加角速度 [#叠加角速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07DA\" name=\"ADD_TO_CAR_ROTATION_VELOCITY\" member=\"Car.AddToRotationVelocity\">\n  叠加角速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07DA ADD_TO_CAR_ROTATION_VELOCITY\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addToCarRotationVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.addToRotationVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设角速度 [#设角速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07DB\" name=\"SET_CAR_ROTATION_VELOCITY\" member=\"Car.SetRotationVelocity\">\n  设角速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07DB SET_CAR_ROTATION_VELOCITY\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarRotationVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setRotationVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 总是拖胎印 [#总是拖胎印]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07EE\" name=\"SET_CAR_ALWAYS_CREATE_SKIDS\" member=\"Car.SetAlwaysCreateSkids\">\n  是否总是拖胎印。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07EE SET_CAR_ALWAYS_CREATE_SKIDS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarAlwaysCreateSkids(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setAlwaysCreateSkids(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 控制液压 [#控制液压]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07F5\" name=\"CONTROL_CAR_HYDRAULICS\" member=\"Car.ControlHydraulics\">\n  改悬挂高度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07F5 CONTROL_CAR_HYDRAULICS\n      in: self, frontLeftWheelSuspension, rearLeftWheelSuspension, frontRightWheelSuspension, rearRightWheelSuspension\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      controlCarHydraulics(self, frontLeftWheelSuspension, rearLeftWheelSuspension, frontRightWheelSuspension, rearRightWheelSuspension)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.controlHydraulics(self, frontLeftWheelSuspension, rearLeftWheelSuspension, frontRightWheelSuspension, rearRightWheelSuspension)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随车辆 [#跟随车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07F8\" name=\"SET_CAR_FOLLOW_CAR\" member=\"Car.SetFollowCar\">\n  跟随另一辆车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07F8 SET_CAR_FOLLOW_CAR\n      in: self, handle, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarFollowCar(self, handle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setFollowCar(self, handle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 启用液压 [#启用液压]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07FF\" name=\"SET_CAR_HYDRAULICS\" member=\"Car.SetHydraulics\">\n  启用液压悬挂。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07FF SET_CAR_HYDRAULICS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHydraulics(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setHydraulics(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否有液压 [#是否有液压]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0803\" name=\"DOES_CAR_HAVE_HYDRAULICS\" member=\"Car.DoesHaveHydraulics\">\n  用在 if：是否装了液压。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0803 DOES_CAR_HAVE_HYDRAULICS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doesCarHaveHydraulics(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.doesHaveHydraulics(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 引擎损坏 [#引擎损坏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"081D\" name=\"SET_CAR_ENGINE_BROKEN\" member=\"Car.SetEngineBroken\">\n  引擎是否损坏。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      081D SET_CAR_ENGINE_BROKEN\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEngineBroken(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEngineBroken(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 竖直倾角 [#竖直倾角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"083F\" name=\"GET_CAR_UPRIGHT_VALUE\" member=\"Car.GetUprightValue\">\n  取竖直倾角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      083F GET_CAR_UPRIGHT_VALUE\n      in: self\n      out: value\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local value = getCarUprightValue(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getUprightValue(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可见 interior [#可见-interior]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0840\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_AREA_VISIBLE\" member=\"Car.SetAreaVisible\">\n  可见 interior 区域。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0840 SET_VEHICLE_AREA_VISIBLE\n      in: self, interiorId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleAreaVisible(self, interiorId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setAreaVisible(self, interiorId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 选副武器 [#选副武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0841\" name=\"SELECT_WEAPONS_FOR_VEHICLE\" member=\"Car.SelectWeapons\">\n  使用副武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0841 SELECT_WEAPONS_FOR_VEHICLE\n      in: self, weapon\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      selectWeaponsForVehicle(self, weapon)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.selectWeapons(self, weapon)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可被瞄准 [#可被瞄准]\n\n<Opcode id=\"084E\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_CAN_BE_TARGETTED\" member=\"Car.SetCanBeTargeted\">\n  是否可被瞄准。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      084E SET_VEHICLE_CAN_BE_TARGETTED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleCanBeTargetted(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanBeTargeted(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 显示可见损伤 [#显示可见损伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0852\" name=\"SET_CAR_CAN_BE_VISIBLY_DAMAGED\" member=\"Car.SetCanBeVisiblyDamaged\">\n  是否显示可见损伤。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0852 SET_CAR_CAN_BE_VISIBLY_DAMAGED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCanBeVisiblyDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCanBeVisiblyDamaged(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 循环录像回放 [#循环录像回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"085E\" name=\"START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR_LOOPED\" member=\"Car.StartPlaybackLooped\">\n  循环播放录像路径。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      085E START_PLAYBACK_RECORDED_CAR_LOOPED\n      in: self, pathId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startPlaybackRecordedCarLooped(self, pathId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.startPlaybackLooped(self, pathId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脏污程度 [#脏污程度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0878\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_DIRT_LEVEL\" member=\"Car.SetDirtLevel\">\n  设置车辆脏污程度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0878 SET_VEHICLE_DIRT_LEVEL\n      in: self, level\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleDirtLevel(self, level)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setDirtLevel(self, level)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 空气阻力 [#空气阻力]\n\n<Opcode id=\"088B\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_AIR_RESISTANCE_MULTIPLIER\" member=\"Car.SetAirResistanceMultiplier\">\n  设置车辆空气阻力。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      088B SET_VEHICLE_AIR_RESISTANCE_MULTIPLIER\n      in: self, multiplier\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleAirResistanceMultiplier(self, multiplier)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setAirResistanceMultiplier(self, multiplier)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 无偏移设坐标 [#无偏移设坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"088C\" name=\"SET_CAR_COORDINATES_NO_OFFSET\" member=\"Car.SetCoordinatesNoOffset\">\n  直接设置车辆坐标，不按车高做偏移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      088C SET_CAR_COORDINATES_NO_OFFSET\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCoordinatesNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCoordinatesNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰到物体 [#碰到物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0897\" name=\"IS_VEHICLE_TOUCHING_OBJECT\" member=\"Car.IsTouchingObject\">\n  用在 if：车辆是否碰到该物体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0897 IS_VEHICLE_TOUCHING_OBJECT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isVehicleTouchingObject(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isTouchingObject(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 控制活动部件 [#控制活动部件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A4\" name=\"CONTROL_MOVABLE_VEHICLE_PART\" member=\"Car.ControlMovablePart\">\n  设置车辆 extra 部件角度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A4 CONTROL_MOVABLE_VEHICLE_PART\n      in: self, range\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      controlMovableVehiclePart(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.controlMovablePart(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可被吊起 [#可被吊起]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A5\" name=\"WINCH_CAN_PICK_VEHICLE_UP\" member=\"Car.WinchCanPickUp\">\n  设置车辆能否被磁力吊车吊起。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A5 WINCH_CAN_PICK_VEHICLE_UP\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      winchCanPickVehicleUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.winchCanPickUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车门开合角度 [#车门开合角度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A6\" name=\"OPEN_CAR_DOOR_A_BIT\" member=\"Car.OpenDoorABit\">\n  设置车门开合角度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A6 OPEN_CAR_DOOR_A_BIT\n      in: self, door, value\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      openCarDoorABit(self, door, value)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.openDoorABit(self, door, value)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车门是否全开 [#车门是否全开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A7\" name=\"IS_CAR_DOOR_FULLY_OPEN\" member=\"Car.IsDoorFullyOpen\">\n  用在 if：指定车门是否全开。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A7 IS_CAR_DOOR_FULLY_OPEN\n      in: self, door\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarDoorFullyOpen(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isDoorFullyOpen(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 过场爆炸特效 [#过场爆炸特效]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08CB\" name=\"EXPLODE_CAR_IN_CUTSCENE_SHAKE_AND_BITS\" member=\"Car.ExplodeInCutsceneShakeAndBits\">\n  让车辆爆炸，不伤及周围实体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08CB EXPLODE_CAR_IN_CUTSCENE_SHAKE_AND_BITS\n      in: self, shake, effect, sound\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      explodeCarInCutsceneShakeAndBits(self, shake, effect, sound)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.explodeInCutsceneShakeAndBits(self, shake, effect, sound)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车辆类别 [#车辆类别]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08EC\" name=\"GET_VEHICLE_CLASS\" member=\"Car.GetClass\">\n  返回 vehicles.ide 中定义的车辆类别。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08EC GET_VEHICLE_CLASS\n      in: self\n      out: class\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local class = getVehicleClass(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getClass(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 热导锁定 [#热导锁定]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08F2\" name=\"VEHICLE_CAN_BE_TARGETTED_BY_HS_MISSILE\" member=\"Car.CanBeTargetedByHsMissile\">\n  设置玩家能否用热导火箭锁定此车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08F2 VEHICLE_CAN_BE_TARGETTED_BY_HS_MISSILE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      vehicleCanBeTargettedByHsMissile(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.canBeTargetedByHsMissile(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内赠品 [#车内赠品]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08F3\" name=\"SET_FREEBIES_IN_VEHICLE\" member=\"Car.SetFreebies\">\n  设置玩家能否从此车获得物品（如警车散弹弹药、出租车现金）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08F3 SET_FREEBIES_IN_VEHICLE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFreebiesInVehicle(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setFreebies(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 引擎开关 [#引擎开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0918\" name=\"SET_CAR_ENGINE_ON\" member=\"Car.SetEngineOn\">\n  设置车辆引擎开关。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0918 SET_CAR_ENGINE_ON\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarEngineOn(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setEngineOn(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 灯光开关 [#灯光开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0919\" name=\"SET_CAR_LIGHTS_ON\" member=\"Car.SetLightsOn\">\n  设置车辆灯光开关。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0919 SET_CAR_LIGHTS_ON\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarLightsOn(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setLightsOn(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到物体 [#附着到物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0939\" name=\"ATTACH_CAR_TO_OBJECT\" member=\"Car.AttachToObject\">\n  按偏移与旋转把车附着到物体上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0939 ATTACH_CAR_TO_OBJECT\n      in: self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCarToObject(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.attachToObject(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, xRotation, yRotation, zRotation)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可当掩体 [#可当掩体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0957\" name=\"VEHICLE_DOES_PROVIDE_COVER\" member=\"Car.DoesProvideCover\">\n  设置战斗中角色是否会把此车当掩体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0957 VEHICLE_DOES_PROVIDE_COVER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      vehicleDoesProvideCover(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.doesProvideCover(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 控制车门 [#控制车门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"095E\" name=\"CONTROL_CAR_DOOR\" member=\"Car.ControlDoor\">\n  设置车门角度与闩锁状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      095E CONTROL_CAR_DOOR\n      in: self, door, state, angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      controlCarDoor(self, door, state, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.controlDoor(self, door, state, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车门角度比 [#车门角度比]\n\n<Opcode id=\"095F\" name=\"GET_DOOR_ANGLE_RATIO\" member=\"Car.GetDoorAngleRatio\">\n  获取指定车门相对铰链的角度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      095F GET_DOOR_ANGLE_RATIO\n      in: self, door\n      out: ratio\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ratio = getDoorAngleRatio(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getDoorAngleRatio(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否大车 [#是否大车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0969\" name=\"IS_BIG_VEHICLE\" member=\"Car.IsBig\">\n  用在 if：车辆在 vehicles 中是否标了 is big。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0969 IS_BIG_VEHICLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isBigVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isBig(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 存改装状态 [#存改装状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096B\" name=\"STORE_CAR_MOD_STATE\" member=\"Car.StoreModState\">\n  保存改装状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096B STORE_CAR_MOD_STATE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      storeCarModState()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.storeModState()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 恢复改装状态 [#恢复改装状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096C\" name=\"RESTORE_CAR_MOD_STATE\" member=\"Car.RestoreModState\">\n  恢复改装状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096C RESTORE_CAR_MOD_STATE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      restoreCarModState()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.restoreModState()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前改装 [#当前改装]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096D\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_CAR_MOD\" member=\"Car.GetCurrentMod\">\n  返回车辆指定槽位已装组件模型，否则 -1。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096D GET_CURRENT_CAR_MOD\n      in: self, slot\n      out: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local modelId = getCurrentCarMod(self, slot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getCurrentMod(self, slot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否低底盘 [#是否低底盘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096E\" name=\"IS_CAR_LOW_RIDER\" member=\"Car.IsLowRider\">\n  用在 if：是否低底盘车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096E IS_CAR_LOW_RIDER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarLowRider(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isLowRider(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否街头赛车 [#是否街头赛车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096F\" name=\"IS_CAR_STREET_RACER\" member=\"Car.IsStreetRacer\">\n  用在 if：是否街头赛车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096F IS_CAR_STREET_RACER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarStreetRacer(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isStreetRacer(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否应急车 [#是否应急车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0975\" name=\"IS_EMERGENCY_SERVICES_VEHICLE\" member=\"Car.IsEmergencyServices\">\n  用在 if：是否应急车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0975 IS_EMERGENCY_SERVICES_VEHICLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isEmergencyServicesVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isEmergencyServices(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 配色种数 [#配色种数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"097D\" name=\"GET_NUM_CAR_COLOURS\" member=\"Car.GetNumColors\">\n  返回 carcols.dat 中该车模型定义的配色种数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      097D GET_NUM_CAR_COLOURS\n      in: self\n      out: count\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local count = getNumCarColours(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getNumColors(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 挡路车辆 [#挡路车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0987\" name=\"GET_CAR_BLOCKING_CAR\" member=\"Car.GetBlockingCar\">\n  返回挡住此车去路的车辆句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0987 GET_CAR_BLOCKING_CAR\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = getCarBlockingCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getBlockingCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前喷漆 [#当前喷漆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0988\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_VEHICLE_PAINTJOB\" member=\"Car.GetCurrentPaintjob\">\n  获取车辆喷漆方案。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0988 GET_CURRENT_VEHICLE_PAINTJOB\n      in: self\n      out: paintjobNumber\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local paintjobNumber = getCurrentVehiclePaintjob(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getCurrentPaintjob(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 活动部件偏移 [#活动部件偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"098D\" name=\"GET_CAR_MOVING_COMPONENT_OFFSET\" member=\"Car.GetMovingComponentOffset\">\n  取车辆 extra 部件偏移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      098D GET_CAR_MOVING_COMPONENT_OFFSET\n      in: self\n      out: offset\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local offset = getCarMovingComponentOffset(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getMovingComponentOffset(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰撞开关 [#碰撞开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"099A\" name=\"SET_CAR_COLLISION\" member=\"Car.SetCollision\">\n  设置车辆碰撞开关。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      099A SET_CAR_COLLISION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 回放切 AI [#回放切-ai]\n\n<Opcode id=\"099B\" name=\"CHANGE_PLAYBACK_TO_USE_AI\" member=\"Car.ChangePlaybackToUseAi\">\n  把车辆控制从录像回放切到 AI 驾驶。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      099B CHANGE_PLAYBACK_TO_USE_AI\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changePlaybackToUseAi(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.changePlaybackToUseAi(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 乘客随机说话 [#乘客随机说话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09AB\" name=\"RANDOM_PASSENGER_SAY\" member=\"Car.RandomPassengerSay\">\n  让车内乘客按环境语音 ID 说话（若角色有对应语音）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09AB RANDOM_PASSENGER_SAY\n      in: self, phrase\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      randomPassengerSay(self, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.randomPassengerSay(self, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否考虑上车 [#玩家是否考虑上车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B0\" name=\"SET_VEHICLE_IS_CONSIDERED_BY_PLAYER\" member=\"Car.SetIsConsideredByPlayer\">\n  玩家按上车键时忽略此车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B0 SET_VEHICLE_IS_CONSIDERED_BY_PLAYER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVehicleIsConsideredByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setIsConsideredByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 门锁状态 [#门锁状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B3\" name=\"GET_CAR_DOOR_LOCK_STATUS\" member=\"Car.GetDoorLockStatus\">\n  返回车辆门锁模式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B3 GET_CAR_DOOR_LOCK_STATUS\n      in: self\n      out: lockStatus\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local lockStatus = getCarDoorLockStatus(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getDoorLockStatus(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车门是否损坏 [#车门是否损坏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BB\" name=\"IS_CAR_DOOR_DAMAGED\" member=\"Car.IsDoorDamaged\">\n  用在 if：指定车身部位是否可见损坏。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BB IS_CAR_DOOR_DAMAGED\n      in: self, door\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarDoorDamaged(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isDoorDamaged(self, door)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 油箱弱点 [#油箱弱点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09C4\" name=\"SET_PETROL_TANK_WEAKPOINT\" member=\"Car.SetPetrolTankWeakpoint\">\n  设置能否通过射击油箱引爆车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09C4 SET_PETROL_TANK_WEAKPOINT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPetrolTankWeakpoint(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setPetrolTankWeakpoint(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰到另一车 [#碰到另一车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09CB\" name=\"IS_CAR_TOUCHING_CAR\" member=\"Car.IsTouchingCar\">\n  用在 if：此车是否碰到另一辆车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09CB IS_CAR_TOUCHING_CAR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCarTouchingCar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isTouchingCar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 全轮着地 [#全轮着地]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09D0\" name=\"IS_VEHICLE_ON_ALL_WHEELS\" member=\"Car.IsOnAllWheels\">\n  用在 if：全部车轮是否都着地。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09D0 IS_VEHICLE_ON_ALL_WHEELS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isVehicleOnAllWheels(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.isOnAllWheels(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车型价值 [#车型价值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E1\" name=\"GET_CAR_MODEL_VALUE\" member=\"Car.GetModelValue\">\n  返回指定车型的价值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E1 GET_CAR_MODEL_VALUE\n      in: model\n      out: value\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local value = getCarModelValue(model)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getModelValue(model)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 给氮气 [#给氮气]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E9\" name=\"GIVE_NON_PLAYER_CAR_NITRO\" member=\"Car.GiveNonPlayerNitro\">\n  给车装一瓶氮气。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E9 GIVE_NON_PLAYER_CAR_NITRO\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      giveNonPlayerCarNitro(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.giveNonPlayerNitro(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 重置液压 [#重置液压]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09FE\" name=\"RESET_VEHICLE_HYDRAULICS\" member=\"Car.ResetHydraulics\">\n  重置车辆全部液压，使车身落回。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09FE RESET_VEHICLE_HYDRAULICS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      resetVehicleHydraulics(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.resetHydraulics(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设附加色 [#设附加色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A11\" name=\"SET_EXTRA_CAR_COLOURS\" member=\"Car.SetExtraColors\">\n  设置车辆第三、第四配色。另见 0229。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A11 SET_EXTRA_CAR_COLOURS\n      in: self, color3, color4\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setExtraCarColours(self, color3, color4)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.setExtraColors(self, color3, color4)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取附加色 [#取附加色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A12\" name=\"GET_EXTRA_CAR_COLOURS\" member=\"Car.GetExtraColors\">\n  返回车辆第三、第四配色。另见 03F3。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A12 GET_EXTRA_CAR_COLOURS\n      in: self\n      out: color3, color4\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local color3, color4 = getExtraCarColours(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.getExtraColors(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否刚喷漆 [#是否刚喷漆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A15\" name=\"HAS_CAR_BEEN_RESPRAYED\" member=\"Car.HasBeenResprayed\">\n  用在 if：上一帧是否刚喷漆过，并会把喷漆状态清回 false。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A15 HAS_CAR_BEEN_RESPRAYED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCarBeenResprayed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.hasBeenResprayed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 完美操控作弊 [#完美操控作弊]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A21\" name=\"IMPROVE_CAR_BY_CHEATING\" member=\"Car.ImproveByCheating\">\n  设置 NPC 驾驶时是否受完美操控作弊影响。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A21 IMPROVE_CAR_BY_CHEATING\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      improveCarByCheating(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.improveByCheating(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 修好车辆 [#修好车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A30\" name=\"FIX_CAR\" member=\"Car.Fix\">\n  把车辆修好并恢复满血。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A30 FIX_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fixCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Car.fix(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 载具生成 CarGenerator (/docs/cleo/sa/default/cargenerator)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 7 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建 [#创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"014B\" name=\"CREATE_CAR_GENERATOR\" member=\"CarGenerator.Create\">\n  创建停车生成器（`modelId` -1 用本地 popcycle 随机车）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      014B CREATE_CAR_GENERATOR\n      in: x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCarGenerator(x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = CarGenerator.create(x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开关次数 [#开关次数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"014C\" name=\"SWITCH_CAR_GENERATOR\" member=\"CarGenerator.Switch\">\n  生成次数（101 = 无限）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      014C SWITCH_CAR_GENERATOR\n      in: self, amount\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchCarGenerator(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      CarGenerator.switch(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 禁用车模 [#禁用车模]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0732\" name=\"SUPPRESS_CAR_MODEL\" member=\"CarGenerator.SuppressCarModel\">\n  禁止该车模被停车生成器刷出。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0732 SUPPRESS_CAR_MODEL\n      in: model\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      suppressCarModel(model)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      CarGenerator.suppressCarModel(model)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 允许车模 [#允许车模]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0733\" name=\"DONT_SUPPRESS_CAR_MODEL\" member=\"CarGenerator.DontSuppressCarModel\">\n  允许该车模再被生成器刷出。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0733 DONT_SUPPRESS_CAR_MODEL\n      in: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dontSuppressCarModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      CarGenerator.dontSuppressCarModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清空禁用 [#清空禁用]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0734\" name=\"DONT_SUPPRESS_ANY_CAR_MODELS\" member=\"CarGenerator.DontSuppressAnyCarModels\">\n  清空生成器禁用车模列表。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0734 DONT_SUPPRESS_ANY_CAR_MODELS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dontSuppressAnyCarModels()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      CarGenerator.dontSuppressAnyCarModels()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 带车牌创建 [#带车牌创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E2\" name=\"CREATE_CAR_GENERATOR_WITH_PLATE\" member=\"CarGenerator.CreateWithPlate\">\n  带车牌的停车生成器（`modelId` -1 随机）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E2 CREATE_CAR_GENERATOR_WITH_PLATE\n      in: x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay, plateName\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCarGeneratorWithPlate(x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay, plateName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = CarGenerator.createWithPlate(x, y, z, heading, modelId, primaryColor, secondaryColor, forceSpawn, alarmChance, doorLockChance, minDelay, maxDelay, plateName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 已拥有标记 [#已拥有标记]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A17\" name=\"SET_HAS_BEEN_OWNED_FOR_CAR_GENERATOR\" member=\"CarGenerator.SetHasBeenOwned\">\n  从该生成器上车是否不因附近警察立刻通缉。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A17 SET_HAS_BEEN_OWNED_FOR_CAR_GENERATOR\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHasBeenOwnedForCarGenerator(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      CarGenerator.setHasBeenOwned(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 角色 Char (/docs/cleo/sa/default/char)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 252 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建角色 [#创建角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"009A\" name=\"CREATE_CHAR\" member=\"Char.Create\">\n  在指定位置创建角色，使用给定模型与 pedtype。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      009A CREATE_CHAR\n      in: pedType, modelId, x, y, z\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createChar(pedType, modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.create(pedType, modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除角色 [#删除角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"009B\" name=\"DELETE_CHAR\" member=\"Char.Delete\">\n  从游戏和任务清理列表移除角色并释放内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      009B DELETE_CHAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      deleteChar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.delete(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取坐标 [#取坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A0\" name=\"GET_CHAR_COORDINATES\" member=\"Char.GetCoordinates\">\n  返回角色坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A0 GET_CHAR_COORDINATES\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getCharCoordinates(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getCoordinates(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设坐标 [#设坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A1\" name=\"SET_CHAR_COORDINATES\" member=\"Char.SetCoordinates\">\n  把角色放到指定位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A1 SET_CHAR_COORDINATES\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCoordinates(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在 2D 区域 [#是否在-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A3\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInArea2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A3 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在 3D 区域 [#是否在-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00A4\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInArea3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00A4 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 存当前车辆 [#存当前车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00D9\" name=\"STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_IN\" member=\"Char.StoreCarIsIn\">\n  返回角色当前车辆并加入任务清理列表（另见 03C0、0811、0484）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00D9 STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_IN\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = storeCarCharIsIn(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.storeCarIsIn(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在指定车 [#是否在指定车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00DB\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsInCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在指定车辆中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00DB IS_CHAR_IN_CAR\n      in: self, vehicle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在指定车型 [#是否在指定车型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00DD\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_MODEL\" member=\"Char.IsInModel\">\n  用在 if：角色是否驾驶指定模型车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00DD IS_CHAR_IN_MODEL\n      in: self, modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在任意车 [#是否在任意车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00DF\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否拥有车辆（含开关门过程，未必已坐稳）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00DF IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 任意方式在 2D 点 [#任意方式在-2d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00EC\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeans2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00EC LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeans2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeans2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 徒步在 2D 点 [#徒步在-2d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00ED\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00ED LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFoot2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFoot2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内在 2D 点 [#车内在-2d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00EE\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00EE LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下任意 2D [#停下任意-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00EF\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedAnyMeans2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否已停在坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00EF LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharAnyMeans2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedAnyMeans2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步 2D [#停下徒步-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00F0\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00F0 LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharOnFoot2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedOnFoot2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内 2D [#停下车内-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00F1\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内停在坐标点 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00F1 LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharInCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedInCar2D(self, x, y, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色任意 2D [#相对角色任意-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00F2\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CHAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansChar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在另一角色 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00F2 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CHAR_2D\n      in: self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansChar2D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansChar2D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色徒步 2D [#相对角色徒步-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00F3\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CHAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootChar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在另一角色 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00F3 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CHAR_2D\n      in: self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootChar2D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootChar2D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色车内 2D [#相对角色车内-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00F4\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CHAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarChar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于另一角色 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00F4 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CHAR_2D\n      in: self, otherChar, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarChar2D(self, otherChar, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarChar2D(self, otherChar, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 任意方式在 3D 点 [#任意方式在-3d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00FE\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeans3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00FE LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeans3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeans3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 徒步在 3D 点 [#徒步在-3d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00FF\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00FF LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFoot3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFoot3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内在 3D 点 [#车内在-3d-点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0100\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0100 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下任意 3D [#停下任意-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0101\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedAnyMeans3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否已停在坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0101 LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharAnyMeans3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedAnyMeans3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步 3D [#停下徒步-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0102\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0102 LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharOnFoot3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedOnFoot3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内 3D [#停下车内-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0103\" name=\"LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateStoppedInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内停在坐标点 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0103 LOCATE_STOPPED_CHAR_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateStoppedCharInCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateStoppedInCar3D(self, x, y, z, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色任意 3D [#相对角色任意-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0104\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CHAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansChar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在另一角色 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0104 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CHAR_3D\n      in: self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色徒步 3D [#相对角色徒步-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0105\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CHAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootChar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在另一角色 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0105 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CHAR_3D\n      in: self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对角色车内 3D [#相对角色车内-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0106\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CHAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarChar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于另一角色 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0106 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CHAR_3D\n      in: self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarChar3D(self, target, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加弹药 [#加弹药]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0114\" name=\"ADD_AMMO_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Char.AddAmmo\">\n  若角色持有该武器，则增加指定弹药量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0114 ADD_AMMO_TO_CHAR\n      in: self, weaponType, ammo\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addAmmoToChar(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.addAmmo(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否死亡 [#是否死亡]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0118\" name=\"IS_CHAR_DEAD\" member=\"Char.IsDead\">\n  用在 if：句柄无效或角色已死（wasted）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0118 IS_CHAR_DEAD\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharDead(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isDead(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内创建角色 [#车内创建角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0129\" name=\"CREATE_CHAR_INSIDE_CAR\" member=\"Char.CreateInsideCar\">\n  在车辆驾驶座创建角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0129 CREATE_CHAR_INSIDE_CAR\n      in: vehicle, pedType, modelId\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCharInsideCar(vehicle, pedType, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createInsideCar(vehicle, pedType, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在区域 [#是否在区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0154\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ZONE\" member=\"Char.IsInZone\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在指定地图区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0154 IS_CHAR_IN_ZONE\n      in: self, zone\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInZone(self, zone)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInZone(self, zone)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取朝向 [#取朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0172\" name=\"GET_CHAR_HEADING\" member=\"Char.GetHeading\">\n  返回角色朝向角（Z 角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0172 GET_CHAR_HEADING\n      in: self\n      out: heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local heading = getCharHeading(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getHeading(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设朝向 [#设朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0173\" name=\"SET_CHAR_HEADING\" member=\"Char.SetHeading\">\n  设置角色朝向角（Z 角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0173 SET_CHAR_HEADING\n      in: self, heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰到物体 [#碰到物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0179\" name=\"IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_OBJECT\" member=\"Char.IsTouchingObject\">\n  用在 if：角色是否与指定物体碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0179 IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_OBJECT\n      in: self, object\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharTouchingObject(self, object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isTouchingObject(self, object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设弹药 [#设弹药]\n\n<Opcode id=\"017B\" name=\"SET_CHAR_AMMO\" member=\"Char.SetAmmo\">\n  设置角色指定武器的弹药量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      017B SET_CHAR_AMMO\n      in: self, weaponType, ammo\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAmmo(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAmmo(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 生命是否更高 [#生命是否更高]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0184\" name=\"IS_CHAR_HEALTH_GREATER\" member=\"Char.IsHealthGreater\">\n  用在 if：角色生命是否高于指定值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0184 IS_CHAR_HEALTH_GREATER\n      in: self, health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharHealthGreater(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isHealthGreater(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 徒步在 2D 区域 [#徒步在-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A1\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInAreaOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A1 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内在 2D 区域 [#车内在-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A2\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInAreaInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A2 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下在 2D 区域 [#停下在-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A3\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInArea2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否已停在指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A3 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步 2D 区域 [#停下徒步-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A4\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAreaOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A4 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内 2D 区域 [#停下车内-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A5\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAreaInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内停在指定 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A5 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 徒步在 3D 区域 [#徒步在-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A6\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInAreaOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A6 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内在 3D 区域 [#车内在-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A7\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInAreaInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A7 IS_CHAR_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下在 3D 区域 [#停下在-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A8\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInArea3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否已停在指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A8 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步 3D 区域 [#停下徒步-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01A9\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAreaOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01A9 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内 3D 区域 [#停下车内-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01AA\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAreaInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内停在指定 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01AA IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 给武器 [#给武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01B2\" name=\"GIVE_WEAPON_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Char.GiveWeapon\">\n  给角色指定武器及弹药量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01B2 GIVE_WEAPON_TO_CHAR\n      in: self, weaponType, ammo\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      giveWeaponToChar(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.giveWeapon(self, weaponType, ammo)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设当前武器 [#设当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01B9\" name=\"SET_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.SetCurrentWeapon\">\n  设置角色当前手持武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01B9 SET_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCurrentCharWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCurrentWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 标记不再需要 [#标记不再需要]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C2\" name=\"MARK_CHAR_AS_NO_LONGER_NEEDED\" member=\"Char.MarkAsNoLongerNeeded\">\n  允许游戏按需删除角色，并在适用时移出任务清理列表。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C2 MARK_CHAR_AS_NO_LONGER_NEEDED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      markCharAsNoLongerNeeded(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.markAsNoLongerNeeded(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 不随任务删除 [#不随任务删除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C5\" name=\"DONT_REMOVE_CHAR\" member=\"Char.DontRemove\">\n  从任务清理列表移除角色，任务结束时不会被删。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C5 DONT_REMOVE_CHAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dontRemoveChar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.dontRemove(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 乘客位创建 [#乘客位创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C8\" name=\"CREATE_CHAR_AS_PASSENGER\" member=\"Char.CreateAsPassenger\">\n  用指定模型在车辆乘客座创建角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C8 CREATE_CHAR_AS_PASSENGER\n      in: vehicle, pedType, modelId, seat\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCharAsPassenger(vehicle, pedType, modelId, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createAsPassenger(vehicle, pedType, modelId, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆任意 2D [#相对车辆任意-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0202\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车辆 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0202 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CAR_2D\n      in: self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansCar2D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansCar2D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆徒步 2D [#相对车辆徒步-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0203\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在车辆 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0203 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CAR_2D\n      in: self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootCar2D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootCar2D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆车内 2D [#相对车辆车内-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0204\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于车辆 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0204 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CAR_2D\n      in: self, handle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarCar2D(self, handle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarCar2D(self, handle, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆任意 3D [#相对车辆任意-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0205\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车辆 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0205 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_CAR_3D\n      in: self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆徒步 3D [#相对车辆徒步-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0206\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在车辆 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0206 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_CAR_3D\n      in: self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对车辆车内 3D [#相对车辆车内-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0207\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于车辆 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0207 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_CAR_3D\n      in: self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarCar3D(self, vehicle, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设生命 [#设生命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0223\" name=\"SET_CHAR_HEALTH\" member=\"Char.SetHealth\">\n  设置角色生命值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0223 SET_CHAR_HEALTH\n      in: self, health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharHealth(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setHealth(self, health)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取生命 [#取生命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0226\" name=\"GET_CHAR_HEALTH\" member=\"Char.GetHealth\">\n  返回角色生命值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0226 GET_CHAR_HEALTH\n      in: self\n      out: health\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local health = getCharHealth(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getHealth(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 徒步碰到物体 [#徒步碰到物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"023B\" name=\"IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_OBJECT_ON_FOOT\" member=\"Char.IsTouchingObjectOnFoot\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步与指定物体碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      023B IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_OBJECT_ON_FOOT\n      in: self, object\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharTouchingObjectOnFoot(self, object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isTouchingObjectOnFoot(self, object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 动画组 [#动画组]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0245\" name=\"SET_ANIM_GROUP_FOR_CHAR\" member=\"Char.SetAnimGroup\">\n  设置角色动画组。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0245 SET_ANIM_GROUP_FOR_CHAR\n      in: self, animGroup\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAnimGroupForChar(self, animGroup)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAnimGroup(self, animGroup)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否停下 [#是否停下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02A0\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED\" member=\"Char.IsStopped\">\n  用在 if：角色是否未在移动。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02A0 IS_CHAR_STOPPED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStopped(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStopped(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 仅玩家可伤 [#仅玩家可伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02A9\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ONLY_DAMAGED_BY_PLAYER\" member=\"Char.SetOnlyDamagedByPlayer\">\n  让角色免疫除玩家外的一切伤害。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02A9 SET_CHAR_ONLY_DAMAGED_BY_PLAYER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharOnlyDamagedByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setOnlyDamagedByPlayer(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 伤害免疫 [#伤害免疫]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02AB\" name=\"SET_CHAR_PROOFS\" member=\"Char.SetProofs\">\n  设置角色各类免疫。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02AB SET_CHAR_PROOFS\n      in: self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharProofs(self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setProofs(self, bulletProof, fireProof, explosionProof, collisionProof, meleeProof)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在屏上 [#是否在屏上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02CB\" name=\"IS_CHAR_ON_SCREEN\" member=\"Char.IsOnScreen\">\n  用在 if：角色是否可见。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02CB IS_CHAR_ON_SCREEN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharOnScreen(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isOnScreen(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区域内是否开火 [#区域内是否开火]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02D6\" name=\"IS_CHAR_SHOOTING_IN_AREA\" member=\"Char.IsShootingInArea\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在指定 2D 区域内开过火。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02D6 IS_CHAR_SHOOTING_IN_AREA\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, topRightX, topRightY, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharShootingInArea(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, topRightX, topRightY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isShootingInArea(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, topRightX, topRightY, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否当前武器 [#是否当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02D8\" name=\"IS_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.IsCurrentWeapon\">\n  用在 if：角色是否手持指定类型武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02D8 IS_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCurrentCharWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isCurrentWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否开火中 [#是否开火中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E0\" name=\"IS_CHAR_SHOOTING\" member=\"Char.IsShooting\">\n  用在 if：角色是否正在开火。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E0 IS_CHAR_SHOOTING\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharShooting(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isShooting(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 射击精度 [#射击精度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E2\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ACCURACY\" member=\"Char.SetAccuracy\">\n  影响角色用武器攻击时的命中频率。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E2 SET_CHAR_ACCURACY\n      in: self, accuracy\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAccuracy(self, accuracy)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAccuracy(self, accuracy)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否指定模型 [#是否指定模型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02F2\" name=\"IS_CHAR_MODEL\" member=\"Char.IsModel\">\n  用在 if：角色模型 ID 是否等于给定模型 ID。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02F2 IS_CHAR_MODEL\n      in: self, modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isModel(self, modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被武器击中 [#被武器击中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"031D\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.HasBeenDamagedByWeapon\">\n  用在 if：角色是否被指定武器击中过。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      031D HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharBeenDamagedByWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasBeenDamagedByWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 爆头肢解 [#爆头肢解]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0321\" name=\"EXPLODE_CHAR_HEAD\" member=\"Char.ExplodeHead\">\n  肢解角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0321 EXPLODE_CHAR_HEAD\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      explodeCharHead(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.explodeHead(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 流血 [#流血]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0332\" name=\"SET_CHAR_BLEEDING\" member=\"Char.SetBleeding\">\n  让角色流血。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0332 SET_CHAR_BLEEDING\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharBleeding(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setBleeding(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 显隐 [#显隐]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0337\" name=\"SET_CHAR_VISIBLE\" member=\"Char.SetVisible\">\n  设置角色是否可见。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0337 SET_CHAR_VISIBLE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharVisible(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setVisible(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 优雅移除 [#优雅移除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"034F\" name=\"REMOVE_CHAR_ELEGANTLY\" member=\"Char.RemoveElegantly\">\n  淡出移除角色并释放内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      034F REMOVE_CHAR_ELEGANTLY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeCharElegantly(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.removeElegantly(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 保持原地 [#保持原地]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0350\" name=\"SET_CHAR_STAY_IN_SAME_PLACE\" member=\"Char.SetStayInSamePlace\">\n  受攻击时让角色保持原位。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0350 SET_CHAR_STAY_IN_SAME_PLACE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharStayInSamePlace(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setStayInSamePlace(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加护甲 [#加护甲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"035F\" name=\"ADD_ARMOUR_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Char.AddArmor\">\n  按指定值增加护甲，上限 100。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      035F ADD_ARMOUR_TO_CHAR\n      in: self, amount\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addArmourToChar(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.addArmor(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 从车拉到坐标 [#从车拉到坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0362\" name=\"WARP_CHAR_FROM_CAR_TO_COORD\" member=\"Char.WarpFromCarToCoord\">\n  把角色从车里拉出并放到指定位置。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0362 WARP_CHAR_FROM_CAR_TO_COORD\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      warpCharFromCarToCoord(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.warpFromCarToCoord(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否看见目标 [#是否看见目标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0364\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_SPOTTED_CHAR\" member=\"Char.HasSpottedChar\">\n  用在 if：角色能否看见目标角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0364 HAS_CHAR_SPOTTED_CHAR\n      in: self, target\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharSpottedChar(self, target)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasSpottedChar(self, target)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 瞬移进车 [#瞬移进车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"036A\" name=\"WARP_CHAR_INTO_CAR\" member=\"Char.WarpIntoCar\">\n  把角色放进指定车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      036A WARP_CHAR_INTO_CAR\n      in: self, vehicle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      warpCharIntoCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.warpIntoCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 创建随机角色 [#创建随机角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0376\" name=\"CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR\" member=\"Char.CreateRandom\">\n  在指定坐标创建模型与 pedtype 随机的角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0376 CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR\n      in: x, y, z\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createRandomChar(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createRandom(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 动画速度 [#动画速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0393\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ANIM_SPEED\" member=\"Char.SetAnimSpeed\">\n  让角色按指定速度播放动画。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0393 SET_CHAR_ANIM_SPEED\n      in: self, animName, animSpeed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAnimSpeed(self, animName, animSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAnimSpeed(self, animName, animSpeed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 不可拖出车 [#不可拖出车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"039E\" name=\"SET_CHAR_CANT_BE_DRAGGED_OUT\" member=\"Char.SetCantBeDraggedOut\">\n  锁定在车内的角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      039E SET_CHAR_CANT_BE_DRAGGED_OUT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCantBeDraggedOut(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCantBeDraggedOut(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否男性 [#是否男性]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03A3\" name=\"IS_CHAR_MALE\" member=\"Char.IsMale\">\n  用在 if：角色是否为男性。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03A3 IS_CHAR_MALE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharMale(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isMale(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取车不保存 [#取车不保存]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C0\" name=\"STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_IN_NO_SAVE\" member=\"Char.StoreCarIsInNoSave\">\n  返回角色车辆句柄且不标记为脚本占用，游戏随时可删（另见 00D9、0811、0484）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C0 STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_IN_NO_SAVE\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = storeCarCharIsInNoSave(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.storeCarIsInNoSave(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设现金 [#设现金]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03FE\" name=\"SET_CHAR_MONEY\" member=\"Char.SetMoney\">\n  设置角色现金，决定死后掉落金额。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03FE SET_CHAR_MONEY\n      in: self, amount\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharMoney(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setMoney(self, amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取武器弹药 [#取武器弹药]\n\n<Opcode id=\"041A\" name=\"GET_AMMO_IN_CHAR_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.GetAmmoInWeapon\">\n  获取角色指定武器的弹药量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      041A GET_AMMO_IN_CHAR_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      out: ammo\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local ammo = getAmmoInCharWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getAmmoInWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 瞬移乘客座 [#瞬移乘客座]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0430\" name=\"WARP_CHAR_INTO_CAR_AS_PASSENGER\" member=\"Char.WarpIntoCarAsPassenger\">\n  把角色放进车辆乘客座。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0430 WARP_CHAR_INTO_CAR_AS_PASSENGER\n      in: self, handle, seat\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      warpCharIntoCarAsPassenger(self, handle, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.warpIntoCarAsPassenger(self, handle, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 精神病杀手 [#精神病杀手]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0433\" name=\"SET_CHAR_IS_CHRIS_CRIMINAL\" member=\"Char.SetIsChrisCriminal\">\n  设置角色是否为精神病杀手。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0433 SET_CHAR_IS_CHRIS_CRIMINAL\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharIsChrisCriminal(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setIsChrisCriminal(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 爆头致命 [#爆头致命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0446\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SUFFERS_CRITICAL_HITS\" member=\"Char.SetSuffersCriticalHits\">\n  设置角色是否免疫爆头。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0446 SET_CHAR_SUFFERS_CRITICAL_HITS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharSuffersCriticalHits(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSuffersCriticalHits(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否坐在指定车 [#是否坐在指定车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0448\" name=\"IS_CHAR_SITTING_IN_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsSittingInCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否坐在指定车辆中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0448 IS_CHAR_SITTING_IN_CAR\n      in: self, vehicle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharSittingInCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isSittingInCar(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否坐在任意车 [#是否坐在任意车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0449\" name=\"IS_CHAR_SITTING_IN_ANY_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsSittingInAnyCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否坐在任意车辆中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0449 IS_CHAR_SITTING_IN_ANY_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharSittingInAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isSittingInAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否徒步 [#是否徒步]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044B\" name=\"IS_CHAR_ON_FOOT\" member=\"Char.IsOnFoot\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步且未占用车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044B IS_CHAR_ON_FOOT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharOnFoot(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isOnFoot(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到车炮塔 [#附着到车炮塔]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0464\" name=\"ATTACH_CHAR_TO_CAR\" member=\"Char.AttachToCar\">\n  把角色放到车辆炮塔位以便射击。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0464 ATTACH_CHAR_TO_CAR\n      in: self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCharToCar(self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.attachToCar(self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脱离炮塔 [#脱离炮塔]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0465\" name=\"DETACH_CHAR_FROM_CAR\" member=\"Char.DetachFromCar\">\n  把角色移出炮塔模式（0464）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0465 DETACH_CHAR_FROM_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      detachCharFromCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.detachFromCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清武器伤害记录 [#清武器伤害记录]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0467\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_LAST_WEAPON_DAMAGE\" member=\"Char.ClearLastWeaponDamage\">\n  清除角色最近一次武器伤害记录（见 031D）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0467 CLEAR_CHAR_LAST_WEAPON_DAMAGE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharLastWeaponDamage(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearLastWeaponDamage(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随者数量 [#跟随者数量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"046D\" name=\"GET_NUMBER_OF_FOLLOWERS\" member=\"Char.GetNumberOfFollowers\">\n  返回角色所在小队成员数（01DE）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      046D GET_NUMBER_OF_FOLLOWERS\n      in: self\n      out: number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local number = getNumberOfFollowers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getNumberOfFollowers(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取当前武器 [#取当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0470\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.GetCurrentWeapon\">\n  返回角色当前手持武器类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0470 GET_CURRENT_CHAR_WEAPON\n      in: self\n      out: weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local weaponType = getCurrentCharWeapon(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getCurrentWeapon(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体任意 2D [#相对物体任意-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0471\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_OBJECT_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansObject2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在物体 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0471 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_OBJECT_2D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体徒步 2D [#相对物体徒步-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0472\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_OBJECT_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootObject2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在物体 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0472 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_OBJECT_2D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体车内 2D [#相对物体车内-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0473\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_OBJECT_2D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarObject2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于物体 2D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0473 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_OBJECT_2D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarObject2D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体任意 3D [#相对物体任意-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0474\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_OBJECT_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateAnyMeansObject3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在物体 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0474 LOCATE_CHAR_ANY_MEANS_OBJECT_3D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharAnyMeansObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateAnyMeansObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体徒步 3D [#相对物体徒步-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0475\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_OBJECT_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateOnFootObject3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在物体 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0475 LOCATE_CHAR_ON_FOOT_OBJECT_3D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharOnFootObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateOnFootObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 相对物体车内 3D [#相对物体车内-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0476\" name=\"LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_OBJECT_3D\" member=\"Char.LocateInCarObject3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于物体 3D 半径内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0476 LOCATE_CHAR_IN_CAR_OBJECT_3D\n      in: self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCharInCarObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.locateInCarObject3D(self, object, xRadius, yRadius, zRadius, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在摩托上 [#是否在摩托上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047A\" name=\"IS_CHAR_ON_ANY_BIKE\" member=\"Char.IsOnAnyBike\">\n  用在 if：角色是否骑着摩托车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047A IS_CHAR_ON_ANY_BIKE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharOnAnyBike(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isOnAnyBike(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否看见尸体 [#是否看见尸体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0480\" name=\"CAN_CHAR_SEE_DEAD_CHAR\" member=\"Char.CanSeeDeadChar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否看见指定类型尸体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0480 CAN_CHAR_SEE_DEAD_CHAR\n      in: self, pedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      canCharSeeDeadChar(self, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.canSeeDeadChar(self, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 闭嘴 [#闭嘴]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0489\" name=\"SHUT_CHAR_UP\" member=\"Char.ShutUp\">\n  设置角色能否说话。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0489 SHUT_CHAR_UP\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      shutCharUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.shutUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 卸全部武器 [#卸全部武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"048F\" name=\"REMOVE_ALL_CHAR_WEAPONS\" member=\"Char.RemoveAllWeapons\">\n  移除角色全部武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      048F REMOVE_ALL_CHAR_WEAPONS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeAllCharWeapons(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.removeAllWeapons(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否持有武器 [#是否持有武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0491\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_GOT_WEAPON\" member=\"Char.HasGotWeapon\">\n  用在 if：角色是否持有指定武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0491 HAS_CHAR_GOT_WEAPON\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharGotWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasGotWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在船上 [#是否在船上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A7\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_BOAT\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyBoat\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在开船。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A7 IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_BOAT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyBoat(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyBoat(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在直升机 [#是否在直升机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A9\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_HELI\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyHeli\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在开直升机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A9 IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_HELI\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyHeli(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyHeli(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在飞机 [#是否在飞机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AB\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_PLANE\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyPlane\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在飞机上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AB IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_PLANE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyPlane(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyPlane(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在水中 [#是否在水中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AD\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_WATER\" member=\"Char.IsInWater\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在水中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AD IS_CHAR_IN_WATER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInWater(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInWater(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取武器槽 [#取武器槽]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B8\" name=\"GET_CHAR_WEAPON_IN_SLOT\" member=\"Char.GetWeaponInSlot\">\n  返回指定武器槽的武器类型、弹药与模型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B8 GET_CHAR_WEAPON_IN_SLOT\n      in: self, slot\n      out: weaponType, weaponAmmo, weaponModel\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local weaponType, weaponAmmo, weaponModel = getCharWeaponInSlot(self, slot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getWeaponInSlot(self, slot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 偏移世界坐标 [#偏移世界坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C4\" name=\"GET_OFFSET_FROM_CHAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\" member=\"Char.GetOffsetInWorldCoords\">\n  返回带偏移的角色坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C4 GET_OFFSET_FROM_CHAR_IN_WORLD_COORDS\n      in: self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getOffsetFromCharInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getOffsetInWorldCoords(self, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否被拍照 [#是否被拍照]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C5\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_BEEN_PHOTOGRAPHED\" member=\"Char.HasBeenPhotographed\">\n  用在 if：角色是否被拍过照。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C5 HAS_CHAR_BEEN_PHOTOGRAPHED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharBeenPhotographed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasBeenPhotographed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在飞行器 [#是否在飞行器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04C8\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_FLYING_VEHICLE\" member=\"Char.IsInFlyingVehicle\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在飞行器中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04C8 IS_CHAR_IN_FLYING_VEHICLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInFlyingVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInFlyingVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 锁定位置 [#锁定位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04D7\" name=\"FREEZE_CHAR_POSITION\" member=\"Char.FreezePosition\">\n  设置角色位置是否保持不变。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04D7 FREEZE_CHAR_POSITION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freezeCharPosition(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.freezePosition(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否溺水 [#是否溺水]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04D8\" name=\"SET_CHAR_DROWNS_IN_WATER\" member=\"Char.SetDrownsInWater\">\n  控制角色是否会在水中溺水。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04D8 SET_CHAR_DROWNS_IN_WATER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharDrownsInWater(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setDrownsInWater(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取护甲 [#取护甲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04DD\" name=\"GET_CHAR_ARMOUR\" member=\"Char.GetArmor\">\n  返回角色护甲值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04DD GET_CHAR_ARMOUR\n      in: self\n      out: armor\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local armor = getCharArmour(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getArmor(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 等世界碰撞 [#等世界碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04F0\" name=\"IS_CHAR_WAITING_FOR_WORLD_COLLISION\" member=\"Char.IsWaitingForWorldCollision\">\n  用在 if：是否在等世界碰撞加载。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04F0 IS_CHAR_WAITING_FOR_WORLD_COLLISION\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharWaitingForWorldCollision(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isWaitingForWorldCollision(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到物体 [#附着到物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04F4\" name=\"ATTACH_CHAR_TO_OBJECT\" member=\"Char.AttachToObject\">\n  以炮塔模式把角色附着到指定物体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04F4 ATTACH_CHAR_TO_OBJECT\n      in: self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCharToObject(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.attachToObject(self, handle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 创建 SWAT 绳降 [#创建-swat-绳降]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0503\" name=\"CREATE_SWAT_ROPE\" member=\"Char.CreateSwatRope\">\n  创建沿绳索下降的角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0503 CREATE_SWAT_ROPE\n      in: pedType, modelId, x, y, z\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createSwatRope(pedType, modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createSwatRope(pedType, modelId, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被角色打伤 [#被角色打伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"051A\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CHAR\" member=\"Char.HasBeenDamagedByChar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否被另一角色打伤过。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      051A HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CHAR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharBeenDamagedByChar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasBeenDamagedByChar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被车撞伤 [#被车撞伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"051B\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CAR\" member=\"Char.HasBeenDamagedByCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否被指定车辆撞伤过。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      051B HAS_CHAR_BEEN_DAMAGED_BY_CAR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharBeenDamagedByCar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasBeenDamagedByCar(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 劫车时留车 [#劫车时留车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0526\" name=\"SET_CHAR_STAY_IN_CAR_WHEN_JACKED\" member=\"Char.SetStayInCarWhenJacked\">\n  被劫车时让角色留在车内（可被“绑架”带走）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0526 SET_CHAR_STAY_IN_CAR_WHEN_JACKED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharStayInCarWhenJacked(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setStayInCarWhenJacked(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰到车辆 [#碰到车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0547\" name=\"IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_VEHICLE\" member=\"Char.IsTouchingVehicle\">\n  用在 if：角色是否与车辆碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0547 IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_VEHICLE\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharTouchingVehicle(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isTouchingVehicle(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内可被射击 [#车内可被射击]\n\n<Opcode id=\"054A\" name=\"SET_CHAR_CAN_BE_SHOT_IN_VEHICLE\" member=\"Char.SetCanBeShotInVehicle\">\n  让角色在车内免疫伤害。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      054A SET_CHAR_CAN_BE_SHOT_IN_VEHICLE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCanBeShotInVehicle(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCanBeShotInVehicle(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清伤害来源 [#清伤害来源]\n\n<Opcode id=\"054E\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_LAST_DAMAGE_ENTITY\" member=\"Char.ClearLastDamageEntity\">\n  清上次伤害来源实体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      054E CLEAR_CHAR_LAST_DAMAGE_ENTITY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharLastDamageEntity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearLastDamageEntity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 卸指定武器 [#卸指定武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0555\" name=\"REMOVE_WEAPON_FROM_CHAR\" member=\"Char.RemoveWeapon\">\n  从角色身上移除该武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0555 REMOVE_WEAPON_FROM_CHAR\n      in: self, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeWeaponFromChar(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.removeWeapon(self, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机驾驶员 [#随机驾驶员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0560\" name=\"CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR_AS_DRIVER\" member=\"Char.CreateRandomAsDriver\">\n  在车辆中创建驾驶员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0560 CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR_AS_DRIVER\n      in: vehicle\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createRandomCharAsDriver(vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createRandomAsDriver(vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机乘客 [#随机乘客]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0561\" name=\"CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR_AS_PASSENGER\" member=\"Char.CreateRandomAsPassenger\">\n  在车辆乘客座创建随机角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0561 CREATE_RANDOM_CHAR_AS_PASSENGER\n      in: vehicle, seat\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createRandomCharAsPassenger(vehicle, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createRandomAsPassenger(vehicle, seat)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 永不被瞄准 [#永不被瞄准]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0568\" name=\"SET_CHAR_NEVER_TARGETTED\" member=\"Char.SetNeverTargeted\">\n  设置角色是否不被自动瞄准锁定。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0568 SET_CHAR_NEVER_TARGETTED\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharNeverTargetted(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setNeverTargeted(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在警车 [#是否在警车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"056C\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_POLICE_VEHICLE\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyPoliceVehicle\">\n  用在 if：角色是否驾驶警车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      056C IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_POLICE_VEHICLE\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyPoliceVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyPoliceVehicle(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 角色是否存在 [#角色是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"056D\" name=\"DOES_CHAR_EXIST\" member=\"Char.DoesExist\">\n  用在 if：句柄是否为有效角色句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      056D DOES_CHAR_EXIST\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doesCharExist(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.doesExist(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 冻结且不加载碰撞 [#冻结且不加载碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0575\" name=\"FREEZE_CHAR_POSITION_AND_DONT_LOAD_COLLISION\" member=\"Char.FreezePositionAndDontLoadCollision\">\n  冻结位置且不加载碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0575 FREEZE_CHAR_POSITION_AND_DONT_LOAD_COLLISION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freezeCharPositionAndDontLoadCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.freezePositionAndDontLoadCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰撞加载标志 [#碰撞加载标志]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0588\" name=\"SET_LOAD_COLLISION_FOR_CHAR_FLAG\" member=\"Char.SetLoadCollisionFlag\">\n  是否为该角色加载碰撞。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0588 SET_LOAD_COLLISION_FOR_CHAR_FLAG\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLoadCollisionForCharFlag(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setLoadCollisionFlag(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否蹲下 [#是否蹲下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0597\" name=\"IS_CHAR_DUCKING\" member=\"Char.IsDucking\">\n  用在 if：角色是否蹲下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0597 IS_CHAR_DUCKING\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharDucking(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isDucking(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 2D 区域 [#倾斜-2d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F6\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledArea2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F6 IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 2D 徒步 [#倾斜-2d-徒步]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F7\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledAreaOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F7 IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 2D 车内 [#倾斜-2d-车内]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F8\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledAreaInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F8 IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下倾斜 2D [#停下倾斜-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05F9\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledArea2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否停在倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05F9 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledArea2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步倾斜 2D [#停下徒步倾斜-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FA\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FA IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内倾斜 2D [#停下车内倾斜-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FB\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledAreaInCar2D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在静止车内且位于倾斜 2D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FB IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_2D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledAreaInCar2D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, rightTopX, rightTopY, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 3D 区域 [#倾斜-3d-区域]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FC\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledArea3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FC IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 3D 徒步 [#倾斜-3d-徒步]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FD\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledAreaOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步在倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FD IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倾斜 3D 车内 [#倾斜-3d-车内]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FE\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.IsInAngledAreaInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在车内且位于倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FE IS_CHAR_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAngledAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAngledAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下倾斜 3D [#停下倾斜-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05FF\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledArea3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否停在倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05FF IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledArea3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下徒步倾斜 3D [#停下徒步倾斜-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0600\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否徒步停在倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0600 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_ON_FOOT_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledAreaOnFoot3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停下车内倾斜 3D [#停下车内倾斜-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0601\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\" member=\"Char.IsStoppedInAngledAreaInCar3D\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在静止车内且位于倾斜 3D 区域内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0601 IS_CHAR_STOPPED_IN_ANGLED_AREA_IN_CAR_3D\n      in: self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStoppedInAngledAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStoppedInAngledAreaInCar3D(self, leftBottomX, leftBottomY, leftBottomZ, rightTopX, rightTopY, rightTopZ, angle, drawSphere)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在出租车 [#是否在出租车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0602\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_TAXI\" member=\"Char.IsInTaxi\">\n  用在 if：角色是否驾驶出租车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0602 IS_CHAR_IN_TAXI\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInTaxi(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInTaxi(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 决策器 [#决策器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"060B\" name=\"SET_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"Char.SetDecisionMaker\">\n  为角色设置决策器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      060B SET_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: self, handleOrTemplate\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharDecisionMaker(self, handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setDecisionMaker(self, handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 感知范围 [#感知范围]\n\n<Opcode id=\"060F\" name=\"SET_SENSE_RANGE\" member=\"Char.SetSenseRange\">\n  设置指定角色（句柄 -1 时为全部任务角色）的视听范围。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      060F SET_SENSE_RANGE\n      in: handle, range\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setSenseRange(handle, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSenseRange(handle, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否播动画 [#是否播动画]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0611\" name=\"IS_CHAR_PLAYING_ANIM\" member=\"Char.IsPlayingAnim\">\n  用在 if：角色是否正在播指定动画。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0611 IS_CHAR_PLAYING_ANIM\n      in: self, animationName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharPlayingAnim(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isPlayingAnim(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 动画播放开关 [#动画播放开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0612\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ANIM_PLAYING_FLAG\" member=\"Char.SetAnimPlayingFlag\">\n  设置动画是否播放。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0612 SET_CHAR_ANIM_PLAYING_FLAG\n      in: self, animationName, flag\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAnimPlayingFlag(self, animationName, flag)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAnimPlayingFlag(self, animationName, flag)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 动画进度 [#动画进度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0613\" name=\"GET_CHAR_ANIM_CURRENT_TIME\" member=\"Char.GetAnimCurrentTime\">\n  返回角色动画进度，范围 0.0–1.0。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0613 GET_CHAR_ANIM_CURRENT_TIME\n      in: self, animationName\n      out: time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local time = getCharAnimCurrentTime(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getAnimCurrentTime(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设动画进度 [#设动画进度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0614\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ANIM_CURRENT_TIME\" member=\"Char.SetAnimCurrentTime\">\n  设置角色动画播放到哪一段，1 为完整。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0614 SET_CHAR_ANIM_CURRENT_TIME\n      in: self, animationName, time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAnimCurrentTime(self, animationName, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAnimCurrentTime(self, animationName, time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 执行动作序列 [#执行动作序列]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0618\" name=\"PERFORM_SEQUENCE_TASK\" member=\"Char.PerformSequence\">\n  把角色指派到指定动作序列。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0618 PERFORM_SEQUENCE_TASK\n      in: self, sequence\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      performSequenceTask(self, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.performSequence(self, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰撞开关 [#碰撞开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0619\" name=\"SET_CHAR_COLLISION\" member=\"Char.SetCollision\">\n  设置是否启用角色碰撞检测。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0619 SET_CHAR_COLLISION\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCollision(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 动画总时长 [#动画总时长]\n\n<Opcode id=\"061A\" name=\"GET_CHAR_ANIM_TOTAL_TIME\" member=\"Char.GetAnimTotalTime\">\n  返回动画时长（毫秒，浮点）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      061A GET_CHAR_ANIM_TOTAL_TIME\n      in: self, animationName\n      out: totalTime\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local totalTime = getCharAnimTotalTime(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getAnimTotalTime(self, animationName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 吸引点创建 [#吸引点创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0621\" name=\"CREATE_CHAR_AT_ATTRACTOR\" member=\"Char.CreateAtAttractor\">\n  在吸引点创建角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0621 CREATE_CHAR_AT_ATTRACTOR\n      in: pedType, modelId, attractor, task\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCharAtAttractor(pedType, modelId, attractor, task)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.createAtAttractor(pedType, modelId, attractor, task)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脚本任务状态 [#脚本任务状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"062E\" name=\"GET_SCRIPT_TASK_STATUS\" member=\"Char.GetScriptTaskStatus\">\n  返回角色指定脚本任务的状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      062E GET_SCRIPT_TASK_STATUS\n      in: self, task\n      out: status\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local status = getScriptTaskStatus(self, task)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getScriptTaskStatus(self, task)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在脚本吸引点 [#是否在脚本吸引点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0642\" name=\"IS_CHAR_AT_SCRIPTED_ATTRACTOR\" member=\"Char.IsAtScriptedAttractor\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在脚本吸引点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0642 IS_CHAR_AT_SCRIPTED_ATTRACTOR\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharAtScriptedAttractor(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isAtScriptedAttractor(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 序列进度 [#序列进度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0646\" name=\"GET_SEQUENCE_PROGRESS\" member=\"Char.GetSequenceProgress\">\n  获取角色任务序列进度（由 0618 启动）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0646 GET_SEQUENCE_PROGRESS\n      in: self\n      out: progress\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local progress = getSequenceProgress(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getSequenceProgress(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清看向 [#清看向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0647\" name=\"CLEAR_LOOK_AT\" member=\"Char.ClearLookAt\">\n  清除角色看向任务，停止看目标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0647 CLEAR_LOOK_AT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearLookAt(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearLookAt(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随节点阈值距离 [#跟随节点阈值距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0648\" name=\"SET_FOLLOW_NODE_THRESHOLD_DISTANCE\" member=\"Char.SetFollowNodeThresholdDistance\">\n  设置角色对事件作出反应的范围。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0648 SET_FOLLOW_NODE_THRESHOLD_DISTANCE\n      in: self, range\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFollowNodeThresholdDistance(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setFollowNodeThresholdDistance(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取模型 [#取模型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0665\" name=\"GET_CHAR_MODEL\" member=\"Char.GetModel\">\n  返回角色模型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0665 GET_CHAR_MODEL\n      in: self\n      out: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local modelId = getCharModel(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getModel(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清任务 [#清任务]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0687\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_TASKS\" member=\"Char.ClearTasks\">\n  清除角色任务，让其停下当前行为。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0687 CLEAR_CHAR_TASKS\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharTasks(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearTasks(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着到摩托 [#附着到摩托]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06A7\" name=\"ATTACH_CHAR_TO_BIKE\" member=\"Char.AttachToBike\">\n  把角色附着到摩托上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06A7 ATTACH_CHAR_TO_BIKE\n      in: self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, pitchRange, weaponType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachCharToBike(self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, pitchRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.attachToBike(self, vehicle, xOffset, yOffset, zOffset, heading, headingRange, pitchRange, weaponType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 过场藏武器 [#过场藏武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06AB\" name=\"HIDE_CHAR_WEAPON_FOR_SCRIPTED_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Char.HideWeaponForScriptedCutscene\">\n  隐藏角色全部武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06AB HIDE_CHAR_WEAPON_FOR_SCRIPTED_CUTSCENE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hideCharWeaponForScriptedCutscene(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hideWeaponForScriptedCutscene(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取速度 [#取速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06AC\" name=\"GET_CHAR_SPEED\" member=\"Char.GetSpeed\">\n  返回角色移动速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06AC GET_CHAR_SPEED\n      in: self\n      out: speed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local speed = getCharSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 移出小队 [#移出小队]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06C9\" name=\"REMOVE_CHAR_FROM_GROUP\" member=\"Char.RemoveFromGroup\">\n  把角色移出当前小队。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06C9 REMOVE_CHAR_FROM_GROUP\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeCharFromGroup(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.removeFromGroup(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否小队成员 [#是否小队成员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06EE\" name=\"IS_GROUP_MEMBER\" member=\"Char.IsGroupMember\">\n  用在 if：角色是否为指定小队成员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06EE IS_GROUP_MEMBER\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGroupMember(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isGroupMember(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否小队长 [#是否小队长]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06EF\" name=\"IS_GROUP_LEADER\" member=\"Char.IsGroupLeader\">\n  用在 if：角色是否为指定小队队长。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06EF IS_GROUP_LEADER\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGroupLeader(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isGroupLeader(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附近是否有人 [#附近是否有人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06FF\" name=\"ARE_ANY_CHARS_NEAR_CHAR\" member=\"Char.IsNearAnyChars\">\n  用在 if：附近是否有其他角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06FF ARE_ANY_CHARS_NEAR_CHAR\n      in: self, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      areAnyCharsNearChar(self, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isNearAnyChars(self, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 丢物体 [#丢物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"070B\" name=\"DROP_OBJECT\" member=\"Char.DropObject\">\n  让角色丢下物体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      070B DROP_OBJECT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dropObject(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.dropObject(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否举着物体 [#是否举着物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0737\" name=\"IS_CHAR_HOLDING_OBJECT\" member=\"Char.IsHoldingObject\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在举起指定物体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0737 IS_CHAR_HOLDING_OBJECT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharHoldingObject(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isHoldingObject(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否被捕 [#是否被捕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0741\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_BEEN_ARRESTED\" member=\"Char.HasBeenArrested\">\n  用在 if：角色是否已被逮捕。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0741 HAS_CHAR_BEEN_ARRESTED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharBeenArrested(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasBeenArrested(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 通知受尊敬朋友 [#通知受尊敬朋友]\n\n<Opcode id=\"074E\" name=\"SET_INFORM_RESPECTED_FRIENDS\" member=\"Char.SetInformRespectedFriends\">\n  设置通知受尊敬朋友。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      074E SET_INFORM_RESPECTED_FRIENDS\n      in: self, radius, _p3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setInformRespectedFriends(self, radius, _p3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setInformRespectedFriends(self, radius, _p3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否响应事件 [#是否响应事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"074F\" name=\"IS_CHAR_RESPONDING_TO_EVENT\" member=\"Char.IsRespondingToEvent\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在响应指定 ped 事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      074F IS_CHAR_RESPONDING_TO_EVENT\n      in: self, event\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharRespondingToEvent(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isRespondingToEvent(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 优先瞄准目标 [#优先瞄准目标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0770\" name=\"SET_CHAR_IS_TARGET_PRIORITY\" member=\"Char.SetIsTargetPriority\">\n  让自动瞄准更倾向锁定此角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0770 SET_CHAR_IS_TARGET_PRIORITY\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharIsTargetPriority(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setIsTargetPriority(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设关系 [#设关系]\n\n<Opcode id=\"077A\" name=\"SET_CHAR_RELATIONSHIP\" member=\"Char.SetRelationship\">\n  设置角色与 ped 类型的关系。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      077A SET_CHAR_RELATIONSHIP\n      in: self, relationshipType, pedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharRelationship(self, relationshipType, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setRelationship(self, relationshipType, pedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清关系 [#清关系]\n\n<Opcode id=\"077B\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_RELATIONSHIP\" member=\"Char.ClearRelationship\">\n  清除角色与 ped 类型的关系。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      077B CLEAR_CHAR_RELATIONSHIP\n      in: self, relationshipType, toPedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharRelationship(self, relationshipType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearRelationship(self, relationshipType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清全部关系 [#清全部关系]\n\n<Opcode id=\"077C\" name=\"CLEAR_ALL_CHAR_RELATIONSHIPS\" member=\"Char.ClearAllRelationships\">\n  清除角色全部指定类型关系。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      077C CLEAR_ALL_CHAR_RELATIONSHIPS\n      in: self, relationshipType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearAllCharRelationships(self, relationshipType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearAllRelationships(self, relationshipType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 立即清任务 [#立即清任务]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0792\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_TASKS_IMMEDIATELY\" member=\"Char.ClearTasksImmediately\">\n  立即清除角色全部任务，回到空闲。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0792 CLEAR_CHAR_TASKS_IMMEDIATELY\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharTasksImmediately(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.clearTasksImmediately(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 从进度执行序列 [#从进度执行序列]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07A0\" name=\"PERFORM_SEQUENCE_TASK_FROM_PROGRESS\" member=\"Char.PerformSequenceFromProgress\">\n  从指定进度执行动作序列。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07A0 PERFORM_SEQUENCE_TASK_FROM_PROGRESS\n      in: self, sequence, startTaskIndex, endTaskIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      performSequenceTaskFromProgress(self, sequence, startTaskIndex, endTaskIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.performSequenceFromProgress(self, sequence, startTaskIndex, endTaskIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 下一移动状态 [#下一移动状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07A1\" name=\"SET_NEXT_DESIRED_MOVE_STATE\" member=\"Char.SetNextDesiredMoveState\">\n  设置后续无路程参数任务时角色如何前往目的地。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07A1 SET_NEXT_DESIRED_MOVE_STATE\n      in: moveState\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setNextDesiredMoveState(moveState)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setNextDesiredMoveState(moveState)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 递归序列进度 [#递归序列进度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07A4\" name=\"GET_SEQUENCE_PROGRESS_RECURSIVE\" member=\"Char.GetSequenceProgressRecursive\">\n  取递归序列进度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07A4 GET_SEQUENCE_PROGRESS_RECURSIVE\n      in: self\n      out: _p2, _p3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local _p2, _p3 = getSequenceProgressRecursive(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getSequenceProgressRecursive(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在探照灯 [#是否在探照灯]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07A9\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_SEARCHLIGHT\" member=\"Char.IsInAnySearchlight\">\n  返回正在瞄准该角色的探照灯句柄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07A9 IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_SEARCHLIGHT\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = isCharInAnySearchlight(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnySearchlight(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 听玩家小队指令 [#听玩家小队指令]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07CB\" name=\"LISTEN_TO_PLAYER_GROUP_COMMANDS\" member=\"Char.ListenToPlayerGroupCommands\">\n  是否听从玩家小队指令。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07CB LISTEN_TO_PLAYER_GROUP_COMMANDS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      listenToPlayerGroupCommands(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.listenToPlayerGroupCommands(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 射击频率 [#射击频率]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07DD\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SHOOT_RATE\" member=\"Char.SetShootRate\">\n  设置角色攻击频率。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07DD SET_CHAR_SHOOT_RATE\n      in: self, rate\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharShootRate(self, rate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setShootRate(self, rate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 格斗风格 [#格斗风格]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07FE\" name=\"GIVE_MELEE_ATTACK_TO_CHAR\" member=\"Char.GiveMeleeAttack\">\n  设置角色格斗风格与招式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07FE GIVE_MELEE_ATTACK_TO_CHAR\n      in: self, style, move\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      giveMeleeAttackToChar(self, style, move)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.giveMeleeAttack(self, style, move)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最高优先事件 [#最高优先事件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"080E\" name=\"GET_CHAR_HIGHEST_PRIORITY_EVENT\" member=\"Char.GetHighestPriorityEvent\">\n  获取角色当前 ped 事件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      080E GET_CHAR_HIGHEST_PRIORITY_EVENT\n      in: self\n      out: event\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local event = getCharHighestPriorityEvent(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getHighestPriorityEvent(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取正在用的车 [#取正在用的车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0811\" name=\"GET_CAR_CHAR_IS_USING\" member=\"Char.GetCarIsUsing\">\n  存下角色正在乘坐或进入的车辆句柄（另见 00D9、03C0、0484）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0811 GET_CAR_CHAR_IS_USING\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = getCarCharIsUsing(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getCarIsUsing(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 大致原地 [#大致原地]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0816\" name=\"SET_CHAR_KINDA_STAY_IN_SAME_PLACE\" member=\"Char.SetKindaStayInSamePlace\">\n  设置角色是否不远追受害者（近战或进射程）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0816 SET_CHAR_KINDA_STAY_IN_SAME_PLACE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharKindaStayInSamePlace(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setKindaStayInSamePlace(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在空中 [#是否在空中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0818\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_AIR\" member=\"Char.IsInAir\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在空中。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0818 IS_CHAR_IN_AIR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAir(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAir(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 离地高度 [#离地高度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0819\" name=\"GET_CHAR_HEIGHT_ABOVE_GROUND\" member=\"Char.GetHeightAboveGround\">\n  返回角色离地高度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0819 GET_CHAR_HEIGHT_ABOVE_GROUND\n      in: self\n      out: height\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local height = getCharHeightAboveGround(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getHeightAboveGround(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 持枪姿势 [#持枪姿势]\n\n<Opcode id=\"081A\" name=\"SET_CHAR_WEAPON_SKILL\" member=\"Char.SetWeaponSkill\">\n  设置角色持枪姿势风格。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      081A SET_CHAR_WEAPON_SKILL\n      in: self, skill\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharWeaponSkill(self, skill)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setWeaponSkill(self, skill)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设速度向量 [#设速度向量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"083C\" name=\"SET_CHAR_VELOCITY\" member=\"Char.SetVelocity\">\n  设置角色速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      083C SET_CHAR_VELOCITY\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setVelocity(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取速度向量 [#取速度向量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"083D\" name=\"GET_CHAR_VELOCITY\" member=\"Char.GetVelocity\">\n  获取角色速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      083D GET_CHAR_VELOCITY\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getCharVelocity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getVelocity(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设旋转 [#设旋转]\n\n<Opcode id=\"083E\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ROTATION\" member=\"Char.SetRotation\">\n  设置角色旋转。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      083E SET_CHAR_ROTATION\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharRotation(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setRotation(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 造成伤害 [#造成伤害]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0851\" name=\"DAMAGE_CHAR\" member=\"Char.Damage\">\n  降低角色生命。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0851 DAMAGE_CHAR\n      in: self, amount, damageArmour\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      damageChar(self, amount, damageArmour)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.damage(self, amount, damageArmour)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 允许蹲下 [#允许蹲下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0856\" name=\"SET_CHAR_ALLOWED_TO_DUCK\" member=\"Char.SetAllowedToDuck\">\n  设置角色能否蹲下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0856 SET_CHAR_ALLOWED_TO_DUCK\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAllowedToDuck(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAllowedToDuck(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 可见 interior [#可见-interior]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0860\" name=\"SET_CHAR_AREA_VISIBLE\" member=\"Char.SetAreaVisible\">\n  设置角色所在室内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0860 SET_CHAR_AREA_VISIBLE\n      in: self, areaId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharAreaVisible(self, areaId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setAreaVisible(self, areaId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死后掉武器 [#死后掉武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"087E\" name=\"SET_CHAR_DROPS_WEAPONS_WHEN_DEAD\" member=\"Char.SetDropsWeaponsWhenDead\">\n  设置角色死后是否掉落武器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      087E SET_CHAR_DROPS_WEAPONS_WHEN_DEAD\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharDropsWeaponsWhenDead(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setDropsWeaponsWhenDead(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 永不离队 [#永不离队]\n\n<Opcode id=\"087F\" name=\"SET_CHAR_NEVER_LEAVES_GROUP\" member=\"Char.SetNeverLeavesGroup\">\n  阻止角色离开所属小队。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      087F SET_CHAR_NEVER_LEAVES_GROUP\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharNeverLeavesGroup(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setNeverLeavesGroup(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 附着朝向限制 [#附着朝向限制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0887\" name=\"SET_HEADING_LIMIT_FOR_ATTACHED_CHAR\" member=\"Char.SetHeadingLimitForAttached\">\n  设置附着在物体或车辆上的角色朝向限制。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0887 SET_HEADING_LIMIT_FOR_ATTACHED_CHAR\n      in: self, heading, headingRange\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHeadingLimitForAttachedChar(self, heading, headingRange)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setHeadingLimitForAttached(self, heading, headingRange)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死亡坐标 [#死亡坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0889\" name=\"GET_DEAD_CHAR_COORDINATES\" member=\"Char.GetCoordinatesOfDied\">\n  取角色死亡坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0889 GET_DEAD_CHAR_COORDINATES\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getDeadCharCoordinates(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getCoordinatesOfDied(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取 ped 类型 [#取-ped-类型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"089F\" name=\"GET_PED_TYPE\" member=\"Char.GetPedType\">\n  获取角色 ped 类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      089F GET_PED_TYPE\n      in: self\n      out: pedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local pedType = getPedType(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getPedType(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 使用过出入口 [#使用过出入口]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08AD\" name=\"SET_CHAR_HAS_USED_ENTRY_EXIT\" member=\"Char.SetHasUsedEntryExit\">\n  在坐标半径内定位入口标记并绑定角色，设置室内 ID；玩家控制时还会设天空色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08AD SET_CHAR_HAS_USED_ENTRY_EXIT\n      in: self, x, y, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharHasUsedEntryExit(self, x, y, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setHasUsedEntryExit(self, x, y, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最大生命 [#最大生命]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08AF\" name=\"SET_CHAR_MAX_HEALTH\" member=\"Char.SetMaxHealth\">\n  设置角色最大生命。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08AF SET_CHAR_MAX_HEALTH\n      in: self, maxHealth\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharMaxHealth(self, maxHealth)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setMaxHealth(self, maxHealth)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 摩托不被撞落 [#摩托不被撞落]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C6\" name=\"SET_CHAR_CAN_BE_KNOCKED_OFF_BIKE\" member=\"Char.SetCanBeKnockedOffBike\">\n  设置碰撞时角色是否始终留在摩托上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C6 SET_CHAR_CAN_BE_KNOCKED_OFF_BIKE\n      in: self, stayOnBike\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCanBeKnockedOffBike(self, stayOnBike)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCanBeKnockedOffBike(self, stayOnBike)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设坐标不传小队 [#设坐标不传小队]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C7\" name=\"SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_DONT_WARP_GANG\" member=\"Char.SetCoordinatesDontWarpGang\">\n  设置角色坐标，不传送其小队其余成员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C7 SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_DONT_WARP_GANG\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCoordinatesDontWarpGang(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCoordinatesDontWarpGang(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 防弹衣 [#防弹衣]\n\n<Opcode id=\"093B\" name=\"SET_CHAR_BULLETPROOF_VEST\" member=\"Char.SetBulletproofVest\">\n  角色只播上半身受伤动画，腿部中弹仍可跑。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      093B SET_CHAR_BULLETPROOF_VEST\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharBulletproofVest(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setBulletproofVest(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 仅上半身受伤动画 [#仅上半身受伤动画]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0946\" name=\"SET_CHAR_USES_UPPERBODY_DAMAGE_ANIMS_ONLY\" member=\"Char.SetUsesUpperbodyDamageAnimsOnly\">\n  是否只用上半身受伤动画。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0946 SET_CHAR_USES_UPPERBODY_DAMAGE_ANIMS_ONLY\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharUsesUpperbodyDamageAnimsOnly(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setUsesUpperbodyDamageAnimsOnly(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 说上下文语音 [#说上下文语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0947\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SAY_CONTEXT\" member=\"Char.SetSayContext\">\n  类似 05C1，但返回说了哪句，且不作为任务运行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0947 SET_CHAR_SAY_CONTEXT\n      in: self, phrase\n      out: _p3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local _p3 = setCharSayContext(self, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSayContext(self, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 所在室内名 [#所在室内名]\n\n<Opcode id=\"094B\" name=\"GET_NAME_OF_ENTRY_EXIT_CHAR_USED\" member=\"Char.GetNameOfEntryExitUsed\">\n  获取角色所在室内名称。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      094B GET_NAME_OF_ENTRY_EXIT_CHAR_USED\n      in: self\n      out: interiorName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local interiorName = getNameOfEntryExitCharUsed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getNameOfEntryExitUsed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 所用入口位置 [#所用入口位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"094C\" name=\"GET_POSITION_OF_ENTRY_EXIT_CHAR_USED\" member=\"Char.GetPositionOfEntryExitCharUsed\">\n  返回角色进入当前室内所用入口标记的坐标与朝向。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      094C GET_POSITION_OF_ENTRY_EXIT_CHAR_USED\n      in: self\n      out: x, y, z, heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z, heading = getPositionOfEntryExitCharUsed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getPositionOfEntryExitCharUsed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在说话 [#是否在说话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"094D\" name=\"IS_CHAR_TALKING\" member=\"Char.IsTalking\">\n  用在 if：角色是否正在播任意语音。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      094D IS_CHAR_TALKING\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharTalking(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isTalking(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 禁用语音 [#禁用语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"094E\" name=\"DISABLE_CHAR_SPEECH\" member=\"Char.DisableSpeech\">\n  阻止播放任何角色语音。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      094E DISABLE_CHAR_SPEECH\n      in: self, stopNow\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      disableCharSpeech(self, stopNow)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.disableSpeech(self, stopNow)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 启用语音 [#启用语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"094F\" name=\"ENABLE_CHAR_SPEECH\" member=\"Char.EnableSpeech\">\n  若用 094E 关掉过痛呼，则重新启用。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      094F ENABLE_CHAR_SPEECH\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableCharSpeech(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.enableSpeech(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 卡在车底 [#卡在车底]\n\n<Opcode id=\"095D\" name=\"IS_CHAR_STUCK_UNDER_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsStuckUnderCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否卡在车底。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      095D IS_CHAR_STUCK_UNDER_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharStuckUnderCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isStuckUnderCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 保留任务 [#保留任务]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0961\" name=\"SET_CHAR_KEEP_TASK\" member=\"Char.SetKeepTask\">\n  设置任务清理后角色是否保留任务（实质跳过清理）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0961 SET_CHAR_KEEP_TASK\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharKeepTask(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setKeepTask(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否游泳 [#是否游泳]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0965\" name=\"IS_CHAR_SWIMMING\" member=\"Char.IsSwimming\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在游泳。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0965 IS_CHAR_SWIMMING\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharSwimming(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isSwimming(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 游泳状态 [#游泳状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0966\" name=\"GET_CHAR_SWIM_STATE\" member=\"Char.GetSwimState\">\n  取角色游泳状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0966 GET_CHAR_SWIM_STATE\n      in: self\n      out: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local state = getCharSwimState(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getSwimState(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开始面部说话 [#开始面部说话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0967\" name=\"START_CHAR_FACIAL_TALK\" member=\"Char.StartFacialTalk\">\n  让角色张嘴像在说话。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0967 START_CHAR_FACIAL_TALK\n      in: self, duration\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startCharFacialTalk(self, duration)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.startFacialTalk(self, duration)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停止面部说话 [#停止面部说话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0968\" name=\"STOP_CHAR_FACIAL_TALK\" member=\"Char.StopFacialTalk\">\n  停止角色张嘴说话动作。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0968 STOP_CHAR_FACIAL_TALK\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      stopCharFacialTalk(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.stopFacialTalk(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 无偏移设坐标 [#无偏移设坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0972\" name=\"SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_NO_OFFSET\" member=\"Char.SetCoordinatesNoOffset\">\n  按身体中心而非脚底放置角色坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0972 SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_NO_OFFSET\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCoordinatesNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCoordinatesNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死在车里 [#死在车里]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0982\" name=\"SET_CHAR_FORCE_DIE_IN_CAR\" member=\"Char.SetForceDieInCar\">\n  角色死后仍留在车内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0982 SET_CHAR_FORCE_DIE_IN_CAR\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharForceDieInCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setForceDieInCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 丢第二物体 [#丢第二物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A1\" name=\"DROP_SECOND_OBJECT\" member=\"Char.DropSecondObject\">\n  丢下第二物体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A1 DROP_SECOND_OBJECT\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dropSecondObject(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.dropSecondObject(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 嗑药状态 [#嗑药状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A7\" name=\"SET_CHAR_DRUGGED_UP\" member=\"Char.SetDruggedUp\">\n  设置角色嗑药状态。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A7 SET_CHAR_DRUGGED_UP\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharDruggedUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setDruggedUp(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 头是否缺失 [#头是否缺失]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A8\" name=\"IS_CHAR_HEAD_MISSING\" member=\"Char.IsHeadMissing\">\n  用在 if：角色头部是否被爆掉。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A8 IS_CHAR_HEAD_MISSING\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharHeadMissing(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isHeadMissing(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在火车 [#是否在火车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09AE\" name=\"IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_TRAIN\" member=\"Char.IsInAnyTrain\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在火车上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09AE IS_CHAR_IN_ANY_TRAIN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharInAnyTrain(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isInAnyTrain(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 击杀后信号 [#击杀后信号]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B5\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SIGNAL_AFTER_KILL\" member=\"Char.SetSignalAfterKill\">\n  设置角色击杀后是否做信号手势。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B5 SET_CHAR_SIGNAL_AFTER_KILL\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharSignalAfterKill(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSignalAfterKill(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被警察通缉 [#被警察通缉]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B6\" name=\"SET_CHAR_WANTED_BY_POLICE\" member=\"Char.SetWantedByPolice\">\n  设置警察是否追击该角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B6 SET_CHAR_WANTED_BY_POLICE\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharWantedByPolice(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setWantedByPolice(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设坐标不传队无偏移 [#设坐标不传队无偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BC\" name=\"SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_DONT_WARP_GANG_NO_OFFSET\" member=\"Char.SetCoordinatesDontWarpGangNoOffset\">\n  本命令是 0972 与 08C7 的组合。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BC SET_CHAR_COORDINATES_DONT_WARP_GANG_NO_OFFSET\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCoordinatesDontWarpGangNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setCoordinatesDontWarpGangNoOffset(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 用地图吸引点 [#用地图吸引点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09C5\" name=\"IS_CHAR_USING_MAP_ATTRACTOR\" member=\"Char.IsUsingMapAttractor\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在使用地图 attractor。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09C5 IS_CHAR_USING_MAP_ATTRACTOR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharUsingMapAttractor(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isUsingMapAttractor(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 下车保持位置 [#下车保持位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09C9\" name=\"REMOVE_CHAR_FROM_CAR_MAINTAIN_POSITION\" member=\"Char.RemoveFromCarMaintainPosition\">\n  把角色从车辆中移除。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09C9 REMOVE_CHAR_FROM_CAR_MAINTAIN_POSITION\n      in: self, vehicle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeCharFromCarMaintainPosition(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.removeFromCarMaintainPosition(self, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 重要上下文语音 [#重要上下文语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09D5\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SAY_CONTEXT_IMPORTANT\" member=\"Char.SetSayContextImportant\">\n  说重要上下文语音。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09D5 SET_CHAR_SAY_CONTEXT_IMPORTANT\n      in: self, phrase, overrideSilence, ignoreMute, frontEnd\n      out: saidVariant\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local saidVariant = setCharSayContextImportant(self, phrase, overrideSilence, ignoreMute, frontEnd)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSayContextImportant(self, phrase, overrideSilence, ignoreMute, frontEnd)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脚本语音 [#脚本语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09D6\" name=\"SET_CHAR_SAY_SCRIPT\" member=\"Char.SetSayScript\">\n  脚本语音。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09D6 SET_CHAR_SAY_SCRIPT\n      in: self, _p2, _p3, _p4, _p5\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharSayScript(self, _p2, _p3, _p4, _p5)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSayScript(self, _p2, _p3, _p4, _p5)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否正在上车 [#是否正在上车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09DE\" name=\"IS_CHAR_GETTING_IN_TO_A_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsGettingInToACar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否正在上车但尚未入座。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09DE IS_CHAR_GETTING_IN_TO_A_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharGettingInToACar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isGettingInToACar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取 interior [#取-interior]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E8\" name=\"GET_CHAR_AREA_VISIBLE\" member=\"Char.GetAreaVisible\">\n  返回角色所在室内 ID。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E8 GET_CHAR_AREA_VISIBLE\n      in: self\n      out: areaId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local areaId = getCharAreaVisible(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.getAreaVisible(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 前方是否看见 [#前方是否看见]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09ED\" name=\"HAS_CHAR_SPOTTED_CHAR_IN_FRONT\" member=\"Char.HasSpottedCharInFront\">\n  用在 if：角色能否在正前方看见另一角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09ED HAS_CHAR_SPOTTED_CHAR_IN_FRONT\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasCharSpottedCharInFront(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.hasSpottedCharInFront(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随节点忽略高度 [#跟随节点忽略高度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F4\" name=\"IGNORE_HEIGHT_DIFFERENCE_FOLLOWING_NODES\" member=\"Char.IgnoreHeightDifferenceFollowingNodes\">\n  跟随节点时忽略高度差。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F4 IGNORE_HEIGHT_DIFFERENCE_FOLLOWING_NODES\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      ignoreHeightDifferenceFollowingNodes(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.ignoreHeightDifferenceFollowingNodes(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 翻车时下车 [#翻车时下车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F6\" name=\"SET_CHAR_GET_OUT_UPSIDE_DOWN_CAR\" member=\"Char.SetGetOutUpsideDownCar\">\n  控制角色是否在车翻到起火前尝试下车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F6 SET_CHAR_GET_OUT_UPSIDE_DOWN_CAR\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharGetOutUpsideDownCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setGetOutUpsideDownCar(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脚本语音静音 [#脚本语音静音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A09\" name=\"SHUT_CHAR_UP_FOR_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\" member=\"Char.ShutUpForScriptedSpeech\">\n  类似 0489，但静音更多内容，含环境语音（待确认）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A09 SHUT_CHAR_UP_FOR_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      shutCharUpForScriptedSpeech(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.shutUpForScriptedSpeech(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰到另一角色 [#碰到另一角色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A1B\" name=\"IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_CHAR\" member=\"Char.IsTouchingChar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否碰到另一角色。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A1B IS_CHAR_TOUCHING_CHAR\n      in: self, other\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharTouchingChar(self, other)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isTouchingChar(self, other)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死后武器持久 [#死后武器持久]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A27\" name=\"SET_DEATH_WEAPONS_PERSIST\" member=\"Char.SetDeathWeaponsPersist\">\n  角色死后生成的拾取物在被玩家捡起前不会消失。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A27 SET_DEATH_WEAPONS_PERSIST\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setDeathWeaponsPersist(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setDeathWeaponsPersist(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 游泳速度 [#游泳速度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A28\" name=\"SET_SWIM_SPEED\" member=\"Char.SetSwimSpeed\">\n  设置角色游泳速度，并改变游泳动画速度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A28 SET_SWIM_SPEED\n      in: self, speed\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setSwimSpeed(self, speed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.setSwimSpeed(self, speed)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否附着任意车 [#是否附着任意车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A32\" name=\"IS_CHAR_ATTACHED_TO_ANY_CAR\" member=\"Char.IsAttachedToAnyCar\">\n  用在 if：角色是否在任意车辆炮塔位。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A32 IS_CHAR_ATTACHED_TO_ANY_CAR\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharAttachedToAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.isAttachedToAnyCar(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取附着车辆 [#取附着车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A33\" name=\"STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_ATTACHED_TO_NO_SAVE\" member=\"Char.StoreCarIsAttachedToNoSave\">\n  返回角色附着的车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A33 STORE_CAR_CHAR_IS_ATTACHED_TO_NO_SAVE\n      in: self\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = storeCarCharIsAttachedToNoSave(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Char.storeCarIsAttachedToNoSave(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 检查点 Checkpoint (/docs/cleo/sa/default/checkpoint)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 4 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建 [#创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06D5\" name=\"CREATE_CHECKPOINT\" member=\"Checkpoint.Create\">\n  创建竞速 / 飞行风格的红色检查点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06D5 CREATE_CHECKPOINT\n      in: type, x, y, z, pointX, pointY, pointZ, radius\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createCheckpoint(type, x, y, z, pointX, pointY, pointZ, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Checkpoint.create(type, x, y, z, pointX, pointY, pointZ, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除 [#删除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06D6\" name=\"DELETE_CHECKPOINT\" member=\"Checkpoint.Delete\">\n  删除检查点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06D6 DELETE_CHECKPOINT\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      deleteCheckpoint(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Checkpoint.delete(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改坐标 [#改坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07F3\" name=\"SET_CHECKPOINT_COORDS\" member=\"Checkpoint.SetCoords\">\n  改检查点坐标。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07F3 SET_CHECKPOINT_COORDS\n      in: self, x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCheckpointCoords(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Checkpoint.setCoords(self, x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 朝向 [#朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0996\" name=\"SET_CHECKPOINT_HEADING\" member=\"Checkpoint.SetHeading\">\n  设检查点朝向。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0996 SET_CHECKPOINT_HEADING\n      in: self, heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCheckpointHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Checkpoint.setHeading(self, heading)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 时钟 Clock (/docs/cleo/sa/default/clock)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 10 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 取时分 [#取时分]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00BF\" name=\"GET_TIME_OF_DAY\" member=\"Clock.GetTimeOfDay\">\n  取当天时:分（从午夜起算）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00BF GET_TIME_OF_DAY\n      out: hours, minutes\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local hours, minutes = getTimeOfDay()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { hours, minutes } = Clock.getTimeOfDay()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设时分 [#设时分]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00C0\" name=\"SET_TIME_OF_DAY\" member=\"Clock.SetTimeOfDay\">\n  设游戏内时间。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00C0 SET_TIME_OF_DAY\n      in: hours, minutes\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTimeOfDay(hours, minutes)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Clock.setTimeOfDay(hours, minutes)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 距目标分钟 [#距目标分钟]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00C1\" name=\"GET_MINUTES_TO_TIME_OF_DAY\" member=\"Clock.GetMinutesToTimeOfDay\">\n  距指定时:分还差多少分钟。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00C1 GET_MINUTES_TO_TIME_OF_DAY\n      in: hours, minutes\n      out: minutesLeft\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local minutesLeft = getMinutesToTimeOfDay(hours, minutes)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const minutesLeft = Clock.getMinutesToTimeOfDay(hours, minutes)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 时间流速 [#时间流速]\n\n<Opcode id=\"015D\" name=\"SET_TIME_SCALE\" member=\"Clock.SetTimeScale\">\n  设时间流速倍率。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      015D SET_TIME_SCALE\n      in: scale\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTimeScale(scale)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Clock.setTimeScale(scale)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 游戏计时器 [#游戏计时器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01BD\" name=\"GET_GAME_TIMER\" member=\"Clock.GetGameTimer\">\n  开局以来毫秒数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01BD GET_GAME_TIMER\n      out: time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local time = getGameTimer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const time = Clock.getGameTimer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 暂存时钟 [#暂存时钟]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0253\" name=\"STORE_CLOCK\" member=\"Clock.Store\">\n  暂存当前游戏时间。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0253 STORE_CLOCK\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      storeClock()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Clock.store()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 恢复时钟 [#恢复时钟]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0254\" name=\"RESTORE_CLOCK\" member=\"Clock.Restore\">\n  恢复到 `0253` 存的时间。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0254 RESTORE_CLOCK\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      restoreClock()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Clock.restore()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 星期几 [#星期几]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07D0\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_DAY_OF_WEEK\" member=\"Clock.GetCurrentDayOfWeek\">\n  游戏内星期几（整型）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07D0 GET_CURRENT_DAY_OF_WEEK\n      out: day\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local day = getCurrentDayOfWeek()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const day = Clock.getCurrentDayOfWeek()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 日 / 月 [#日--月]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0835\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_DATE\" member=\"Clock.GetCurrentDate\">\n  游戏内日、月。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0835 GET_CURRENT_DATE\n      out: day, month\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local day, month = getCurrentDate()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { day, month } = Clock.getCurrentDate()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 推进一天 [#推进一天]\n\n<Opcode id=\"088E\" name=\"SET_TIME_ONE_DAY_FORWARD\" member=\"Clock.SetTimeOneDayForward\">\n  推进到下一天。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      088E SET_TIME_ONE_DAY_FORWARD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTimeOneDayForward()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Clock.setTimeOneDayForward()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 对话 Conversation (/docs/cleo/sa/default/conversation)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 11 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 开始配置 [#开始配置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0717\" name=\"START_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION\" member=\"Conversation.StartSettingUp\">\n  开始配置与玩家的对话，并清掉旧行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0717 START_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startSettingUpConversation(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.startSettingUp(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束配置 [#结束配置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0719\" name=\"FINISH_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION\" member=\"Conversation.FinishSettingUp\">\n  结束 `0717` 配置；选项字幕会显示。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0719 FINISH_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      finishSettingUpConversation()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.finishSettingUp()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在节点 [#是否在节点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"071A\" name=\"IS_CONVERSATION_AT_NODE\" member=\"Conversation.IsAtNode\">\n  对话是否在指定节点。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      071A IS_CONVERSATION_AT_NODE\n      in: handle, speech\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isConversationAtNode(handle, speech) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Conversation.isAtNode(handle, speech)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位置是否合适 [#位置是否合适]\n\n<Opcode id=\"089B\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_IN_POSITION_FOR_CONVERSATION\" member=\"Conversation.IsPlayerInPosition\">\n  双方是否在对话且能互相交流。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      089B IS_PLAYER_IN_POSITION_FOR_CONVERSATION\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isPlayerInPositionForConversation(handle) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Conversation.isPlayerInPosition(handle)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开关对话 [#开关对话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"089C\" name=\"ENABLE_CONVERSATION\" member=\"Conversation.Enable\">\n  暂停 / 恢复该角色的脚本对话。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      089C ENABLE_CONVERSATION\n      in: handle, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableConversation(handle, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.enable(handle, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清角色对话 [#清角色对话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08ED\" name=\"CLEAR_CONVERSATION_FOR_CHAR\" member=\"Conversation.ClearForChar\">\n  清掉该角色上的对话。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08ED CLEAR_CONVERSATION_FOR_CHAR\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearConversationForChar(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.clearForChar(handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 节点 + 语音 [#节点--语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A4\" name=\"SET_UP_CONVERSATION_NODE_WITH_SPEECH\" member=\"Conversation.SetUpNodeWithSpeech\">\n  配置节点：问 / 正 / 负 GXT 与语音短语。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A4 SET_UP_CONVERSATION_NODE_WITH_SPEECH\n      in: question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionPhrase, positiveAnswerPhrase, negativeAnswerPhrase\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setUpConversationNodeWithSpeech(question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionPhrase, positiveAnswerPhrase, negativeAnswerPhrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.setUpNodeWithSpeech(question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionPhrase, positiveAnswerPhrase, negativeAnswerPhrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束节点 + 语音 [#结束节点--语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09AA\" name=\"SET_UP_CONVERSATION_END_NODE_WITH_SPEECH\" member=\"Conversation.SetUpEndNodeWithSpeech\">\n  结束节点的语音短语。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09AA SET_UP_CONVERSATION_END_NODE_WITH_SPEECH\n      in: text, phrase\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setUpConversationEndNodeWithSpeech(text, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.setUpEndNodeWithSpeech(text, phrase)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 节点 + 脚本语音 [#节点--脚本语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A18\" name=\"SET_UP_CONVERSATION_NODE_WITH_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\" member=\"Conversation.SetUpNodeWithScriptedSpeech\">\n  用脚本语音 ID（`03CF` 一类）加对话行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A18 SET_UP_CONVERSATION_NODE_WITH_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\n      in: question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionSoundId, positiveAnswerSoundId, negativeAnswerSoundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setUpConversationNodeWithScriptedSpeech(question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionSoundId, positiveAnswerSoundId, negativeAnswerSoundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.setUpNodeWithScriptedSpeech(question, positiveAnswer, negativeAnswer, questionSoundId, positiveAnswerSoundId, negativeAnswerSoundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束节点 + 脚本语音 [#结束节点--脚本语音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A3C\" name=\"SET_UP_CONVERSATION_END_NODE_WITH_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\" member=\"Conversation.SetUpEndNodeWithScriptedSpeech\">\n  结束节点的脚本语音 ID。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A3C SET_UP_CONVERSATION_END_NODE_WITH_SCRIPTED_SPEECH\n      in: speech, speechSoundId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setUpConversationEndNodeWithScriptedSpeech(speech, speechSoundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.setUpEndNodeWithScriptedSpeech(speech, speechSoundId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束配置无字幕 [#结束配置无字幕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A47\" name=\"FINISH_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION_NO_SUBTITLES\" member=\"Conversation.FinishSettingUpNoSubtitles\">\n  结束 `0717` 配置；选项不显示字幕。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A47 FINISH_SETTING_UP_CONVERSATION_NO_SUBTITLES\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      finishSettingUpConversationNoSubtitles()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Conversation.finishSettingUpNoSubtitles()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 吊车 Crane (/docs/cleo/sa/default/crane)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 6 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 港区起重机 [#港区起重机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"079D\" name=\"PLAYER_ENTERED_DOCK_CRANE\" member=\"Crane.PlayerEnteredDockCrane\">\n  玩家进入圣辉港区起重机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      079D PLAYER_ENTERED_DOCK_CRANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playerEnteredDockCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.playerEnteredDockCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 工地起重机 [#工地起重机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"079E\" name=\"PLAYER_ENTERED_BUILDINGSITE_CRANE\" member=\"Crane.PlayerEnteredBuildingsiteCrane\">\n  玩家进入圣辉工地起重机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      079E PLAYER_ENTERED_BUILDINGSITE_CRANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playerEnteredBuildingsiteCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.playerEnteredBuildingsiteCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 离开起重机 [#离开起重机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"079F\" name=\"PLAYER_LEFT_CRANE\" member=\"Crane.PlayerLeftCrane\">\n  玩家离开当前起重机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      079F PLAYER_LEFT_CRANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playerLeftCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.playerLeftCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 矿场起重机 [#矿场起重机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07F9\" name=\"PLAYER_ENTERED_QUARRY_CRANE\" member=\"Crane.PlayerEnteredQuarryCrane\">\n  玩家进入矿场起重机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07F9 PLAYER_ENTERED_QUARRY_CRANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playerEnteredQuarryCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.playerEnteredQuarryCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 拉斯维加斯起重机 [#拉斯维加斯起重机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07FA\" name=\"PLAYER_ENTERED_LAS_VEGAS_CRANE\" member=\"Crane.PlayerEnteredLasVegasCrane\">\n  玩家进入拉斯维加斯工地起重机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07FA PLAYER_ENTERED_LAS_VEGAS_CRANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      playerEnteredLasVegasCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.playerEnteredLasVegasCrane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开关控制 [#开关控制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0898\" name=\"ENABLE_CRANE_CONTROLS\" member=\"Crane.EnableControls\">\n  开关起重机各控制（升 / 降 / 放）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0898 ENABLE_CRANE_CONTROLS\n      in: up, down, release\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableCraneControls(up, down, release)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Crane.enableControls(up, down, release)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 过场 Cutscene (/docs/cleo/sa/default/cutscene)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 10 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 设偏移 [#设偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0244\" name=\"SET_CUTSCENE_OFFSET\" member=\"Cutscene.SetOffset\">\n  设过场偏移原点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0244 SET_CUTSCENE_OFFSET\n      in: x, y, z\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCutsceneOffset(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Cutscene.setOffset(x, y, z)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加载 [#加载]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E4\" name=\"LOAD_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Cutscene.Load\">\n  加载指定过场数据。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E4 LOAD_CUTSCENE\n      in: name\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      loadCutscene(name)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Cutscene.load(name)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开始 [#开始]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E7\" name=\"START_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Cutscene.Start\">\n  开始播放已加载过场（`02E4`）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E7 START_CUTSCENE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      startCutscene()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Cutscene.start()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 播放时间 [#播放时间]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E8\" name=\"GET_CUTSCENE_TIME\" member=\"Cutscene.GetTime\">\n  过场开始后经过的毫秒数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E8 GET_CUTSCENE_TIME\n      out: time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local t = getCutsceneTime()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const time = Cutscene.getTime()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否播完 [#是否播完]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02E9\" name=\"HAS_CUTSCENE_FINISHED\" member=\"Cutscene.HasFinished\">\n  过场是否播完。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02E9 HAS_CUTSCENE_FINISHED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if hasCutsceneFinished() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Cutscene.hasFinished()) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除 [#清除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02EA\" name=\"CLEAR_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Cutscene.Clear\">\n  结束当前过场并释放内存。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02EA CLEAR_CUTSCENE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCutscene()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Cutscene.clear()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否跳过 [#是否跳过]\n\n<Opcode id=\"056A\" name=\"WAS_CUTSCENE_SKIPPED\" member=\"Cutscene.WasSkipped\">\n  玩家是否跳过了过场。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      056A WAS_CUTSCENE_SKIPPED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if wasCutsceneSkipped() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Cutscene.wasSkipped()) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否加载完 [#是否加载完]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06B9\" name=\"HAS_CUTSCENE_LOADED\" member=\"Cutscene.HasLoaded\">\n  过场数据是否加载完成。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06B9 HAS_CUTSCENE_LOADED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if hasCutsceneLoaded() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Cutscene.hasLoaded()) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取偏移 [#取偏移]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D1\" name=\"GET_CUTSCENE_OFFSET\" member=\"Cutscene.GetOffset\">\n  取当前已加载过场的偏移。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D1 GET_CUTSCENE_OFFSET\n      out: xOffset, yOffset, zOffset\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local x, y, z = getCutsceneOffset()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { xOffset, yOffset, zOffset } = Cutscene.getOffset()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 追加到下一过场 [#追加到下一过场]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08F0\" name=\"APPEND_TO_NEXT_CUTSCENE\" member=\"Cutscene.AppendToNext\">\n  把物体名 / 动画名追加到下一过场。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08F0 APPEND_TO_NEXT_CUTSCENE\n      in: objectName, animName\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      appendToNextCutscene(objectName, animName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Cutscene.appendToNext(objectName, animName)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 调试 Debugger (/docs/cleo/sa/default/debugger)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 5 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 调试行 [#调试行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0052\" name=\"LINE\" member=\"Debugger.Line\">\n  屏上显示 6 个浮点（调试行）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0052 LINE\n      in: f1, f2, f3, f4, f5, f6\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      line(f1, f2, f3, f4, f5, f6)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Debugger.line(f1, f2, f3, f4, f5, f6)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开调试 [#开调试]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00C3\" name=\"DEBUG_ON\" member=\"Debugger.Enable\">\n  打开本脚本调试特性。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00C3 DEBUG_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      debugOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Debugger.enable()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关调试 [#关调试]\n\n<Opcode id=\"00C4\" name=\"DEBUG_OFF\" member=\"Debugger.Disable\">\n  关闭本脚本调试特性。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      00C4 DEBUG_OFF\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      debugOff()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Debugger.disable()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 调试相机 [#调试相机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05A0\" name=\"IS_DEBUG_CAMERA_ON\" member=\"Debugger.IsDebugCameraOn\">\n  调试相机是否开启。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05A0 IS_DEBUG_CAMERA_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isDebugCameraOn() then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Debugger.isDebugCameraOn()) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 写调试文件 [#写调试文件]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05B6\" name=\"SAVE_STRING_TO_DEBUG_FILE\" member=\"Debugger.SaveStringToDebugFile\">\n  把字符串写入调试文件。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05B6 SAVE_STRING_TO_DEBUG_FILE\n      in: msg\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      saveStringToDebugFile(msg)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Debugger.saveStringToDebugFile(msg)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 决策器 DecisionMaker (/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmaker)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 2 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 删除 [#删除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"065C\" name=\"REMOVE_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMaker.Remove\">\n  删除决策器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      065C REMOVE_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeDecisionMaker(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DecisionMaker.remove(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否存在 [#是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F2\" name=\"DOES_DECISION_MAKER_EXIST\" member=\"DecisionMaker.DoesExist\">\n  handle 是否是有效决策器。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F2 DOES_DECISION_MAKER_EXIST\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if doesDecisionMakerExist(handle) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (DecisionMaker.doesExist(handle)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 角色决策 DecisionMakerChar (/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmakerchar)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 5 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 加载 [#加载]\n\n<Opcode id=\"060A\" name=\"LOAD_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMakerChar.Load\">\n  加载角色决策器（进任务清理表；否则 `065C` 释放）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      060A LOAD_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: type\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = loadCharDecisionMaker(type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DecisionMakerChar.load(type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清事件响应 [#清事件响应]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0708\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\" member=\"DecisionMakerChar.ClearEventResponse\">\n  清掉决策器对某事件的响应。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0708 CLEAR_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\n      in: self, event\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharDecisionMakerEventResponse(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DecisionMakerChar.clearEventResponse(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加事件响应 [#加事件响应]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0709\" name=\"ADD_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\" member=\"DecisionMakerChar.AddEventResponse\">\n  按事件配置角色反应（任务、好感档、车内 / 步行等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0709 ADD_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\n      in: self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addCharDecisionMakerEventResponse(self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DecisionMakerChar.addEventResponse(self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 复制 [#复制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07E5\" name=\"COPY_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMakerChar.Copy\">\n  复制角色决策器数据。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07E5 COPY_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: handleOrTemplate\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = copyCharDecisionMaker(handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DecisionMakerChar.copy(handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 共享模板 [#共享模板]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0978\" name=\"COPY_SHARED_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMakerChar.CopyShared\">\n  按共享模板建实例（进任务清理表；否则 `065C` 释放）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0978 COPY_SHARED_CHAR_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: template\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = copySharedCharDecisionMaker(template)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DecisionMakerChar.copyShared(template)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 组决策 DecisionMakerGroup (/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmakergroup)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 4 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 加载 [#加载]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06AE\" name=\"LOAD_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMakerGroup.Load\">\n  加载给角色组用的决策器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06AE LOAD_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: type\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = loadGroupDecisionMaker(type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DecisionMakerGroup.load(type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清事件响应 [#清事件响应]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0749\" name=\"CLEAR_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\" member=\"DecisionMakerGroup.ClearEventResponse\">\n  清掉组决策器对某事件的响应。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0749 CLEAR_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\n      in: self, event\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearGroupDecisionMakerEventResponse(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DecisionMakerGroup.clearEventResponse(self, event)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加事件响应 [#加事件响应]\n\n<Opcode id=\"074A\" name=\"ADD_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\" member=\"DecisionMakerGroup.AddEventResponse\">\n  按事件配置组反应（任务、好感档、车内 / 步行等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      074A ADD_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER_EVENT_RESPONSE\n      in: self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addGroupDecisionMakerEventResponse(self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      DecisionMakerGroup.addEventResponse(self, event, taskId, respect, hate, like, dislike, inCar, onFoot)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 复制 [#复制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07E6\" name=\"COPY_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"DecisionMakerGroup.Copy\">\n  复制组决策器（进任务清理表；否则用 `065C` 释放）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07E6 COPY_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: handleOrTemplate\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = copyGroupDecisionMaker(handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = DecisionMakerGroup.copy(handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 特效 Fx (/docs/cleo/sa/default/fx)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 11 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 阴影 [#阴影]\n\n<Opcode id=\"016F\" name=\"DRAW_SHADOW\" member=\"Fx.DrawShadow\">\n  本帧画阴影。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      016F DRAW_SHADOW\n      in: textureType, x, y, z, angle, length, intensity, r, g, b\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawShadow(textureType, x, y, z, angle, length, intensity, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.drawShadow(textureType, x, y, z, angle, length, intensity, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 爆炸 [#爆炸]\n\n<Opcode id=\"020C\" name=\"ADD_EXPLOSION\" member=\"Fx.AddExplosion\">\n  在点上生成爆炸。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      020C ADD_EXPLOSION\n      in: x, y, z, type\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addExplosion(x, y, z, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addExplosion(x, y, z, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 光晕 [#光晕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"024F\" name=\"DRAW_CORONA\" member=\"Fx.DrawCorona\">\n  在坐标画带淡入淡出的光晕。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      024F DRAW_CORONA\n      in: x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawCorona(x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.drawCorona(x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 武器店光晕 [#武器店光晕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04D5\" name=\"DRAW_WEAPONSHOP_CORONA\" member=\"Fx.DrawWeaponshopCorona\">\n  低绘制距离的武器店式光晕。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04D5 DRAW_WEAPONSHOP_CORONA\n      in: x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawWeaponshopCorona(x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.drawWeaponshopCorona(x, y, z, size, coronaType, flareType, r, g, b)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 静音爆炸 [#静音爆炸]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0565\" name=\"ADD_EXPLOSION_NO_SOUND\" member=\"Fx.AddExplosionNoSound\">\n  静音爆炸。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0565 ADD_EXPLOSION_NO_SOUND\n      in: x, y, z, type\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addExplosionNoSound(x, y, z, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addExplosionNoSound(x, y, z, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 枪口闪光 [#枪口闪光]\n\n<Opcode id=\"058A\" name=\"ADD_BIG_GUN_FLASH\" member=\"Fx.AddBigGunFlash\">\n  枪口闪光粒子（从点到点）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      058A ADD_BIG_GUN_FLASH\n      in: fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addBigGunFlash(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addBigGunFlash(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 火花 [#火花]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08EB\" name=\"ADD_SPARKS\" member=\"Fx.AddSparks\">\n  单次火花喷发。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08EB ADD_SPARKS\n      in: x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addSparks(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addSparks(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 带震爆炸 [#带震爆炸]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0948\" name=\"ADD_EXPLOSION_VARIABLE_SHAKE\" member=\"Fx.AddExplosionVariableShake\">\n  爆炸并指定屏幕震动强度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0948 ADD_EXPLOSION_VARIABLE_SHAKE\n      in: x, y, z, type, shake\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addExplosionVariableShake(x, y, z, type, shake)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addExplosionVariableShake(x, y, z, type, shake)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 烟雾粒子 [#烟雾粒子]\n\n<Opcode id=\"095C\" name=\"ADD_SMOKE_PARTICLE\" member=\"Fx.AddSmokeParticle\">\n  生成烟雾粒子。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      095C ADD_SMOKE_PARTICLE\n      in: x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, red, green, blue, alpha, size, lastFactor\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addSmokeParticle(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, red, green, blue, alpha, size, lastFactor)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addSmokeParticle(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, red, green, blue, alpha, size, lastFactor)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 喷血 [#喷血]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B8\" name=\"ADD_BLOOD\" member=\"Fx.AddBlood\">\n  喷血与地面血迹。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B8 ADD_BLOOD\n      in: x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addBlood(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.addBlood(x, y, z, velocityX, velocityY, velocityZ, density, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 有色光 [#有色光]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E5\" name=\"DRAW_LIGHT_WITH_RANGE\" member=\"Fx.DrawLightWithRange\">\n  在点周围画有色光（半径）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E5 DRAW_LIGHT_WITH_RANGE\n      in: x, y, z, red, green, blue, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawLightWithRange(x, y, z, red, green, blue, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Fx.drawLightWithRange(x, y, z, red, green, blue, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 游戏 Game (/docs/cleo/sa/default/game)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 83 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 最高通缉上限 [#最高通缉上限]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01F0\" name=\"SET_MAX_WANTED_LEVEL\" member=\"Game.SetMaxWantedLevel\">\n  玩家可达到的最高通缉等级。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01F0 SET_MAX_WANTED_LEVEL\n      in: wantedLevel\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMaxWantedLevel(wantedLevel)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setMaxWantedLevel(wantedLevel)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 警察无视玩家 [#警察无视玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01F7\" name=\"SET_POLICE_IGNORE_PLAYER\" member=\"Game.SetPoliceIgnorePlayer\">\n  警察是否无视玩家（与通缉无关）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01F7 SET_POLICE_IGNORE_PLAYER\n      in: player, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPoliceIgnorePlayer(player, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setPoliceIgnorePlayer(player, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 隐藏包裹总数 [#隐藏包裹总数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02ED\" name=\"SET_COLLECTABLE1_TOTAL\" member=\"Game.SetCollectableTotal\">\n  隐藏包裹总数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02ED SET_COLLECTABLE1_TOTAL\n      in: amount\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCollectable1Total(amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setCollectableTotal(amount)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 喷漆免费 [#喷漆免费]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0335\" name=\"SET_FREE_RESPRAYS\" member=\"Game.SetFreeResprays\">\n  喷漆店是否免费。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0335 SET_FREE_RESPRAYS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setFreeResprays(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setFreeResprays(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 行人无视玩家 [#行人无视玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03BF\" name=\"SET_EVERYONE_IGNORE_PLAYER\" member=\"Game.SetEveryoneIgnorePlayer\">\n  行人是否无视玩家。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03BF SET_EVERYONE_IGNORE_PLAYER\n      in: player, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setEveryoneIgnorePlayer(player, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setEveryoneIgnorePlayer(player, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 通缉敏感度 [#通缉敏感度]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C7\" name=\"SET_WANTED_MULTIPLIER\" member=\"Game.SetWantedMultiplier\">\n  犯罪敏感度（多少罪才招警察）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C7 SET_WANTED_MULTIPLIER\n      in: multiplier\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setWantedMultiplier(multiplier)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setWantedMultiplier(multiplier)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 弹出存档菜单 [#弹出存档菜单]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D8\" name=\"ACTIVATE_SAVE_MENU\" member=\"Game.ActivateSaveMenu\">\n  下一帧弹出存档菜单。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D8 ACTIVATE_SAVE_MENU\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activateSaveMenu()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.activateSaveMenu()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 存档是否完成 [#存档是否完成]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03D9\" name=\"HAS_SAVE_GAME_FINISHED\" member=\"Game.HasSaveGameFinished\">\n  用在 if：存档菜单请求后是否已处理完（未弹出完为假）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03D9 HAS_SAVE_GAME_FINISHED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasSaveGameFinished()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.hasSaveGameFinished()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 全车可受伤 [#全车可受伤]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03F4\" name=\"SET_ALL_CARS_CAN_BE_DAMAGED\" member=\"Game.SetAllCarsCanBeDamaged\">\n  是否所有车可受伤。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03F4 SET_ALL_CARS_CAN_BE_DAMAGED\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAllCarsCanBeDamaged(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setAllCarsCanBeDamaged(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否德语版 [#是否德语版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"040C\" name=\"IS_GERMAN_GAME\" member=\"Game.IsGerman\">\n  用在 if：语言是否为德语。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      040C IS_GERMAN_GAME\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGermanGame()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isGerman()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否公制 [#是否公制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0424\" name=\"ARE_MEASUREMENTS_IN_METRES\" member=\"Game.AreMeasurementsInMeters\">\n  用在 if：是否公制（米而非英尺）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0424 ARE_MEASUREMENTS_IN_METRES\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      areMeasurementsInMetres()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.areMeasurementsInMeters()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否用过作弊 [#是否用过作弊]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0445\" name=\"ARE_ANY_CAR_CHEATS_ACTIVATED\" member=\"Game.AreAnyCarCheatsActivated\">\n  用在 if：是否用过任何作弊。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0445 ARE_ANY_CAR_CHEATS_ACTIVATED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      areAnyCarCheatsActivated()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.areAnyCarCheatsActivated()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否 PC 版 [#是否-pc-版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0485\" name=\"IS_PC_VERSION\" member=\"Game.IsPcVersion\">\n  用在 if：是否 PC 版。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0485 IS_PC_VERSION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPcVersion()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isPcVersion()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取通缉上限 [#取通缉上限]\n\n<Opcode id=\"050F\" name=\"GET_MAX_WANTED_LEVEL\" member=\"Game.GetMaxWantedLevel\">\n  取最高通缉上限。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      050F GET_MAX_WANTED_LEVEL\n      out: level\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local level = getMaxWantedLevel()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.getMaxWantedLevel()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 出租带氮气 [#出租带氮气]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0572\" name=\"SET_ALL_TAXIS_HAVE_NITRO\" member=\"Game.SetAllTaxisHaveNitro\">\n  是否所有出租车带氮气。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0572 SET_ALL_TAXIS_HAVE_NITRO\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAllTaxisHaveNitro(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setAllTaxisHaveNitro(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 体育场雷达灰 [#体育场雷达灰]\n\n<Opcode id=\"057E\" name=\"SET_PLAYER_IS_IN_STADIUM\" member=\"Game.SetIsInStadium\">\n  雷达变灰（体育场等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      057E SET_PLAYER_IS_IN_STADIUM\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlayerIsInStadium(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setIsInStadium(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否澳洲版 [#是否澳洲版]\n\n<Opcode id=\"059A\" name=\"IS_AUSTRALIAN_GAME\" member=\"Game.IsAustralian\">\n  用在 if：是否澳洲版。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      059A IS_AUSTRALIAN_GAME\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isAustralianGame()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isAustralian()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 洛圣都暴乱 [#洛圣都暴乱]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06C8\" name=\"SET_LA_RIOTS\" member=\"Game.SetLaRiots\">\n  开关洛圣都暴乱效果。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06C8 SET_LA_RIOTS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLaRiots(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setLaRiots(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 应急车辆 [#应急车辆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06D0\" name=\"SWITCH_EMERGENCY_SERVICES\" member=\"Game.SwitchEmergencyServices\">\n  是否刷应急车辆。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06D0 SWITCH_EMERGENCY_SERVICES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchEmergencyServices(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchEmergencyServices(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机火车 [#随机火车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06D7\" name=\"SWITCH_RANDOM_TRAINS\" member=\"Game.SwitchRandomTrains\">\n  是否生成火车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06D7 SWITCH_RANDOM_TRAINS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchRandomTrains(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchRandomTrains(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 双人最大距离 [#双人最大距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06F1\" name=\"LIMIT_TWO_PLAYER_DISTANCE\" member=\"Game.LimitTwoPlayerDistance\">\n  双人模式玩家最大距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06F1 LIMIT_TWO_PLAYER_DISTANCE\n      in: distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      limitTwoPlayerDistance(distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.limitTwoPlayerDistance(distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 解除双人距离 [#解除双人距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06F2\" name=\"RELEASE_TWO_PLAYER_DISTANCE\" member=\"Game.ReleaseTwoPlayerDistance\">\n  解除双人距离限制。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06F2 RELEASE_TWO_PLAYER_DISTANCE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      releaseTwoPlayerDistance()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.releaseTwoPlayerDistance()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 双人互瞄 [#双人互瞄]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06F3\" name=\"SET_PLAYER_PLAYER_TARGETTING\" member=\"Game.SetPlayerPlayerTargeting\">\n  双人是否可互瞄。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06F3 SET_PLAYER_PLAYER_TARGETTING\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlayerPlayerTargetting(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setPlayerPlayerTargeting(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 双人分乘 [#双人分乘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06FA\" name=\"SET_PLAYERS_CAN_BE_IN_SEPARATE_CARS\" member=\"Game.SetPlayersCanBeInSeparateCars\">\n  双人任务是否可分乘不同车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06FA SET_PLAYERS_CAN_BE_IN_SEPARATE_CARS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlayersCanBeInSeparateCars(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setPlayersCanBeInSeparateCars(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 警用摩托 [#警用摩托]\n\n<Opcode id=\"072C\" name=\"SWITCH_COPS_ON_BIKES\" member=\"Game.SwitchCopsOnBikes\">\n  是否禁止刷警用摩托及骑手。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      072C SWITCH_COPS_ON_BIKES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchCopsOnBikes(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchCopsOnBikes(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设置 ped 关系 [#设置-ped-关系]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0746\" name=\"SET_RELATIONSHIP\" member=\"Game.SetRelationship\">\n  设置两类 pedtype 之间关系。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0746 SET_RELATIONSHIP\n      in: relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setRelationship(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setRelationship(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除 ped 关系 [#清除-ped-关系]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0747\" name=\"CLEAR_RELATIONSHIP\" member=\"Game.ClearRelationship\">\n  清除 pedtype 关系。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0747 CLEAR_RELATIONSHIP\n      in: relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearRelationship(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.clearRelationship(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 51 区导弹 [#51-区导弹]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07A8\" name=\"SET_AREA51_SAM_SITE\" member=\"Game.SetArea51SamSite\">\n  开关 51 区防空导弹。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07A8 SET_AREA51_SAM_SITE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setArea51SamSite(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setArea51SamSite(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关系是否已设 [#关系是否已设]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07E8\" name=\"IS_RELATIONSHIP_SET\" member=\"Game.IsRelationshipSet\">\n  用在 if：指定 pedtype 关系是否已设。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07E8 IS_RELATIONSHIP_SET\n      in: relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isRelationshipSet(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isRelationshipSet(relationshipType, ofPedType, toPedType)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否双人模式 [#是否双人模式]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0800\" name=\"IS_2PLAYER_GAME_GOING_ON\" member=\"Game.Is2PlayerGameGoingOn\">\n  用在 if：是否双人模式。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0800 IS_2PLAYER_GAME_GOING_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      is2playerGameGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.is2PlayerGameGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 火蔓延上限 [#火蔓延上限]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0828\" name=\"SET_MAX_FIRE_GENERATIONS\" member=\"Game.SetMaxFireGenerations\">\n  火势蔓延时最多生成多少火（配合 02CF）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0828 SET_MAX_FIRE_GENERATIONS\n      in: limit\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMaxFireGenerations(limit)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setMaxFireGenerations(limit)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 室内刷行人 [#室内刷行人]\n\n<Opcode id=\"084D\" name=\"ACTIVATE_INTERIOR_PEDS\" member=\"Game.ActivateInteriorPeds\">\n  室内是否刷行人。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      084D ACTIVATE_INTERIOR_PEDS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activateInteriorPeds(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.activateInteriorPeds(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 入口小组跟随 [#入口小组跟随]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0864\" name=\"ENABLE_ENTRY_EXIT_PLAYER_GROUP_WARPING\" member=\"Game.EnableEntryExitPlayerGroupWarping\">\n  坐标半径内开关入口标记（小组跟随）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0864 ENABLE_ENTRY_EXIT_PLAYER_GROUP_WARPING\n      in: x, y, radius, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableEntryExitPlayerGroupWarping(x, y, radius, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.enableEntryExitPlayerGroupWarping(x, y, radius, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 程序化室内 [#程序化室内]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0867\" name=\"IS_PROCEDURAL_INTERIOR_ACTIVE\" member=\"Game.IsProceduralInteriorActive\">\n  用在 if：程序化室内是否激活。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0867 IS_PROCEDURAL_INTERIOR_ACTIVE\n      in: areaId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isProceduralInteriorActive(areaId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isProceduralInteriorActive(areaId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 帮战开关 [#帮战开关]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0879\" name=\"SET_GANG_WARS_ACTIVE\" member=\"Game.SetGangWarsActive\">\n  是否可开帮战。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0879 SET_GANG_WARS_ACTIVE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGangWarsActive(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setGangWarsActive(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在帮战 [#是否在帮战]\n\n<Opcode id=\"087A\" name=\"IS_GANG_WAR_GOING_ON\" member=\"Game.IsGangWarGoingOn\">\n  用在 if：是否正在帮战。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      087A IS_GANG_WAR_GOING_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGangWarGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isGangWarGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 任务中可帮战 [#任务中可帮战]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A3\" name=\"CAN_TRIGGER_GANG_WAR_WHEN_ON_A_MISSION\" member=\"Game.CanTriggerGangWarWhenOnAMission\">\n  任务中是否可挑起地盘战。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A3 CAN_TRIGGER_GANG_WAR_WHEN_ON_A_MISSION\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      canTriggerGangWarWhenOnAMission(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.canTriggerGangWarWhenOnAMission(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 3D 标记更远 [#3d-标记更远]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08A8\" name=\"SET_ALWAYS_DRAW_3D_MARKERS\" member=\"Game.SetAlwaysDraw3DMarkers\">\n  实体头顶标记更远可见。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08A8 SET_ALWAYS_DRAW_3D_MARKERS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAlwaysDraw3DMarkers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setAlwaysDraw3DMarkers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 帮战训练任务 [#帮战训练任务]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08AC\" name=\"SET_GANG_WARS_TRAINING_MISSION\" member=\"Game.SetGangWarsTrainingMission\">\n  地图/雷达不亮帮派地盘（训练任务）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08AC SET_GANG_WARS_TRAINING_MISSION\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGangWarsTrainingMission(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setGangWarsTrainingMission(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 夜视 [#夜视]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B1\" name=\"SET_NIGHT_VISION\" member=\"Game.SetNightVision\">\n  夜视效果。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B1 SET_NIGHT_VISION\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setNightVision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setNightVision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 热成像 [#热成像]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B2\" name=\"SET_INFRARED_VISION\" member=\"Game.SetInfraredVision\">\n  热成像效果。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B2 SET_INFRARED_VISION\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setInfraredVision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setInfraredVision(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 死亡没收 [#死亡没收]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08DD\" name=\"SWITCH_DEATH_PENALTIES\" member=\"Game.SwitchDeathPenalties\">\n  送医是否没收武器与物品。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08DD SWITCH_DEATH_PENALTIES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchDeathPenalties(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchDeathPenalties(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 被捕没收 [#被捕没收]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08DE\" name=\"SWITCH_ARREST_PENALTIES\" member=\"Game.SwitchArrestPenalties\">\n  被捕是否没收武器与物品。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08DE SWITCH_ARREST_PENALTIES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchArrestPenalties(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchArrestPenalties(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 刷帮派成员 [#刷帮派成员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08EA\" name=\"SET_CREATE_RANDOM_GANG_MEMBERS\" member=\"Game.SetCreateRandomGangMembers\">\n  是否刷帮派成员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08EA SET_CREATE_RANDOM_GANG_MEMBERS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCreateRandomGangMembers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setCreateRandomGangMembers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 招募人数上限 [#招募人数上限]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08F4\" name=\"SET_SCRIPT_LIMIT_TO_GANG_SIZE\" member=\"Game.SetScriptLimitToGangSize\">\n  玩家可招募人数上限。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08F4 SET_SCRIPT_LIMIT_TO_GANG_SIZE\n      in: maxSize\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setScriptLimitToGangSize(maxSize)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setScriptLimitToGangSize(maxSize)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 全区可帮战 [#全区可帮战]\n\n<Opcode id=\"090D\" name=\"CLEAR_SPECIFIC_ZONES_TO_TRIGGER_GANG_WAR\" member=\"Game.ClearSpecificZonesToTriggerGangWar\">\n  所有区域可挑起地盘战。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      090D CLEAR_SPECIFIC_ZONES_TO_TRIGGER_GANG_WAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearSpecificZonesToTriggerGangWar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.clearSpecificZonesToTriggerGangWar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 环境飞机 [#环境飞机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0923\" name=\"SWITCH_AMBIENT_PLANES\" member=\"Game.SwitchAmbientPlanes\">\n  开关环境飞机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0923 SWITCH_AMBIENT_PLANES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchAmbientPlanes(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchAmbientPlanes(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 按声望可招人数 [#按声望可招人数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0956\" name=\"FIND_MAX_NUMBER_OF_GROUP_MEMBERS\" member=\"Game.FindMaxNumberOfGroupMembers\">\n  按当前声望可招募人数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0956 FIND_MAX_NUMBER_OF_GROUP_MEMBERS\n      out: maxNum\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local maxNum = findMaxNumberOfGroupMembers()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.findMaxNumberOfGroupMembers()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 警用直升机 [#警用直升机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"096A\" name=\"SWITCH_POLICE_HELIS\" member=\"Game.SwitchPoliceHelis\">\n  是否刷警用直升机。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      096A SWITCH_POLICE_HELIS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchPoliceHelis(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchPoliceHelis(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 强制死亡重启 [#强制死亡重启]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0970\" name=\"FORCE_DEATH_RESTART\" member=\"Game.ForceDeathRestart\">\n  强制死亡重启流程（医院重生等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0970 FORCE_DEATH_RESTART\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      forceDeathRestart()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.forceDeathRestart()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 复活共用后果 [#复活共用后果]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0974\" name=\"RESET_STUFF_UPON_RESURRECTION\" member=\"Game.ResetStuffUponResurrection\">\n  模拟死亡/被捕的共用后果。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0974 RESET_STUFF_UPON_RESURRECTION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      resetStuffUponResurrection()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.resetStuffUponResurrection()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 只刷帮派 [#只刷帮派]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0983\" name=\"SET_ONLY_CREATE_GANG_MEMBERS\" member=\"Game.SetOnlyCreateGangMembers\">\n  是否到处刷帮派（类似作弊）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0983 SET_ONLY_CREATE_GANG_MEMBERS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setOnlyCreateGangMembers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setOnlyCreateGangMembers(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 暴乱枪声感知 [#暴乱枪声感知]\n\n<Opcode id=\"098A\" name=\"SET_GUNSHOT_SENSE_RANGE_FOR_RIOT2\" member=\"Game.SetGunshotSenseRangeForRiot2\">\n  暴乱对枪声的感知距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      098A SET_GUNSHOT_SENSE_RANGE_FOR_RIOT2\n      in: range\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGunshotSenseRangeForRiot2(range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setGunshotSenseRangeForRiot2(range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## enex 标志 [#enex-标志]\n\n<Opcode id=\"098E\" name=\"SET_NAMED_ENTRY_EXIT_FLAG\" member=\"Game.SetNamedEntryExitFlag\">\n  设置指定 enex 标志。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      098E SET_NAMED_ENTRY_EXIT_FLAG\n      in: name, flag, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setNamedEntryExitFlag(name, flag, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setNamedEntryExitFlag(name, flag, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 夜视是否开 [#夜视是否开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"099D\" name=\"IS_NIGHT_VISION_ACTIVE\" member=\"Game.IsNightVisionActive\">\n  用在 if：夜视是否开着。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      099D IS_NIGHT_VISION_ACTIVE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isNightVisionActive()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isNightVisionActive()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 刷随机警察 [#刷随机警察]\n\n<Opcode id=\"099E\" name=\"SET_CREATE_RANDOM_COPS\" member=\"Game.SetCreateRandomCops\">\n  是否刷随机警察。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      099E SET_CREATE_RANDOM_COPS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCreateRandomCops(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setCreateRandomCops(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 室内也显示光点 [#室内也显示光点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A6\" name=\"SHOW_BLIPS_ON_ALL_LEVELS\" member=\"Game.ShowBlipsOnAllLevels\">\n  室内时实体光点是否显示在雷达/地图。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A6 SHOW_BLIPS_ON_ALL_LEVELS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      showBlipsOnAllLevels(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.showBlipsOnAllLevels(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 隐藏前端光点 [#隐藏前端光点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09AC\" name=\"HIDE_ALL_FRONTEND_BLIPS\" member=\"Game.HideAllFrontendBlips\">\n  隐藏前端全部光点。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09AC HIDE_ALL_FRONTEND_BLIPS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hideAllFrontendBlips(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.hideAllFrontendBlips(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 小游戏进行中 [#小游戏进行中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BD\" name=\"SET_MINIGAME_IN_PROGRESS\" member=\"Game.SetMinigameInProgress\">\n  禁止其它脚本显示帮助。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BD SET_MINIGAME_IN_PROGRESS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMinigameInProgress(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setMinigameInProgress(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否小游戏禁帮助 [#是否小游戏禁帮助]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BE\" name=\"IS_MINIGAME_IN_PROGRESS\" member=\"Game.IsMinigameInProgress\">\n  用在 if：是否有脚本用 09BD 禁了帮助。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BE IS_MINIGAME_IN_PROGRESS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isMinigameInProgress()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isMinigameInProgress()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 强制随机车型 [#强制随机车型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BF\" name=\"SET_FORCE_RANDOM_CAR_MODEL\" member=\"Game.SetForceRandomCarModel\">\n  强制刷出的车都用该模型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BF SET_FORCE_RANDOM_CAR_MODEL\n      in: modelId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setForceRandomCarModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setForceRandomCarModel(modelId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 字幕是否开 [#字幕是否开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09C8\" name=\"ARE_SUBTITLES_SWITCHED_ON\" member=\"Game.AreSubtitlesSwitchedOn\">\n  用在 if：设置里字幕是否开启。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09C8 ARE_SUBTITLES_SWITCHED_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      areSubtitlesSwitchedOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.areSubtitlesSwitchedOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 环境犯罪 [#环境犯罪]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09D2\" name=\"ENABLE_AMBIENT_CRIME\" member=\"Game.EnableAmbientCrime\">\n  警察是否追杀罪犯任务。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09D2 ENABLE_AMBIENT_CRIME\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableAmbientCrime(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.enableAmbientCrime(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车库挂起通缉 [#车库挂起通缉]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09D4\" name=\"CLEAR_WANTED_LEVEL_IN_GARAGE\" member=\"Game.ClearWantedLevelInGarage\">\n  挂起当前通缉。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09D4 CLEAR_WANTED_LEVEL_IN_GARAGE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearWantedLevelInGarage()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.clearWantedLevelInGarage()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 帮派空位 [#帮派空位]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09DD\" name=\"MAKE_ROOM_IN_PLAYER_GANG_FOR_MISSION_PEDS\" member=\"Game.MakeRoomInPlayerGangForMissionPeds\">\n  保证玩家帮派还能再加人的空位。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09DD MAKE_ROOM_IN_PLAYER_GANG_FOR_MISSION_PEDS\n      in: _p1\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      makeRoomInPlayerGangForMissionPeds(_p1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.makeRoomInPlayerGangForMissionPeds(_p1)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 航母导弹 [#航母导弹]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E4\" name=\"SET_AIRCRAFT_CARRIER_SAM_SITE\" member=\"Game.SetAircraftCarrierSamSite\">\n  开关航母导弹（圣辉海军站）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E4 SET_AIRCRAFT_CARRIER_SAM_SITE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAircraftCarrierSamSite(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setAircraftCarrierSamSite(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 入室 enex [#入室-enex]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09E6\" name=\"ENABLE_BURGLARY_HOUSES\" member=\"Game.EnableBurglaryHouses\">\n  开关入室任务用的 enex 标记。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09E6 ENABLE_BURGLARY_HOUSES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enableBurglaryHouses(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.enableBurglaryHouses(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 禁行人搭话 [#禁行人搭话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F5\" name=\"SHUT_ALL_CHARS_UP\" member=\"Game.ShutAllCharsUp\">\n  禁止行人找玩家搭话。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F5 SHUT_ALL_CHARS_UP\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      shutAllCharsUp(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.shutAllCharsUp(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 双人拷武器 [#双人拷武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09F8\" name=\"DO_WEAPON_STUFF_AT_START_OF_2P_GAME\" member=\"Game.DoWeaponStuffAtStartOf2PGame\">\n  合作任务：P1 武器拷给 P2。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09F8 DO_WEAPON_STUFF_AT_START_OF_2P_GAME\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      doWeaponStuffAtStartOf2PGame()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.doWeaponStuffAtStartOf2PGame()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 刚退出菜单 [#刚退出菜单]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09FA\" name=\"HAS_GAME_JUST_RETURNED_FROM_FRONTEND\" member=\"Game.HasGameJustReturnedFromFrontend\">\n  用在 if：上一帧刚退出菜单。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09FA HAS_GAME_JUST_RETURNED_FROM_FRONTEND\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasGameJustReturnedFromFrontend()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.hasGameJustReturnedFromFrontend()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 当前语言 [#当前语言]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09FB\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_LANGUAGE\" member=\"Game.GetCurrentLanguage\">\n  菜单语言设置当前语言。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09FB GET_CURRENT_LANGUAGE\n      out: languageSlot\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local languageSlot = getCurrentLanguage()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.getCurrentLanguage()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否在地盘战 [#是否在地盘战]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A03\" name=\"IS_GANG_WAR_FIGHTING_GOING_ON\" member=\"Game.IsGangWarFightingGoingOn\">\n  用在 if：是否挑起/防守地盘战。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A03 IS_GANG_WAR_FIGHTING_GOING_ON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGangWarFightingGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isGangWarFightingGoingOn()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 语言是否变了 [#语言是否变了]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A0F\" name=\"HAS_LANGUAGE_CHANGED\" member=\"Game.HasLanguageChanged\">\n  用在 if：语言设置相对上次是否变了。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A0F HAS_LANGUAGE_CHANGED\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasLanguageChanged()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.hasLanguageChanged()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清理人口 [#清理人口]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A13\" name=\"MANAGE_ALL_POPULATION\" member=\"Game.ManageAllPopulation\">\n  清远处无用物体与世界 dummy。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A13 MANAGE_ALL_POPULATION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      manageAllPopulation()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.manageAllPopulation()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 禁喷漆店 [#禁喷漆店]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A14\" name=\"SET_NO_RESPRAYS\" member=\"Game.SetNoResprays\">\n  禁止喷漆店对玩家开门。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A14 SET_NO_RESPRAYS\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setNoResprays(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setNoResprays(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否宽屏 [#是否宽屏]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A2B\" name=\"IS_WIDESCREEN_ON_IN_OPTIONS\" member=\"Game.IsWidescreenOnInOptions\">\n  用在 if：显示设置是否宽屏。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A2B IS_WIDESCREEN_ON_IN_OPTIONS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isWidescreenOnInOptions()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isWidescreenOnInOptions()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关全部车灯 [#关全部车灯]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A37\" name=\"FORCE_ALL_VEHICLE_LIGHTS_OFF\" member=\"Game.ForceAllVehicleLightsOff\">\n  开启时不渲染任何车灯。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A37 FORCE_ALL_VEHICLE_LIGHTS_OFF\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      forceAllVehicleLightsOff(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.forceAllVehicleLightsOff(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 嫖妓反过来给钱 [#嫖妓反过来给钱]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A3D\" name=\"ACTIVATE_PIMP_CHEAT\" member=\"Game.ActivatePimpCheat\">\n  嫖妓是否反过来给钱。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A3D ACTIVATE_PIMP_CHEAT\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activatePimpCheat(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.activatePimpCheat(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 脚本合作标志 [#脚本合作标志]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A3F\" name=\"SET_SCRIPT_COOP_GAME\" member=\"Game.SetScriptCoopGame\">\n  设未用标志（地址 0x96A8A8）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A3F SET_SCRIPT_COOP_GAME\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setScriptCoopGame(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.setScriptCoopGame(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取消嫖妓 [#取消嫖妓]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A43\" name=\"GET_RID_OF_PLAYER_PROSTITUTE\" member=\"Game.GetRidOfPlayerProstitute\">\n  取消嫖妓邀请并让当前妓女离开。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A43 GET_RID_OF_PLAYER_PROSTITUTE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getRidOfPlayerProstitute()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.getRidOfPlayerProstitute()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体 brain 组 [#物体-brain-组]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A46\" name=\"SWITCH_OBJECT_BRAINS\" member=\"Game.SwitchObjectBrains\">\n  开关指定分组（0929）的物体触发。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A46 SWITCH_OBJECT_BRAINS\n      in: groupingId, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchObjectBrains(groupingId, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.switchObjectBrains(groupingId, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 宽屏可暂停 [#宽屏可暂停]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A48\" name=\"ALLOW_PAUSE_IN_WIDESCREEN\" member=\"Game.AllowPauseInWidescreen\">\n  宽屏时仍可进暂停菜单。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A48 ALLOW_PAUSE_IN_WIDESCREEN\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      allowPauseInWidescreen(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.allowPauseInWidescreen(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否手柄 [#是否手柄]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A4B\" name=\"IS_PC_USING_JOYPAD\" member=\"Game.IsPcUsingJoypad\">\n  用在 if：操控是手柄而非键鼠。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A4B IS_PC_USING_JOYPAD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPcUsingJoypad()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Game.isPcUsingJoypad()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 帮派 Gang (/docs/cleo/sa/default/gang)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 1 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 帮派三武器 [#帮派三武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0237\" name=\"SET_GANG_WEAPONS\" member=\"Gang.SetWeapons\">\n  设帮派可用的三把武器类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0237 SET_GANG_WEAPONS\n      in: gangId, weaponType1, weaponType2, weaponType3\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGangWeapons(gangId, weaponType1, weaponType2, weaponType3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Gang.setWeapons(gangId, weaponType1, weaponType2, weaponType3)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 车库 Garage (/docs/cleo/sa/default/garage)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 9 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 任务车库目标车 [#任务车库目标车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"021B\" name=\"SET_TARGET_CAR_FOR_MISSION_GARAGE\" member=\"Garage.SetTargetCarForMission\">\n  任务车库只认指定车。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      021B SET_TARGET_CAR_FOR_MISSION_GARAGE\n      in: garageName, vehicle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTargetCarForMissionGarage(garageName, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.setTargetCarForMission(garageName, vehicle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 激活 [#激活]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0299\" name=\"ACTIVATE_GARAGE\" member=\"Garage.Activate\">\n  激活车库。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0299 ACTIVATE_GARAGE\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activateGarage(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.activate(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 停用 [#停用]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02B9\" name=\"DEACTIVATE_GARAGE\" member=\"Garage.Deactivate\">\n  停用车库。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02B9 DEACTIVATE_GARAGE\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      deactivateGarage(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.deactivate(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 改类型 [#改类型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02FA\" name=\"CHANGE_GARAGE_TYPE\" member=\"Garage.ChangeType\">\n  改车库类型。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02FA CHANGE_GARAGE_TYPE\n      in: garageId, type\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeGarageType(garageId, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.changeType(garageId, type)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 开门 [#开门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0360\" name=\"OPEN_GARAGE\" member=\"Garage.Open\">\n  开车库门。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0360 OPEN_GARAGE\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      openGarage(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.open(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 关门 [#关门]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0361\" name=\"CLOSE_GARAGE\" member=\"Garage.Close\">\n  关车库门。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0361 CLOSE_GARAGE\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      closeGarage(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.close(garageId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否打开 [#是否打开]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03B0\" name=\"IS_GARAGE_OPEN\" member=\"Garage.IsOpen\">\n  门是否打开。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03B0 IS_GARAGE_OPEN\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isGarageOpen(garageId) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Garage.isOpen(garageId)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否关闭 [#是否关闭]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03B1\" name=\"IS_GARAGE_CLOSED\" member=\"Garage.IsClosed\">\n  门是否关闭。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03B1 IS_GARAGE_CLOSED\n      in: garageId\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if isGarageClosed(garageId) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Garage.isClosed(garageId)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 喷漆免费 [#喷漆免费]\n\n<Opcode id=\"093A\" name=\"SET_GARAGE_RESPRAY_FREE\" member=\"Garage.SetResprayFree\">\n  喷漆是否免费。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      093A SET_GARAGE_RESPRAY_FREE\n      in: garageId, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGarageResprayFree(garageId, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Garage.setResprayFree(garageId, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 小组 Group (/docs/cleo/sa/default/group)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 12 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建 [#创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"062F\" name=\"CREATE_GROUP\" member=\"Group.Create\">\n  创建角色组（可统一指挥多名角色）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      062F CREATE_GROUP\n      in: defaultTaskAllocator\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createGroup(defaultTaskAllocator)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Group.create(defaultTaskAllocator)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设组长 [#设组长]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0630\" name=\"SET_GROUP_LEADER\" member=\"Group.SetLeader\">\n  设组长。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0630 SET_GROUP_LEADER\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupLeader(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setLeader(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加组员 [#加组员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0631\" name=\"SET_GROUP_MEMBER\" member=\"Group.SetMember\">\n  加人作组员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0631 SET_GROUP_MEMBER\n      in: self, handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupMember(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setMember(self, handle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 释放 [#释放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0632\" name=\"REMOVE_GROUP\" member=\"Group.Remove\">\n  释放组。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0632 REMOVE_GROUP\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      removeGroup(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.remove(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 决策器 [#决策器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06AD\" name=\"SET_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\" member=\"Group.SetDecisionMaker\">\n  设组决策器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06AD SET_GROUP_DECISION_MAKER\n      in: self, handleOrTemplate\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupDecisionMaker(self, handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setDecisionMaker(self, handleOrTemplate)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 分离距离 [#分离距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"06F0\" name=\"SET_GROUP_SEPARATION_RANGE\" member=\"Group.SetSeparationRange\">\n  组员离组长多远会被踢出组。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      06F0 SET_GROUP_SEPARATION_RANGE\n      in: self, range\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupSeparationRange(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setSeparationRange(self, range)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 默认任务分配 [#默认任务分配]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07B3\" name=\"SET_GROUP_DEFAULT_TASK_ALLOCATOR\" member=\"Group.SetDefaultTaskAllocator\">\n  设默认任务分配器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07B3 SET_GROUP_DEFAULT_TASK_ALLOCATOR\n      in: self, defaultTaskAllocator\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupDefaultTaskAllocator(self, defaultTaskAllocator)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setDefaultTaskAllocator(self, defaultTaskAllocator)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 组规模 [#组规模]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07F6\" name=\"GET_GROUP_SIZE\" member=\"Group.GetSize\">\n  取组长数与组员数。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07F6 GET_GROUP_SIZE\n      in: self\n      out: numLeaders, numMembers\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local numLeaders, numMembers = getGroupSize(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { numLeaders, numMembers } = Group.getSize(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否存在 [#是否存在]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07FD\" name=\"DOES_GROUP_EXIST\" member=\"Group.DoesExist\">\n  handle 是否有效组。用在 `if` 里。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07FD DOES_GROUP_EXIST\n      in: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      if doesGroupExist(handle) then\n      end\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      if (Group.doesExist(handle)) {\n      }\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 组序列 [#组序列]\n\n<Opcode id=\"087D\" name=\"SET_GROUP_SEQUENCE\" member=\"Group.SetSequence\">\n  组员默认任务序列。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      087D SET_GROUP_SEQUENCE\n      in: self, sequence\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupSequence(self, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setSequence(self, sequence)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取组员 [#取组员]\n\n<Opcode id=\"092B\" name=\"GET_GROUP_MEMBER\" member=\"Group.GetMember\">\n  取第 n 个组员。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      092B GET_GROUP_MEMBER\n      in: self, slotId\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = getGroupMember(self, slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Group.getMember(self, slotId)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随上车 [#跟随上车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0940\" name=\"SET_GROUP_FOLLOW_STATUS\" member=\"Group.SetFollowStatus\">\n  组长上车时组员是否跟着上。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0940 SET_GROUP_FOLLOW_STATUS\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGroupFollowStatus(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Group.setFollowStatus(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 直升机 Heli (/docs/cleo/sa/default/heli)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 18 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 飞向坐标 [#飞向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A2\" name=\"HELI_GOTO_COORDS\" member=\"Heli.GotoCoords\">\n  直升机飞向坐标，高度夹在 min/max。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A2 HELI_GOTO_COORDS\n      in: self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      heliGotoCoords(self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.gotoCoords(self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 强制朝向 [#强制朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04D0\" name=\"SET_HELI_ORIENTATION\" member=\"Heli.SetOrientation\">\n  强制机头相对北向角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04D0 SET_HELI_ORIENTATION\n      in: self, angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHeliOrientation(self, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.setOrientation(self, angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取消朝向 [#取消朝向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04D1\" name=\"CLEAR_HELI_ORIENTATION\" member=\"Heli.ClearOrientation\">\n  取消 `04D0` 强制朝向。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04D1 CLEAR_HELI_ORIENTATION\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearHeliOrientation(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.clearOrientation(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 稳定器 [#稳定器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04DF\" name=\"SET_HELI_STABILISER\" member=\"Heli.SetStabiliser\">\n  限制倾斜幅度。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04DF SET_HELI_STABILISER\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHeliStabiliser(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.setStabiliser(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 猎手火炮 [#猎手火炮]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0541\" name=\"FIRE_HUNTER_GUN\" member=\"Heli.FireHunterGun\">\n  猎手直升机开火炮。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0541 FIRE_HUNTER_GUN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      fireHunterGun(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.fireHunterGun(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 模拟坠毁 [#模拟坠毁]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0564\" name=\"MAKE_HELI_COME_CRASHING_DOWN\" member=\"Heli.MakeComeCrashingDown\">\n  模拟坠毁；高空途中可能爆炸。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0564 MAKE_HELI_COME_CRASHING_DOWN\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      makeHeliComeCrashingDown(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.makeComeCrashingDown(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 攻击玩家 [#攻击玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0724\" name=\"HELI_ATTACK_PLAYER\" member=\"Heli.AttackPlayer\">\n  在半径内追打当前玩家。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0724 HELI_ATTACK_PLAYER\n      in: self, handle, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      heliAttackPlayer(self, handle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.attackPlayer(self, handle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 跟随实体 [#跟随实体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0726\" name=\"HELI_FOLLOW_ENTITY\" member=\"Heli.FollowEntity\">\n  空中跟随角色或载具。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0726 HELI_FOLLOW_ENTITY\n      in: self, char, vehicle, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      heliFollowEntity(self, char, vehicle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.followEntity(self, char, vehicle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 警用追逐 [#警用追逐]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0727\" name=\"POLICE_HELI_CHASE_ENTITY\" member=\"Heli.ChaseEntity\">\n  警用直升机在半径内猎杀角色 / 载具。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0727 POLICE_HELI_CHASE_ENTITY\n      in: self, char, vehicle, radius\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      policeHeliChaseEntity(self, char, vehicle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.chaseEntity(self, char, vehicle, radius)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 着陆 [#着陆]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0743\" name=\"HELI_LAND_AT_COORDS\" member=\"Heli.LandAtCoords\">\n  在坐标着陆，高度限幅。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0743 HELI_LAND_AT_COORDS\n      in: self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      heliLandAtCoords(self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.landAtCoords(self, x, y, z, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 保持视野 [#保持视野]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0780\" name=\"HELI_KEEP_ENTITY_IN_VIEW\" member=\"Heli.KeepEntityInView\">\n  保持目标角色 / 载具在视野内。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0780 HELI_KEEP_ENTITY_IN_VIEW\n      in: self, char, vehicle, minAltitude, maxAltitude\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      heliKeepEntityInView(self, char, vehicle, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.keepEntityInView(self, char, vehicle, minAltitude, maxAltitude)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 绞盘 [#绞盘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0788\" name=\"ATTACH_WINCH_TO_HELI\" member=\"Heli.AttachWinch\">\n  挂 / 卸绞盘。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0788 ATTACH_WINCH_TO_HELI\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      attachWinchToHeli(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.attachWinch(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 释放绞盘 [#释放绞盘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0789\" name=\"RELEASE_ENTITY_FROM_WINCH\" member=\"Heli.ReleaseEntityFromWinch\">\n  释放绞盘上的实体。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0789 RELEASE_ENTITY_FROM_WINCH\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      releaseEntityFromWinch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.releaseEntityFromWinch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取绞盘实体 [#取绞盘实体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"078B\" name=\"GRAB_ENTITY_ON_WINCH\" member=\"Heli.GrabEntityOnWinch\">\n  取磁铁 / 绞盘上挂着的人 / 车 / 物。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      078B GRAB_ENTITY_ON_WINCH\n      in: self\n      out: char, vehicle, object\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local char, vehicle, object = grabEntityOnWinch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { char, vehicle, object } = Heli.grabEntityOnWinch(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 额外推力 [#额外推力]\n\n<Opcode id=\"07BB\" name=\"ACTIVATE_HELI_SPEED_CHEAT\" member=\"Heli.ActivateSpeedCheat\">\n  额外推力。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      07BB ACTIVATE_HELI_SPEED_CHEAT\n      in: self, power\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activateHeliSpeedCheat(self, power)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.activateSpeedCheat(self, power)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 旋翼满速 [#旋翼满速]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0825\" name=\"SET_HELI_BLADES_FULL_SPEED\" member=\"Heli.SetBladesFullSpeed\">\n  旋翼立刻满速。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0825 SET_HELI_BLADES_FULL_SPEED\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHeliBladesFullSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.setBladesFullSpeed(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 到达距离 [#到达距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0853\" name=\"SET_HELI_REACHED_TARGET_DISTANCE\" member=\"Heli.SetReachedTargetDistance\">\n  设到达目标判定距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0853 SET_HELI_REACHED_TARGET_DISTANCE\n      in: self, distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setHeliReachedTargetDistance(self, distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.setReachedTargetDistance(self, distance)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 静音 [#静音]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A1C\" name=\"DISABLE_HELI_AUDIO\" member=\"Heli.DisableAudio\">\n  静音直升机音效。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A1C DISABLE_HELI_AUDIO\n      in: self, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      disableHeliAudio(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Heli.disableAudio(self, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 界面 Hud (/docs/cleo/sa/default/hud)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 24 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 屏上计时 [#屏上计时]\n\n<Opcode id=\"014E\" name=\"DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_TIMER\" member=\"Hud.DisplayTimer\">\n  屏上倒计时 / 正计时。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      014E DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_TIMER\n      in: timer, direction\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayOnscreenTimer(timer, direction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayTimer(timer, direction)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清计时 [#清计时]\n\n<Opcode id=\"014F\" name=\"CLEAR_ONSCREEN_TIMER\" member=\"Hud.ClearTimer\">\n  移除屏上计时。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      014F CLEAR_ONSCREEN_TIMER\n      in: timer\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearOnscreenTimer(timer)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.clearTimer(timer)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清计数 [#清计数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0151\" name=\"CLEAR_ONSCREEN_COUNTER\" member=\"Hud.ClearCounter\">\n  移除屏上计数（`0150` / `03C4`）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0151 CLEAR_ONSCREEN_COUNTER\n      in: counter\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearOnscreenCounter(counter)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.clearCounter(counter)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 宽银幕 [#宽银幕]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02A3\" name=\"SWITCH_WIDESCREEN\" member=\"Hud.SwitchWidescreen\">\n  开关宽银幕黑边。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02A3 SWITCH_WIDESCREEN\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      switchWidescreen(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.switchWidescreen(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 画精灵 [#画精灵]\n\n<Opcode id=\"038D\" name=\"DRAW_SPRITE\" member=\"Hud.DrawSprite\">\n  画已加载精灵（`038F`）：位置、尺寸、RGBA。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      038D DRAW_SPRITE\n      in: spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, r, g, b, a\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawSprite(spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, r, g, b, a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.drawSprite(spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, r, g, b, a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 画矩形 [#画矩形]\n\n<Opcode id=\"038E\" name=\"DRAW_RECT\" member=\"Hud.DrawRect\">\n  画矩形色块。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      038E DRAW_RECT\n      in: x, y, width, height, r, g, b, a\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawRect(x, y, width, height, r, g, b, a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.drawRect(x, y, width, height, r, g, b, a)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 冻结计时 [#冻结计时]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0396\" name=\"FREEZE_ONSCREEN_TIMER\" member=\"Hud.FreezeTimer\">\n  冻结屏上计时更新。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0396 FREEZE_ONSCREEN_TIMER\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      freezeOnscreenTimer(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.freezeTimer(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 带字计时 [#带字计时]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C3\" name=\"DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_TIMER_WITH_STRING\" member=\"Hud.DisplayTimerWithString\">\n  带文字的屏上计时。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C3 DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_TIMER_WITH_STRING\n      in: timer, direction, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayOnscreenTimerWithString(timer, direction, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayTimerWithString(timer, direction, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 带字计数 [#带字计数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03C4\" name=\"DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_WITH_STRING\" member=\"Hud.DisplayCounterWithString\">\n  带文字的计数器（数字或条）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03C4 DISPLAY_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_WITH_STRING\n      in: counter, display, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayOnscreenCounterWithString(counter, display, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayCounterWithString(counter, display, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 精灵先于淡入淡出 [#精灵先于淡入淡出]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03E3\" name=\"SET_SPRITES_DRAW_BEFORE_FADE\" member=\"Hud.SetSpritesDrawBeforeFade\">\n  下一次 `038D` 画在淡入淡出之前。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03E3 SET_SPRITES_DRAW_BEFORE_FADE\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setSpritesDrawBeforeFade(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.setSpritesDrawBeforeFade(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 闪 HUD [#闪-hud]\n\n<Opcode id=\"03E7\" name=\"FLASH_HUD_OBJECT\" member=\"Hud.FlashObject\">\n  闪烁某块 HUD。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      03E7 FLASH_HUD_OBJECT\n      in: object\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      flashHudObject(object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.flashObject(object)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 第 n 槽计数 [#第-n-槽计数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04F7\" name=\"DISPLAY_NTH_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_WITH_STRING\" member=\"Hud.DisplayNthCounterWithString\">\n  指定槽位的带文字计数器。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04F7 DISPLAY_NTH_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_WITH_STRING\n      in: counter, display, slot, text\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayNthOnscreenCounterWithString(counter, display, slot, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayNthCounterWithString(counter, display, slot, text)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 雷达显示 [#雷达显示]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0581\" name=\"DISPLAY_RADAR\" member=\"Hud.DisplayRadar\">\n  显示 / 隐藏雷达。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0581 DISPLAY_RADAR\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayRadar(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayRadar(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 首次闪计数 [#首次闪计数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"059C\" name=\"SET_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_FLASH_WHEN_FIRST_DISPLAYED\" member=\"Hud.SetCounterFlashWhenFirstDisplayed\">\n  计数器首次出现是否闪一下。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      059C SET_ONSCREEN_COUNTER_FLASH_WHEN_FIRST_DISPLAYED\n      in: counter, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setOnscreenCounterFlashWhenFirstDisplayed(counter, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.setCounterFlashWhenFirstDisplayed(counter, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 旋转精灵 [#旋转精灵]\n\n<Opcode id=\"074B\" name=\"DRAW_SPRITE_WITH_ROTATION\" member=\"Hud.DrawSpriteWithRotation\">\n  `038D` 扩展：带旋转角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      074B DRAW_SPRITE_WITH_ROTATION\n      in: spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, angle, red, green, blue, alpha\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawSpriteWithRotation(spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, angle, red, green, blue, alpha)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.drawSpriteWithRotation(spriteSlot, offsetLeft, offsetTop, width, height, angle, red, green, blue, alpha)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 雷达缩放 [#雷达缩放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"075B\" name=\"SET_RADAR_ZOOM\" member=\"Hud.SetRadarZoom\">\n  雷达缩放。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      075B SET_RADAR_ZOOM\n      in: zoom\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setRadarZoom(zoom)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.setRadarZoom(zoom)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## HUD 显示 [#hud-显示]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0826\" name=\"DISPLAY_HUD\" member=\"Hud.Display\">\n  显示 / 隐藏 HUD。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0826 DISPLAY_HUD\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayHud(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.display(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 倒计时滴答 [#倒计时滴答]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0890\" name=\"SET_TIMER_BEEP_COUNTDOWN_TIME\" member=\"Hud.SetTimerBeepCountdownTime\">\n  倒计时剩多少秒开始滴答。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0890 SET_TIMER_BEEP_COUNTDOWN_TIME\n      in: timer, timeInSec\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTimerBeepCountdownTime(timer, timeInSec)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.setTimerBeepCountdownTime(timer, timeInSec)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取 HUD 色 [#取-hud-色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0904\" name=\"GET_HUD_COLOUR\" member=\"Hud.GetColor\">\n  取 HUD 色表 RGBA。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0904 GET_HUD_COLOUR\n      in: color\n      out: red, green, blue, alpha\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local red, green, blue, alpha = getHudColour(color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const { red, green, blue, alpha } = Hud.getColor(color)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 画窗 [#画窗]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0937\" name=\"DRAW_WINDOW\" member=\"Hud.DrawWindow\">\n  画对角黑底样式窗 + 标题。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0937 DRAW_WINDOW\n      in: leftTopX, leftTopY, rightBottomX, rightBottomY, header, zIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawWindow(leftTopX, leftTopY, rightBottomX, rightBottomY, header, zIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.drawWindow(leftTopX, leftTopY, rightBottomX, rightBottomY, header, zIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 准星 [#准星]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09A3\" name=\"DRAW_CROSSHAIR\" member=\"Hud.DrawCrosshair\">\n  强制显示瞄准准星（如 Catalyst 任务）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09A3 DRAW_CROSSHAIR\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      drawCrosshair(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.drawCrosshair(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车名 [#车名]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09B9\" name=\"DISPLAY_CAR_NAMES\" member=\"Hud.DisplayCarNames\">\n  是否显示当前车名。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09B9 DISPLAY_CAR_NAMES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayCarNames(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayCarNames(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区名 [#区名]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09BA\" name=\"DISPLAY_ZONE_NAMES\" member=\"Hud.DisplayZoneNames\">\n  是否显示区域名。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09BA DISPLAY_ZONE_NAMES\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      displayZoneNames(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.displayZoneNames(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 强制大字 [#强制大字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09EE\" name=\"FORCE_BIG_MESSAGE_AND_COUNTER\" member=\"Hud.ForceBigMessageAndCounter\">\n  与其它大字冲突时仍强制显示计时 / 大字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09EE FORCE_BIG_MESSAGE_AND_COUNTER\n      in: state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      forceBigMessageAndCounter(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Hud.forceBigMessageAndCounter(state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# SCM 原生 default (/docs/cleo/sa/default)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令（无需额外扩展）\n\n源：SBL `sa.json` → `default`。按 class 分页。\n\nOP = 签名 `text`；调用 = [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) + [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 说明 [#说明]\n\n* 这是游戏 **default** opcode 表，不是 CLEO 扩展\n* 与 [CLEO 类型页](/docs/cleo/sa/memory) / [CLEO+](/docs/cleo/sa/plus) / [其它扩展](/docs/cleo/sa/ext) 互补\n* 完整在线库：[library.sannybuilder.com](https://library.sannybuilder.com/#/sa)\n\n## 进度 [#进度]\n\n| 状态 | 页                                    |\n| -- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 已迁 | **59 页**（58 class + misc 879 Opcode） |\n\n## 按 class [#按-class]\n\n| class              | 页                                                              |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Attractor          | [attractor](/docs/cleo/sa/default/attractor)                   |\n| Audio              | [audio](/docs/cleo/sa/default/audio)                           |\n| Blip               | [blip](/docs/cleo/sa/default/blip)                             |\n| Boat               | [boat](/docs/cleo/sa/default/boat)                             |\n| Camera             | [camera](/docs/cleo/sa/default/camera)                         |\n| Car                | [car](/docs/cleo/sa/default/car)                               |\n| CarGenerator       | [cargenerator](/docs/cleo/sa/default/cargenerator)             |\n| Char               | [char](/docs/cleo/sa/default/char)                             |\n| Checkpoint         | [checkpoint](/docs/cleo/sa/default/checkpoint)                 |\n| Clock              | [clock](/docs/cleo/sa/default/clock)                           |\n| Conversation       | [conversation](/docs/cleo/sa/default/conversation)             |\n| Crane              | [crane](/docs/cleo/sa/default/crane)                           |\n| Cutscene           | [cutscene](/docs/cleo/sa/default/cutscene)                     |\n| Debugger           | [debugger](/docs/cleo/sa/default/debugger)                     |\n| DecisionMaker      | [decisionmaker](/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmaker)           |\n| DecisionMakerChar  | [decisionmakerchar](/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmakerchar)   |\n| DecisionMakerGroup | [decisionmakergroup](/docs/cleo/sa/default/decisionmakergroup) |\n| Fx                 | [fx](/docs/cleo/sa/default/fx)                                 |\n| Game               | [game](/docs/cleo/sa/default/game)                             |\n| Gang               | [gang](/docs/cleo/sa/default/gang)                             |\n| Garage             | [garage](/docs/cleo/sa/default/garage)                         |\n| Group              | [group](/docs/cleo/sa/default/group)                           |\n| Heli               | [heli](/docs/cleo/sa/default/heli)                             |\n| Hud                | [hud](/docs/cleo/sa/default/hud)                               |\n| Math               | [math](/docs/cleo/sa/default/math)                             |\n| Menu               | [menu](/docs/cleo/sa/default/menu)                             |\n| Mission            | [mission](/docs/cleo/sa/default/mission)                       |\n| Mouse              | [mouse](/docs/cleo/sa/default/mouse)                           |\n| Object             | [object](/docs/cleo/sa/default/object)                         |\n| Pad                | [pad](/docs/cleo/sa/default/pad)                               |\n| Particle           | [particle](/docs/cleo/sa/default/particle)                     |\n| Path               | [path](/docs/cleo/sa/default/path)                             |\n| Pickup             | [pickup](/docs/cleo/sa/default/pickup)                         |\n| Plane              | [plane](/docs/cleo/sa/default/plane)                           |\n| Player             | [player](/docs/cleo/sa/default/player)                         |\n| Rc                 | [rc](/docs/cleo/sa/default/rc)                                 |\n| Restart            | [restart](/docs/cleo/sa/default/restart)                       |\n| ScriptFire         | [scriptfire](/docs/cleo/sa/default/scriptfire)                 |\n| Searchlight        | [searchlight](/docs/cleo/sa/default/searchlight)               |\n| Sequence           | [sequence](/docs/cleo/sa/default/sequence)                     |\n| Shopping           | [shopping](/docs/cleo/sa/default/shopping)                     |\n| Skip               | [skip](/docs/cleo/sa/default/skip)                             |\n| Sound              | [sound](/docs/cleo/sa/default/sound)                           |\n| Sphere             | [sphere](/docs/cleo/sa/default/sphere)                         |\n| Stat               | [stat](/docs/cleo/sa/default/stat)                             |\n| Streaming          | [streaming](/docs/cleo/sa/default/streaming)                   |\n| StreamedScript     | [streamedscript](/docs/cleo/sa/default/streamedscript)         |\n| StuckCarCheck      | [stuckcarcheck](/docs/cleo/sa/default/stuckcarcheck)           |\n| Task               | [task](/docs/cleo/sa/default/task)                             |\n| Text               | [text](/docs/cleo/sa/default/text)                             |\n| Trailer            | [trailer](/docs/cleo/sa/default/trailer)                       |\n| Train              | [train](/docs/cleo/sa/default/train)                           |\n| Txd                | [txd](/docs/cleo/sa/default/txd)                               |\n| User3dMarker       | [user3dmarker](/docs/cleo/sa/default/user3dmarker)             |\n| Weapon             | [weapon](/docs/cleo/sa/default/weapon)                         |\n| Weather            | [weather](/docs/cleo/sa/default/weather)                       |\n| World              | [world](/docs/cleo/sa/default/world)                           |\n| Zone               | [zone](/docs/cleo/sa/default/zone)                             |\n| Misc（无 class）      | [misc](/docs/cleo/sa/default/misc)                             |\n\n\n# 数学 Math (/docs/cleo/sa/default/math)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 38 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 全局整型绝对值 [#全局整型绝对值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0094\" name=\"ABS_VAR_INT\" member=\"Math.Abs\">\n  全局整型取绝对值（就地）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0094 ABS_VAR_INT\n      out: number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local number = absVarInt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.abs()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 局部整型绝对值 [#局部整型绝对值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0095\" name=\"ABS_LVAR_INT\" member=\"Math.Abs\">\n  局部整型取绝对值（就地）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0095 ABS_LVAR_INT\n      out: number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local number = absLvarInt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.abs()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 全局浮点绝对值 [#全局浮点绝对值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0096\" name=\"ABS_VAR_FLOAT\" member=\"Math.Abs\">\n  全局浮点取绝对值（就地）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0096 ABS_VAR_FLOAT\n      out: number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local number = absVarFloat()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.abs()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 局部浮点绝对值 [#局部浮点绝对值]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0097\" name=\"ABS_LVAR_FLOAT\" member=\"Math.Abs\">\n  局部浮点取绝对值（就地）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0097 ABS_LVAR_FLOAT\n      out: number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local number = absLvarFloat()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.abs()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机浮点 [#随机浮点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0098\" name=\"GENERATE_RANDOM_FLOAT\" member=\"Math.Random\">\n  随机浮点 `[0.0, 1.0)`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0098 GENERATE_RANDOM_FLOAT\n      out: float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local float = generateRandomFloat()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.random()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 随机整型 [#随机整型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0099\" name=\"GENERATE_RANDOM_INT\" member=\"Math.Random\">\n  随机整型 `0..32767`。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0099 GENERATE_RANDOM_INT\n      out: int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local int = generateRandomInt()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.random()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 平方根 [#平方根]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01FB\" name=\"SQRT\" member=\"Math.Sqrt\">\n  平方根。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01FB SQRT\n      in: num\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = sqrt(num)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.sqrt(num)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区间随机浮点 [#区间随机浮点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0208\" name=\"GENERATE_RANDOM_FLOAT_IN_RANGE\" member=\"Math.RandomFloatInRange\">\n  区间内随机浮点，含 min/max。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0208 GENERATE_RANDOM_FLOAT_IN_RANGE\n      in: min, max\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = generateRandomFloatInRange(min, max)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.randomFloatInRange(min, max)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区间随机整型 [#区间随机整型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0209\" name=\"GENERATE_RANDOM_INT_IN_RANGE\" member=\"Math.RandomIntInRange\">\n  区间内随机整型，含 min、不含 max。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0209 GENERATE_RANDOM_INT_IN_RANGE\n      in: min, max\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = generateRandomIntInRange(min, max)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.randomIntInRange(min, max)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 正弦 [#正弦]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02F6\" name=\"SIN\" member=\"Math.Sin\">\n  正弦（角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02F6 SIN\n      in: angle\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = sin(angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.sin(angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 余弦 [#余弦]\n\n<Opcode id=\"02F7\" name=\"COS\" member=\"Math.Cos\">\n  余弦（角）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      02F7 COS\n      in: angle\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = cos(angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.cos(angle)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 米转英尺 [#米转英尺]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0425\" name=\"CONVERT_METRES_TO_FEET\" member=\"Math.ConvertMetersToFeet\">\n  米 → 英尺（浮点）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0425 CONVERT_METRES_TO_FEET\n      in: meters\n      out: feet\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local feet = convertMetresToFeet(meters)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.convertMetersToFeet(meters)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 米转英尺整型 [#米转英尺整型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"042D\" name=\"CONVERT_METRES_TO_FEET_INT\" member=\"Math.ConvertMetersToFeet\">\n  米 → 英尺（整型）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      042D CONVERT_METRES_TO_FEET_INT\n      in: meters\n      out: feet\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local feet = convertMetresToFeetInt(meters)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.convertMetersToFeet(meters)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 2D 距离 [#2d-距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0509\" name=\"GET_DISTANCE_BETWEEN_COORDS_2D\" member=\"Math.GetDistanceBetweenCoords2D\">\n  两点 2D 距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0509 GET_DISTANCE_BETWEEN_COORDS_2D\n      in: fromX, fromY, toX, toZ\n      out: distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local distance = getDistanceBetweenCoords2D(fromX, fromY, toX, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.getDistanceBetweenCoords2D(fromX, fromY, toX, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 3D 距离 [#3d-距离]\n\n<Opcode id=\"050A\" name=\"GET_DISTANCE_BETWEEN_COORDS_3D\" member=\"Math.GetDistanceBetweenCoords3D\">\n  两点 3D 距离。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      050A GET_DISTANCE_BETWEEN_COORDS_3D\n      in: fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ\n      out: distance\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local distance = getDistanceBetweenCoords3D(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.getDistanceBetweenCoords3D(fromX, fromY, fromZ, toX, toY, toZ)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 2D 向量夹角 [#2d-向量夹角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05A4\" name=\"GET_ANGLE_BETWEEN_2D_VECTORS\" member=\"Math.GetAngleBetween2DVectors\">\n  两 2D 向量夹角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05A4 GET_ANGLE_BETWEEN_2D_VECTORS\n      in: x1, y1, x2, y2\n      out: angle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local angle = getAngleBetween2DVectors(x1, y1, x2, y2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.getAngleBetween2DVectors(x1, y1, x2, y2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 2D 矩形相交 [#2d-矩形相交]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05A5\" name=\"DO_2D_RECTANGLES_COLLIDE\" member=\"Math.Do2DRectanglesCollide\">\n  用在 if：两 2D 矩形是否相交/包含。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05A5 DO_2D_RECTANGLES_COLLIDE\n      in: rectangle1PositionX, rectangle1PositionY, rectangle1SizeX, rectangle1SizeY, rectangle2PositionX, rectangle2PositionY, rectangle2SizeX, rectangle2SizeY\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      do2DRectanglesCollide(rectangle1PositionX, rectangle1PositionY, rectangle1SizeX, rectangle1SizeY, rectangle2PositionX, rectangle2PositionY, rectangle2SizeX, rectangle2SizeY)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.do2DRectanglesCollide(rectangle1PositionX, rectangle1PositionY, rectangle1SizeX, rectangle1SizeY, rectangle2PositionX, rectangle2PositionY, rectangle2SizeX, rectangle2SizeY)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 2D 线段交点 [#2d-线段交点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"05B0\" name=\"GET_2D_LINES_INTERSECT_POINT\" member=\"Math.Get2DLinesIntersectPoint\">\n  两线段交点；不相交时返回 -1000000.0 且条件假。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      05B0 GET_2D_LINES_INTERSECT_POINT\n      in: line1StartX, line1StartY, line1EndX, line1EndY, line2StartX, line2StartY, line2EndX, line2EndY\n      out: intersectPointX, intersectPointY\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local intersectPointX, intersectPointY = get2DLinesIntersectPoint(line1StartX, line1StartY, line1EndX, line1EndY, line2StartX, line2StartY, line2EndX, line2EndY)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.get2DLinesIntersectPoint(line1StartX, line1StartY, line1EndX, line1EndY, line2StartX, line2StartY, line2EndX, line2EndY)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 向量朝向角 [#向量朝向角]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0604\" name=\"GET_HEADING_FROM_VECTOR_2D\" member=\"Math.GetHeadingFromVector2D\">\n  XY 偏移换朝向角。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0604 GET_HEADING_FROM_VECTOR_2D\n      in: x, y\n      out: heading\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local heading = getHeadingFromVector2D(x, y)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.getHeadingFromVector2D(x, y)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 角度归一 [#角度归一]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0656\" name=\"LIMIT_ANGLE\" member=\"Math.LimitAngle\">\n  角度归一到有效范围。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0656 LIMIT_ANGLE\n      in: value\n      out: result\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local result = limitAngle(value)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.limitAngle(value)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 全局·常量 [#位是否置位-全局常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B4\" name=\"IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_CONST\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（全局·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B4 IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGlobalVarBitSetConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 全局·变量 [#位是否置位-全局变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B5\" name=\"IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_VAR\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（全局·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B5 IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGlobalVarBitSetVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 全局·局部 [#位是否置位-全局局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B6\" name=\"IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_LVAR\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（全局·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B6 IS_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_SET_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isGlobalVarBitSetLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 局部·常量 [#位是否置位-局部常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B7\" name=\"IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_CONST\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（局部·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B7 IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isLocalVarBitSetConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 局部·变量 [#位是否置位-局部变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B8\" name=\"IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_VAR\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（局部·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B8 IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isLocalVarBitSetVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 位是否置位 局部·局部 [#位是否置位-局部局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08B9\" name=\"IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_LVAR\" member=\"Math.IsBitSet\">\n  用在 if：数的第 n 位是否置位（局部·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08B9 IS_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_SET_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isLocalVarBitSetLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.isBitSet(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 全局·常量 [#置位-全局常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BA\" name=\"SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（全局·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BA SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGlobalVarBitConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 全局·变量 [#置位-全局变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BB\" name=\"SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（全局·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BB SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGlobalVarBitVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 全局·局部 [#置位-全局局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BC\" name=\"SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（全局·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BC SET_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setGlobalVarBitLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 局部·常量 [#置位-局部常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BD\" name=\"SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（局部·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BD SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLocalVarBitConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 局部·变量 [#置位-局部变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BE\" name=\"SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（局部·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BE SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLocalVarBitVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 置位 局部·局部 [#置位-局部局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08BF\" name=\"SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\" member=\"Math.SetBit\">\n  置第 n 位（局部·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08BF SET_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLocalVarBitLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.setBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 全局·常量 [#清位-全局常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C0\" name=\"CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（全局·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C0 CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearGlobalVarBitConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 全局·变量 [#清位-全局变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C1\" name=\"CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（全局·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C1 CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearGlobalVarBitVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 全局·局部 [#清位-全局局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C2\" name=\"CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（全局·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C2 CLEAR_GLOBAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearGlobalVarBitLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 局部·常量 [#清位-局部常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C3\" name=\"CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（局部·常量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C3 CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_CONST\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearLocalVarBitConst(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 局部·变量 [#清位-局部变量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C4\" name=\"CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（局部·变量位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C4 CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_VAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearLocalVarBitVar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清位 局部·局部 [#清位-局部局部]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08C5\" name=\"CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\" member=\"Math.ClearBit\">\n  清第 n 位（局部·局部位）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08C5 CLEAR_LOCAL_VAR_BIT_LVAR\n      in: number, bitIndex\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearLocalVarBitLvar(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Math.clearBit(number, bitIndex)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 菜单 Menu (/docs/cleo/sa/default/menu)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 13 条。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 创建 [#创建]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D4\" name=\"CREATE_MENU\" member=\"Menu.Create\">\n  建屏上面板（标题、位置、列数、可否交互等）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D4 CREATE_MENU\n      in: header, topLeftX, topLeftY, width, numColumns, interactive, background, alignment\n      out: handle\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local handle = createMenu(header, topLeftX, topLeftY, width, numColumns, interactive, background, alignment)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const handle = Menu.create(header, topLeftX, topLeftY, width, numColumns, interactive, background, alignment)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 列对齐 [#列对齐]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D6\" name=\"SET_MENU_COLUMN_ORIENTATION\" member=\"Menu.SetColumnOrientation\">\n  设列对齐。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D6 SET_MENU_COLUMN_ORIENTATION\n      in: self, column, alignment\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMenuColumnOrientation(self, column, alignment)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setColumnOrientation(self, column, alignment)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 高亮行 [#高亮行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D7\" name=\"GET_MENU_ITEM_SELECTED\" member=\"Menu.GetItemSelected\">\n  当前高亮行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D7 GET_MENU_ITEM_SELECTED\n      in: self\n      out: row\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local row = getMenuItemSelected(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const row = Menu.getItemSelected(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 确认行 [#确认行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D8\" name=\"GET_MENU_ITEM_ACCEPTED\" member=\"Menu.GetItemAccepted\">\n  用冲刺键确认的最后一行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D8 GET_MENU_ITEM_ACCEPTED\n      in: self\n      out: row\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      local row = getMenuItemAccepted(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      const row = Menu.getItemAccepted(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 启停行 [#启停行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08D9\" name=\"ACTIVATE_MENU_ITEM\" member=\"Menu.ActivateItem\">\n  启用 / 禁用某一行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08D9 ACTIVATE_MENU_ITEM\n      in: self, row, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      activateMenuItem(self, row, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.activateItem(self, row, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 删除 [#删除]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08DA\" name=\"DELETE_MENU\" member=\"Menu.Delete\">\n  从屏幕移除面板。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08DA DELETE_MENU\n      in: self\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      deleteMenu(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.delete(self)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设列 [#设列]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08DB\" name=\"SET_MENU_COLUMN\" member=\"Menu.SetColumn\">\n  设一列标题与最多 12 行 GXT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08DB SET_MENU_COLUMN\n      in: self, column, title, row0, row1, row2, row3, row4, row5, row6, row7, row8, row9, row10, row11\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMenuColumn(self, column, title, row0, row1, row2, row3, row4, row5, row6, row7, row8, row9, row10, row11)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setColumn(self, column, title, row0, row1, row2, row3, row4, row5, row6, row7, row8, row9, row10, row11)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 行带一数字 [#行带一数字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08EE\" name=\"SET_MENU_ITEM_WITH_NUMBER\" member=\"Menu.SetItemWithNumber\">\n  行文本带一个数字占位。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08EE SET_MENU_ITEM_WITH_NUMBER\n      in: self, column, row, gxt, number\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMenuItemWithNumber(self, column, row, gxt, number)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setItemWithNumber(self, column, row, gxt, number)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 行带两数字 [#行带两数字]\n\n<Opcode id=\"08EF\" name=\"SET_MENU_ITEM_WITH_2_NUMBERS\" member=\"Menu.SetItemWith2Numbers\">\n  行文本带两个数字。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      08EF SET_MENU_ITEM_WITH_2_NUMBERS\n      in: self, column, row, gxt, number1, number2\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMenuItemWith2Numbers(self, column, row, gxt, number1, number2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setItemWith2Numbers(self, column, row, gxt, number1, number2)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 活动行 [#活动行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"090E\" name=\"SET_ACTIVE_MENU_ITEM\" member=\"Menu.SetActiveItem\">\n  设当前活动 / 高亮行。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      090E SET_ACTIVE_MENU_ITEM\n      in: self, row\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setActiveMenuItem(self, row)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setActiveItem(self, row)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 列宽 [#列宽]\n\n<Opcode id=\"09DB\" name=\"SET_MENU_COLUMN_WIDTH\" member=\"Menu.SetColumnWidth\">\n  设列宽。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      09DB SET_MENU_COLUMN_WIDTH\n      in: self, column, width\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setMenuColumnWidth(self, column, width)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.setColumnWidth(self, column, width)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 菜单改车色 [#菜单改车色]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A22\" name=\"CHANGE_CAR_COLOUR_FROM_MENU\" member=\"Menu.ChangeCarColor\">\n  按菜单行改车身色槽。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A22 CHANGE_CAR_COLOUR_FROM_MENU\n      in: self, vehicle, colorSlot, row\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      changeCarColourFromMenu(self, vehicle, colorSlot, row)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.changeCarColor(self, vehicle, colorSlot, row)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 高亮商品 [#高亮商品]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0A23\" name=\"HIGHLIGHT_MENU_ITEM\" member=\"Menu.HighlightItem\">\n  高亮行（常标已购商品）。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0A23 HIGHLIGHT_MENU_ITEM\n      in: self, row, state\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      highlightMenuItem(self, row, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      Menu.highlightItem(self, row, state)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n\n# 杂项 Misc (/docs/cleo/sa/default/misc)\n\n\n\n`sa` · 扩展 `default` · SCM 原生命令\n\n共 879 条（旧站头注 1173，以正文 `##` 为准）。写法见 [Lua](/docs/cleo/syntax) / [Redux](/docs/cleo/syntax-redux)。\n\n## 空操作 [#空操作]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0000\" name=\"NOP\">\n  无效果，常用来给 CLEO 脚本垫空间，规避跳转到零偏移 bug。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0000 NOP\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      nop()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"NOP\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 等待 [#等待]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0001\" name=\"WAIT\">\n  暂停脚本执行指定毫秒。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0001 WAIT\n      in: time\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      wait(time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"WAIT\", time)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 无条件跳转 [#无条件跳转]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0002\" name=\"GOTO\">\n  无条件跳转到标签。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0002 GOTO\n      in: label\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      goto(label)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GOTO\", label)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设 VAR 整型 [#设-var-整型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0004\" name=\"SET_VAR_INT\">\n  设置 VAR 整数值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0004 SET_VAR_INT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVarInt(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_VAR_INT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设 VAR 浮点 [#设-var-浮点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0005\" name=\"SET_VAR_FLOAT\">\n  设置 VAR 浮点值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0005 SET_VAR_FLOAT\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVarFloat(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_VAR_FLOAT\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设 LVAR 整型 [#设-lvar-整型]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0006\" name=\"SET_LVAR_INT\">\n  设置 LVAR 整数值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0006 SET_LVAR_INT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLvarInt(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_LVAR_INT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设 LVAR 浮点 [#设-lvar-浮点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0007\" name=\"SET_LVAR_FLOAT\">\n  设置 LVAR 浮点值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0007 SET_LVAR_FLOAT\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLvarFloat(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_LVAR_FLOAT\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## VAR 整型加 [#var-整型加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0008\" name=\"ADD_VAL_TO_INT_VAR\">\n  给 VAR 整型加值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0008 ADD_VAL_TO_INT_VAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addValToIntVar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_VAL_TO_INT_VAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## VAR 浮点加 [#var-浮点加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0009\" name=\"ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_VAR\">\n  给 VAR 浮点加值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0009 ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_VAR\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addValToFloatVar(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_VAR\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## LVAR 整型加 [#lvar-整型加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000A\" name=\"ADD_VAL_TO_INT_LVAR\">\n  给 LVAR 整型加值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000A ADD_VAL_TO_INT_LVAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addValToIntLvar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_VAL_TO_INT_LVAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## LVAR 浮点加 [#lvar-浮点加]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000B\" name=\"ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_LVAR\">\n  给 LVAR 浮点加值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000B ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_LVAR\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addValToFloatLvar(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_VAL_TO_FLOAT_LVAR\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## VAR 整型减 [#var-整型减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000C\" name=\"SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_VAR\">\n  从 VAR 整型减值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000C SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_VAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      subValFromIntVar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_VAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## VAR 浮点减 [#var-浮点减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000D\" name=\"SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_VAR\">\n  从 VAR 浮点减值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000D SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_VAR\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      subValFromFloatVar(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_VAR\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## LVAR 整型减 [#lvar-整型减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000E\" name=\"SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_LVAR\">\n  从 LVAR 整型减值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000E SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_LVAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      subValFromIntLvar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SUB_VAL_FROM_INT_LVAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## LVAR 浮点减 [#lvar-浮点减]\n\n<Opcode id=\"000F\" name=\"SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_LVAR\">\n  从 LVAR 浮点减值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      000F SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_LVAR\n      in: float, float\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      subValFromFloatLvar(float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SUB_VAL_FROM_FLOAT_LVAR\", float, float)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## VAR 整型乘 [#var-整型乘]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0010\" name=\"MULT_INT_VAR_BY_VAL\">\n  VAR 整型乘以值。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=