" name=\"GIVE_WEAPON_TO_CAR\">\n  GIVE\\_WEAPON\\_TO\\_CAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01B3 GIVE_WEAPON_TO_CAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      giveWeaponToCar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GIVE_WEAPON_TO_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设玩家当前武器 [#设玩家当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01B8\" name=\"SET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\">\n  SET\\_CURRENT\\_PLAYER\\_WEAPON。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01B8 SET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCurrentPlayerWeapon()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设车当前武器 [#设车当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01BA\" name=\"SET_CURRENT_CAR_WEAPON\">\n  SET\\_CURRENT\\_CAR\\_WEAPON。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01BA SET_CURRENT_CAR_WEAPON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCurrentCarWeapon()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CURRENT_CAR_WEAPON\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物转向坐标 [#人物转向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01BE\" name=\"TURN_CHAR_TO_FACE_COORD\">\n  TURN\\_CHAR\\_TO\\_FACE\\_COORD。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01BE TURN_CHAR_TO_FACE_COORD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      turnCharToFaceCoord()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"TURN_CHAR_TO_FACE_COORD\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家转向坐标 [#玩家转向坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01BF\" name=\"TURN_PLAYER_TO_FACE_COORD\">\n  TURN\\_PLAYER\\_TO\\_FACE\\_COORD。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01BF TURN_PLAYER_TO_FACE_COORD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      turnPlayerToFaceCoord()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"TURN_PLAYER_TO_FACE_COORD\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 不要移除车 [#不要移除车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C6\" name=\"DONT_REMOVE_CAR\">\n  DONT\\_REMOVE\\_CAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C6 DONT_REMOVE_CAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      dontRemoveCar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"DONT_REMOVE_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物步行杀人物 [#人物步行杀人物]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01C9\" name=\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ON_FOOT\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_OBJ\\_KILL\\_CHAR\\_ON\\_FOOT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01C9 SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ON_FOOT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharObjKillCharOnFoot()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ON_FOOT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物步行杀玩家 [#人物步行杀玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01CA\" name=\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_OBJ\\_KILL\\_PLAYER\\_ON\\_FOOT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01CA SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharObjKillPlayerOnFoot()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物任意方式杀人物 [#人物任意方式杀人物]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01CB\" name=\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ANY_MEANS\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_OBJ\\_KILL\\_CHAR\\_ANY\\_MEANS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      01CB SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ANY_MEANS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharObjKillCharAnyMeans()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_CHAR_ANY_MEANS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物任意方式杀玩家 [#人物任意方式杀玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"01CC\" name=\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_KILL_PLAYER_ANY_MEANS\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_OBJ\\_KILL\\_PLAYER\\_ANY\\_MEANS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\