     ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内行人加入碰撞组 [#车内行人加入碰撞组]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0278\" name=\"ADD_PEDS_IN_VEHICLE_TO_COLL\">\n  ADD\\_PEDS\\_IN\\_VEHICLE\\_TO\\_COLL。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0278 ADD_PEDS_IN_VEHICLE_TO_COLL\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addPedsInVehicleToColl()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_PEDS_IN_VEHICLE_TO_COLL\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除碰撞组 [#清除碰撞组]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0279\" name=\"CLEAR_COLL\">\n  CLEAR\\_COLL。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0279 CLEAR_COLL\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearColl()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"CLEAR_COLL\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 碰撞组是否在车内 [#碰撞组是否在车内]\n\n<Opcode id=\"027A\" name=\"IS_COLL_IN_CARS\">\n  IS\\_COLL\\_IN\\_CARS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      027A IS_COLL_IN_CARS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCollInCars()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_COLL_IN_CARS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 定位碰撞组任意 2D [#定位碰撞组任意-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"027B\" name=\"LOCATE_COLL_ANY_MEANS_2D\">\n  LOCATE\\_COLL\\_ANY\\_MEANS\\_2D。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      027B LOCATE_COLL_ANY_MEANS_2D\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateCollAnyMeans2D()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOCATE_COLL_ANY_MEANS_2D\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 定位碰撞组步行 2D [#定位碰撞组步行-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"027C\" name=\"LOCATE_COLL_ON_FOOT_2D\">\n  LOCATE\\_COLL\\_ON\\_FOOT\\_2D。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      027C LOCA