ive(\"IS_PLAYER_SITTING_IN_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家坐在任意车 [#玩家坐在任意车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0443\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_SITTING_IN_ANY_CAR\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_SITTING\\_IN\\_ANY\\_CAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0443 IS_PLAYER_SITTING_IN_ANY_CAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerSittingInAnyCar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_SITTING_IN_ANY_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设脚本火音效 [#设脚本火音效]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0444\" name=\"SET_SCRIPT_FIRE_AUDIO\">\n  SET\\_SCRIPT\\_FIRE\\_AUDIO。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0444 SET_SCRIPT_FIRE_AUDIO\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setScriptFireAudio()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_SCRIPT_FIRE_AUDIO\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否拿电话 [#玩家是否拿电话]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0447\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_LIFTING_A_PHONE\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_LIFTING\\_A\\_PHONE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0447 IS_PLAYER_LIFTING_A_PHONE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerLiftingAPhone()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_LIFTING_A_PHONE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否步行 [#玩家是否步行]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044A\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_ON\\_FOOT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044A IS_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerOnFoot()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_ON_FOOT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 带画面加载碰撞 [#带画面加载碰撞]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044C\" name=\"LOAD_COLLISION_WITH_SCREEN\">\n  LOAD\\_COLLISION\\_WITH\\_SCREEN。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044C LOAD_COLLISION_WITH_SCREEN\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      loadCollisionWithScreen()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOAD_COLLISION_WITH_SCREEN\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加载启动画面 [#加载启动画面]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044D\" name=\"LOAD_SPLASH_SCREEN\">\n  加载指定启动画面。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044D LOAD_SPLASH_SCREEN\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      loadSplashScreen()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOAD_SPLASH_SCREEN\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车忽略关卡切换 [#车忽略关卡切换]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044E\" name=\"SET_CAR_IGNORE_LEVEL_TRANSITIONS\">\n  SET\\_CAR\\_IGNORE\\_LEVEL\\_TRANSITIONS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044E SET_CAR_IGNORE_LEVEL_TRANSITIONS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarIgnoreLevelTransitions()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CAR_IGNORE_LEVEL_TRANSITIONS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加强 Craig 的车 [#加强-craig-的车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"044F\" name=\"MAKE_CRAIGS_CAR_A_BIT_STRONGER\">\n  MAKE\\_CRAIGS\\_CAR\\_A\\_BIT\\_STRONGER。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      044F MAKE_CRAIGS_CAR_A_BIT_STRONGER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      makeCraigsCarABitStronger()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"MAKE_CRAIGS_CAR_A_BIT_STRONGER\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## James 车驶向玩家 [#james-车驶向玩家]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0450\" name=\"SET_JAMES_CAR_ON_PATH_TO_PLAYER\">\n  SET\\_JAMES\\_CAR\\_ON\\_PATH\\_TO\\_PLAYER。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0450 SET_JAMES_CAR_ON_PATH_TO_PLAYER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setJamesCarOnPathToPlayer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_JAMES_CAR_ON_PATH_TO_PLAYER\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 加载结局曲 [#加载结局曲]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0451\" name=\"LOAD_END_OF_GAME_TUNE\">\n  加载结局音乐。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0451 LOAD_END_OF_GAME_TUNE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      loadEndOfGameTune()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOAD_END_OF_GAME_TUNE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 启用玩家镜头控制 [#启用玩家镜头控制]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0452\" name=\"ENABLE_PLAYER_CONTROL_CAMERA\">\n  ENABLE\\_PLAYER\\_CONTROL\\_CAMERA。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0452 ENABLE_PLAYER_CONTROL_CAMERA\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      enablePlayerControlCamera()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ENABLE_PLAYER_CONTROL_CAMERA\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取调试镜头前向 [#取调试镜头前向]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0455\" name=\"GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_FRONT_VECTOR\">\n  GET\\_DEBUG\\_CAMERA\\_FRONT\\_VECTOR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0455 GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_FRONT_VECTOR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getDebugCameraFrontVector()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_DEBUG_CAMERA_FRONT_VECTOR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否瞄准任意人物 [#玩家是否瞄准任意人物]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0456\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_TARGETTING_ANY_CHAR\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_TARGETTING\\_ANY\\_CHAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0456 IS_PLAYER_TARGETTING_ANY_CHAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerTargettingAnyChar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_TARGETTING_ANY_CHAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 结束同名全部脚本 [#结束同名全部脚本]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0459\" name=\"TERMINATE_ALL_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\">\n  结束名称（03A4）匹配给定字符串的所有脚本。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0459 TERMINATE_ALL_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\n      in: name\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      terminateAllScriptsWithThisName(name)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"TERMINATE_ALL_SCRIPTS_WITH_THIS_NAME\", name)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最近指定类型物体 [#最近指定类型物体]\n\n<Opcode id=\"045D\" name=\"GET_CLOSEST_OBJECT_OF_TYPE\">\n  无操作。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      045D GET_CLOSEST_OBJECT_OF_TYPE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getClosestObjectOfType()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_CLOSEST_OBJECT_OF_TYPE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体相对物体放置 [#物体相对物体放置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"045E\" name=\"PLACE_OBJECT_RELATIVE_TO_OBJECT\">\n  PLACE\\_OBJECT\\_RELATIVE\\_TO\\_OBJECT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      045E PLACE_OBJECT_RELATIVE_TO_OBJECT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      placeObjectRelativeToObject()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"PLACE_OBJECT_RELATIVE_TO_OBJECT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车内所有人下车 [#车内所有人下车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"045F\" name=\"SET_ALL_OCCUPANTS_OF_CAR_LEAVE_CAR\">\n  SET\\_ALL\\_OCCUPANTS\\_OF\\_CAR\\_LEAVE\\_CAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      045F SET_ALL_OCCUPANTS_OF_CAR_LEAVE_CAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setAllOccupantsOfCarLeaveCar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_ALL_OCCUPANTS_OF_CAR_LEAVE_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最近车节点朝向目标 [#最近车节点朝向目标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0461\" name=\"GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_TOWARDS_POINT\">\n  GET\\_CLOSEST\\_CAR\\_NODE\\_WITH\\_HEADING\\_TOWARDS\\_POINT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0461 GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_TOWARDS_POINT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getClosestCarNodeWithHeadingTowardsPoint()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_TOWARDS_POINT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 最近车节点背离点 [#最近车节点背离点]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0462\" name=\"GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_AWAY_POINT\">\n  GET\\_CLOSEST\\_CAR\\_NODE\\_WITH\\_HEADING\\_AWAY\\_POINT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0462 GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_AWAY_POINT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getClosestCarNodeWithHeadingAwayPoint()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_CLOSEST_CAR_NODE_WITH_HEADING_AWAY_POINT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区域内随机警察 [#区域内随机警察]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0469\" name=\"GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_AREA\">\n  在 2D 区域内随机取指定类型的执法行人。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0469 GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_AREA\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getRandomCopInArea()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_AREA\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 区域内随机警察（区） [#区域内随机警察区]\n\n<Opcode id=\"046A\" name=\"GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_ZONE\">\n  GET\\_RANDOM\\_COP\\_IN\\_ZONE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      046A GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_ZONE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getRandomCopInZone()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_RANDOM_COP_IN_ZONE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物逃离车 [#人物逃离车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"046B\" name=\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_FLEE_CAR\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_OBJ\\_FLEE\\_CAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      046B SET_CHAR_OBJ_FLEE_CAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharObjFleeCar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_OBJ_FLEE_CAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 取玩家当前武器 [#取玩家当前武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"046F\" name=\"GET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\">\n  GET\\_CURRENT\\_PLAYER\\_WEAPON。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      046F GET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getCurrentPlayerWeapon()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_CURRENT_PLAYER_WEAPON\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车手刹右转 [#车手刹右转]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0478\" name=\"SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_TURN_RIGHT\">\n  SET\\_CAR\\_HANDBRAKE\\_TURN\\_RIGHT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0478 SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_TURN_RIGHT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHandbrakeTurnRight()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_TURN_RIGHT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车手刹停车 [#车手刹停车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0479\" name=\"SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_STOP\">\n  SET\\_CAR\\_HANDBRAKE\\_STOP。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0479 SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_STOP\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarHandbrakeStop()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CAR_HANDBRAKE_STOP\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 定位狙击子弹 2D [#定位狙击子弹-2d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047B\" name=\"LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_2D\">\n  LOCATE\\_SNIPER\\_BULLET\\_2D。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047B LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_2D\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateSniperBullet2d()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_2D\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 定位狙击子弹 3D [#定位狙击子弹-3d]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047C\" name=\"LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_3D\">\n  LOCATE\\_SNIPER\\_BULLET\\_3D。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047C LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_3D\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      locateSniperBullet3d()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"LOCATE_SNIPER_BULLET_3D\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 模型座位数 [#模型座位数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047D\" name=\"GET_NUMBER_OF_SEATS_IN_MODEL\">\n  GET\\_NUMBER\\_OF\\_SEATS\\_IN\\_MODEL。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047D GET_NUMBER_OF_SEATS_IN_MODEL\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getNumberOfSeatsInModel()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_NUMBER_OF_SEATS_IN_MODEL\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否在摩托 [#玩家是否在摩托]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047E\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_ON_ANY_BIKE\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_ON\\_ANY\\_BIKE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047E IS_PLAYER_ON_ANY_BIKE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerOnAnyBike()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_ON_ANY_BIKE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物是否躺下 [#人物是否躺下]\n\n<Opcode id=\"047F\" name=\"IS_CHAR_LYING_DOWN\">\n  IS\\_CHAR\\_LYING\\_DOWN。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      047F IS_CHAR_LYING_DOWN\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isCharLyingDown()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_CHAR_LYING_DOWN\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 上车距离倍数 [#上车距离倍数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0481\" name=\"SET_ENTER_CAR_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\">\n  SET\\_ENTER\\_CAR\\_RANGE\\_MULTIPLIER。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0481 SET_ENTER_CAR_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setEnterCarRangeMultiplier()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_ENTER_CAR_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 威胁反应距离倍数 [#威胁反应距离倍数]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0482\" name=\"SET_THREAT_REACTION_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\">\n  无操作。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0482 SET_THREAT_REACTION_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setThreatReactionRangeMultiplier()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_THREAT_REACTION_RANGE_MULTIPLIER\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 人物停止攻击计时 [#人物停止攻击计时]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0483\" name=\"SET_CHAR_CEASE_ATTACK_TIMER\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_CEASE\\_ATTACK\\_TIMER。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0483 SET_CHAR_CEASE_ATTACK_TIMER\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharCeaseAttackTimer()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_CEASE_ATTACK_TIMER\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 回放 [#回放]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0486\" name=\"REPLAY\">\n  REPLAY。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0486 REPLAY\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      replay()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"REPLAY\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 是否回放中 [#是否回放中]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0487\" name=\"IS_REPLAY_PLAYING\">\n  IS\\_REPLAY\\_PLAYING。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0487 IS_REPLAY_PLAYING\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isReplayPlaying()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_REPLAY_PLAYING\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 第一个拾取物坐标 [#第一个拾取物坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"048D\" name=\"GET_FIRST_PICKUP_COORDS\">\n  GET\\_FIRST\\_PICKUP\\_COORDS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      048D GET_FIRST_PICKUP_COORDS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getFirstPickupCoords()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_FIRST_PICKUP_COORDS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 下一个拾取物坐标 [#下一个拾取物坐标]\n\n<Opcode id=\"048E\" name=\"GET_NEXT_PICKUP_COORDS\">\n  GET\\_NEXT\\_PICKUP\\_COORDS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      048E GET_NEXT_PICKUP_COORDS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getNextPickupCoords()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_NEXT_PICKUP_COORDS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否有武器 [#玩家是否有武器]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0490\" name=\"HAS_PLAYER_GOT_WEAPON\">\n  HAS\\_PLAYER\\_GOT\\_WEAPON。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0490 HAS_PLAYER_GOT_WEAPON\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      hasPlayerGotWeapon()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"HAS_PLAYER_GOT_WEAPON\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家是否面向人物 [#玩家是否面向人物]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0492\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_FACING_CHAR\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_FACING\\_CHAR。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0492 IS_PLAYER_FACING_CHAR\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerFacingChar()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_FACING_CHAR\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 坦克引爆车 [#坦克引爆车]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0493\" name=\"SET_TANK_DETONATE_CARS\">\n  SET\\_TANK\\_DETONATE\\_CARS。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0493 SET_TANK_DETONATE_CARS\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setTankDetonateCars()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_TANK_DETONATE_CARS\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车直线行驶 [#车直线行驶]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0497\" name=\"SET_CAR_DRIVE_STRAIGHT_AHEAD\">\n  SET\\_CAR\\_DRIVE\\_STRAIGHT\\_AHEAD。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0497 SET_CAR_DRIVE_STRAIGHT_AHEAD\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarDriveStraightAhead()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CAR_DRIVE_STRAIGHT_AHEAD\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 车等待 [#车等待]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0498\" name=\"SET_CAR_WAIT\">\n  SET\\_CAR\\_WAIT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0498 SET_CAR_WAIT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCarWait()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CAR_WAIT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家站在载具上 [#玩家站在载具上]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0499\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_STANDING_ON_A_VEHICLE\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_STANDING\\_ON\\_A\\_VEHICLE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0499 IS_PLAYER_STANDING_ON_A_VEHICLE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerStandingOnAVehicle()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_STANDING_ON_A_VEHICLE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家脚着地 [#玩家脚着地]\n\n<Opcode id=\"049A\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_FOOT_DOWN\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_FOOT\\_DOWN。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n  