设物体路径位置]\n\n<Opcode id=\"049F\" name=\"SET_OBJECT_PATH_POSITION\">\n  无操作。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      049F SET_OBJECT_PATH_POSITION\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setObjectPathPosition()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_OBJECT_PATH_POSITION\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 物体路径路程 [#物体路径路程]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A0\" name=\"GET_OBJECT_DISTANCE_ALONG_PATH\">\n  GET\\_OBJECT\\_DISTANCE\\_ALONG\\_PATH。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A0 GET_OBJECT_DISTANCE_ALONG_PATH\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      getObjectDistanceAlongPath()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"GET_OBJECT_DISTANCE_ALONG_PATH\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除物体路径 [#清除物体路径]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A1\" name=\"CLEAR_OBJECT_PATH\">\n  CLEAR\\_OBJECT\\_PATH。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A1 CLEAR_OBJECT_PATH\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearObjectPath()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"CLEAR_OBJECT_PATH\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 VAR 等于常量 [#整-var-等于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A3\" name=\"IS_INT_VAR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：全局变量是否等于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04A3 IS_INT_VAR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isIntVarEqualToConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_INT_VAR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 LVAR 等于常量 [#整-lvar-等于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04A4\" name=\"IS_INT_LVAR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：局部变量是否等于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      `