```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_HELI\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家在任意飞机 [#玩家在任意飞机]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AC\" name=\"IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_PLANE\">\n  IS\\_PLAYER\\_IN\\_ANY\\_PLANE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AC IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_PLANE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isPlayerInAnyPlane()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_PLAYER_IN_ANY_PLANE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 VAR 赋常量 [#整-var-赋常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AE\" name=\"SET_VAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  把全局变量赋为该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AE SET_VAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setVarIntToConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_VAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 LVAR 赋常量 [#整-lvar-赋常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04AF\" name=\"SET_LVAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  把局部变量赋为该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04AF SET_LVAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLvarIntToConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_LVAR_INT_TO_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 VAR 大于常量 [#整-var-大于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B0\" name=\"IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：全局变量是否大于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B0 IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isIntVarGreaterThanConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 LVAR 大于常量 [#整-lvar-大于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B1\" name=\"IS_INT_LVAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：局部变量是否大于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B1 IS_INT_LVAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isIntLvarGreaterThanConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_INT_LVAR_GREATER_THAN_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 常量大于整 VAR [#常量大于整-var]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B2\" name=\"IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_VAR\">\n  用在 if：该整数常量是否大于全局变量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B2 IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_VAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isConstantGreaterThanIntVar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_VAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 常量大于整 LVAR [#常量大于整-lvar]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B3\" name=\"IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_LVAR\">\n  用在 if：该整数常量是否大于局部变量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B3 IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_LVAR\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isConstantGreaterThanIntLvar(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_CONSTANT_GREATER_THAN_INT_LVAR\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 VAR 大于等于常量 [#整-var-大于等于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B4\" name=\"IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_OR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：全局变量是否大于等于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      04B4 IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_OR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\n      in: int, int\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      isIntVarGreaterOrEqualToConstant(int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"IS_INT_VAR_GREATER_OR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\", int, int)\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 整 LVAR 大于等于常量 [#整-lvar-大于等于常量]\n\n<Opcode id=\"04B5\" name=\"IS_INT_LVAR_GREATER_OR_EQUAL_TO_CONSTANT\">\n  用在 if：局部变量是否大于等于该整数常量。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n     