D_MONEY_WON_ON_GAMBLING\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      addMoneyWonOnGambling()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"ADD_MONEY_WON_ON_GAMBLING\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设最大赌博赢额 [#设最大赌博赢额]\n\n<Opcode id=\"053B\" name=\"SET_LARGEST_GAMBLING_WIN\">\n  SET\\_LARGEST\\_GAMBLING\\_WIN。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      053B SET_LARGEST_GAMBLING_WIN\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setLargestGamblingWin()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_LARGEST_GAMBLING_WIN\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 玩家组人物可战斗 [#玩家组人物可战斗]\n\n<Opcode id=\"053C\" name=\"SET_CHAR_IN_PLAYERS_GROUP_CAN_FIGHT\">\n  SET\\_CHAR\\_IN\\_PLAYERS\\_GROUP\\_CAN\\_FIGHT。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      053C SET_CHAR_IN_PLAYERS_GROUP_CAN_FIGHT\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setCharInPlayersGroupCanFight()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_CHAR_IN_PLAYERS_GROUP_CAN_FIGHT\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 清除人物等待状态 [#清除人物等待状态]\n\n<Opcode id=\"053D\" name=\"CLEAR_CHAR_WAIT_STATE\">\n  CLEAR\\_CHAR\\_WAIT\\_STATE。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      053D CLEAR_CHAR_WAIT_STATE\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      clearCharWaitState()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"CLEAR_CHAR_WAIT_STATE\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 设玩家自动瞄准 [#设玩家自动瞄准]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0540\" name=\"SET_PLAYER_AUTO_AIM\">\n  SET\\_PLAYER\\_AUTO\\_AIM。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsList>\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"OP\">\n        OP\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Lua\">\n        Lua\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n\n      <CodeBlockTabsTrigger value=\"Redux\">\n        Redux\n      </CodeBlockTabsTrigger>\n    </CodeBlockTabsList>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"OP\">\n      ```text\n      0540 SET_PLAYER_AUTO_AIM\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Lua\">\n      ```lua\n      setPlayerAutoAim()\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n\n    <CodeBlockTab value=\"Redux\">\n      ```js\n      native(\"SET_PLAYER_AUTO_AIM\")\n      ```\n    </CodeBlockTab>\n  </CodeBlockTabs>\n</Opcode>\n\n## 房产已拥有 [#房产已拥有]\n\n<Opcode id=\"0542\" name=\"SET_PROPERTY_AS_OWNED\">\n  SET\\_PROPERTY\\_AS\\_OWNED。\n\n  <CodeBlockTabs defaultValue=\"OP\">\n    <CodeBlockTabsLi